(62033, 1677, 1446, '<td valign="top">A great action shot.  I really like the way you captured the movement of that 3rd dart.  I wish the edge of the dart board wasn''t so close to center, but you really dont seem to have had any option about that.</td>', 'A great action shot.  I really like the way you captured the movement of that 3rd dart.  I wish the edge of the dart board wasn''t so close to center, but you really dont seem to have had any option about that.', '2002-05-20 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
