(62036, 1677, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the moving dart!  I am one of the other ''dart boards'' this week.  I spent a lot of time trying to make a very similar shot but my ''flights'' weren''t helping me and I did not have the correct lighting to pull it off.  Good job!!</td>', 'Nice capture of the moving dart!  I am one of the other ''dart boards'' this week.  I spent a lot of time trying to make a very similar shot but my ''flights'' weren''t helping me and I did not have the correct lighting to pull it off.  Good job!!', '2002-05-20 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62037, 1677, 885, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That really must not have been easy.  Maybe unless you put the dartboard on the ground, dropped it and then rotated it.  However you did it, it''s still a great photo.</td>', 'Wow.  That really must not have been easy.  Maybe unless you put the dartboard on the ground, dropped it and then rotated it.  However you did it, it''s still a great photo.', '2002-05-20 13:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
