(62051, 1677, 1647, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo - I hate to think how many tries it took to get the timing right...  Please don''t say "One".  Nice framing...  Oh, and not bad dart throwing although I guess it wasn''t you throwing the dart.</td>', 'Awesome photo - I hate to think how many tries it took to get the timing right...  Please don''t say "One".  Nice framing...  Oh, and not bad dart throwing although I guess it wasn''t you throwing the dart.', '2002-05-22 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
