(62054, 1677, 741, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  The blur on the head of the moving dart is great.  If I had to criticise something then it would have been nice to get more definitiopn on the point of the moving dart - could rear curtain flash have done this?  Just a quibble though - it''s still a 10.</td>', 'Excellent!  The blur on the head of the moving dart is great.  If I had to criticise something then it would have been nice to get more definitiopn on the point of the moving dart - could rear curtain flash have done this?  Just a quibble though - it''s still a 10.', '2002-05-22 11:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
