(62071, 1677, 1528, '<td valign="top">awesome shot!<br/>the only critique i coul possible suggest is that it seems a tad too far cropped on the right, a little more of the photo shown there might have been nice.<br/>great job</td>', 'awesome shot!the only critique i coul possible suggest is that it seems a tad too far cropped on the right, a little more of the photo shown there might have been nice.great job', '2002-05-27 00:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
