(62091, 1678, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like photographs of people much more than photographs of objects, which this challenge is full of. This is my favourite chess picture so far. The expression on the man''s face and extended arm are very poignant.</td>', 'I like photographs of people much more than photographs of objects, which this challenge is full of. This is my favourite chess picture so far. The expression on the man''s face and extended arm are very poignant.', '2002-05-21 22:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
