(62093, 1678, 1024, '<td valign="top">I am very fond of found photos as opposed to set up photos.  This was good timing as well.</td>', 'I am very fond of found photos as opposed to set up photos.  This was good timing as well.', '2002-05-22 03:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
