(62236, 1686, 543, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  Composition is a little tight at the top.  I''d have shot at a slightly higher angle to give the chess pieces some more room and avoid the oof leading edge of the board.  BG (carpeted wall?) is too busy, IMO.  More contrast would be good to take advantage of the B/W.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  Composition is a little tight at the top.  I''d have shot at a slightly higher angle to give the chess pieces some more room and avoid the oof leading edge of the board.  BG (carpeted wall?) is too busy, IMO.  More contrast would be good to take advantage of the B/W.', '2002-05-25 03:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
