(62238, 1686, 1585, '<td valign="top">As for this being my first photo entered on dpchallenge I am very pleased with the results. I lost to my sister by .033. And to think I was leading her all week. <br/><br/>Thank you all for the great comments and support.<br/><br/>Richard W. Pattee<br/><br/></td>', 'As for this being my first photo entered on dpchallenge I am very pleased with the results. I lost to my sister by .033. And to think I was leading her all week. Thank you all for the great comments and support.Richard W. Pattee', '2002-05-27 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 0),
