(62245, 1687, 1041, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea of combining all the popular games into one, I like that.  I would''ve preferred a litle more focus on the "black" pieces, and, as useful as the numbers/letters are for a budding chess player, I think they are a little distracting in this photo.</td>', 'Interesting idea of combining all the popular games into one, I like that.  I would''ve preferred a litle more focus on the "black" pieces, and, as useful as the numbers/letters are for a budding chess player, I think they are a little distracting in this photo.', '2002-05-20 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
