(62260, 1687, 244, '<td valign="top">You got alot of games going on here, kinda like th ieda, wouldn''t have shot it on the carpet thought, maybe try a darker background next time to keep the attention only on the subject.</td>', 'You got alot of games going on here, kinda like th ieda, wouldn''t have shot it on the carpet thought, maybe try a darker background next time to keep the attention only on the subject.', '2002-05-24 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
