(62262, 1687, 280, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a little off, interesting idea I''d love you to try and explain the rules of this game :)</td>', 'The focus seems a little off, interesting idea I''d love you to try and explain the rules of this game :)', '2002-05-26 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62263, 1687, 1, '<td valign="top">Seems a little blurred, try resting the camera on a surface if the room is dark.</td>', 'Seems a little blurred, try resting the camera on a surface if the room is dark.', '2002-05-27 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62264, 1692, 885, '<td valign="top">I thought of going to a casino but a friend convinced me they didn''t allow photographs there.  I''d also be interested to know what time you went that there weren''t people playing the slot machines.  I wonder what it would have looked like with people though.</td>', 'I thought of going to a casino but a friend convinced me they didn''t allow photographs there.  I''d also be interested to know what time you went that there weren''t people playing the slot machines.  I wonder what it would have looked like with people though.', '2002-05-20 09:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62265, 1692, 1585, '<td valign="top">Do they let you take pictures in the casino? What time did you take this.</td>', 'Do they let you take pictures in the casino? What time did you take this.', '2002-05-20 11:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62266, 1692, 1446, '<td valign="top">Surprised they let you shoot here.  I really like the concept. Giving you an extra point just for having the guts to try it.</td>', 'Surprised they let you shoot here.  I really like the concept. Giving you an extra point just for having the guts to try it.', '2002-05-20 11:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62267, 1692, 92, '<td valign="top">OK Now I have the Sizz''lin 7 fever ! This is great:)</td>', 'OK Now I have the Sizz''lin 7 fever ! This is great:)', '2002-05-20 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62268, 1692, 327, '<td valign="top">Hee, hee, that''s a game alright. :) FUN shot, good work. Hope you win a new T-bird.</td>', 'Hee, hee, that''s a game alright. :) FUN shot, good work. Hope you win a new T-bird.', '2002-05-20 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62269, 1692, 1712, '<td valign="top">That is a shiny car! CAN I HAVE IT!</td>', 'That is a shiny car! CAN I HAVE IT!', '2002-05-20 18:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62270, 1692, 1143, '<td valign="top">How did you get this picture? I don''t know of any casinos that allow cameras. I thought the slots would make a good picture.  :o)</td>', 'How did you get this picture? I don''t know of any casinos that allow cameras. I thought the slots would make a good picture.  :o)', '2002-05-21 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62271, 1692, 509, '<td valign="top">Lot of reflections here, but nothing you could do about that probably, they don''t take away from the photo though.  Nice job, did you win the car?</td>', 'Lot of reflections here, but nothing you could do about that probably, they don''t take away from the photo though.  Nice job, did you win the car?', '2002-05-21 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62272, 1692, 1078, '<td valign="top">I like how this looks like a fish eye shot, because of the way the slot machines curve around, even though it isn''t.  I''m surprised they let you take a pic in the casino -- but I also seem to remember a forum thread about something like that -- so maybe they made you stop.  The midtones here seem a little dark.  I can just barely make out some of the features that I would think should be a little more visible (like the chairs at the machines).</td>', 'I like how this looks like a fish eye shot, because of the way the slot machines curve around, even though it isn''t.  I''m surprised they let you take a pic in the casino -- but I also seem to remember a forum thread about something like that -- so maybe they made you stop.  The midtones here seem a little dark.  I can just barely make out some of the features that I would think should be a little more visible (like the chairs at the machines).', '2002-05-21 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62273, 1692, 1597, '<td valign="top">How were you able to get this shot...nice effect</td>', 'How were you able to get this shot...nice effect', '2002-05-21 21:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62274, 1692, 1726, '<td valign="top">really nice car!! although we dont have this in singapore.</td>', 'really nice car!! although we dont have this in singapore.', '2002-05-21 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62275, 1692, 113, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it is about this photo.  Maybe a cropping of the bottom black, or better lighting.</td>', 'I don''t know what it is about this photo.  Maybe a cropping of the bottom black, or better lighting.', '2002-05-22 06:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62276, 1692, 301, '<td valign="top">the post blocking the car is a hassle.  Light reflections on the car and ceiling are a bit distracting too.  Would have loved to have seen some old woman with blue hair playing the 3rd machine from the right :)</td>', 'the post blocking the car is a hassle.  Light reflections on the car and ceiling are a bit distracting too.  Would have loved to have seen some old woman with blue hair playing the 3rd machine from the right :)', '2002-05-22 07:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62277, 1692, 1054, '<td valign="top">Heh....and I thought *I* parked creatively! ;-)</td>', 'Heh....and I thought *I* parked creatively! ;-)', '2002-05-22 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62278, 1692, 1041, '<td valign="top">I''d love to win that car.  There''s no one trying though.  Strange folks.  A player at one of the stations would''ve added a little more interested to the shot IMO.  But well captured.</td>', 'I''d love to win that car.  There''s no one trying though.  Strange folks.  A player at one of the stations would''ve added a little more interested to the shot IMO.  But well captured.', '2002-05-22 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62279, 1692, 772, '<td valign="top">Not many people gambling today huh?  I was asked to leave last time i took a camera in a casino!</td>', 'Not many people gambling today huh?  I was asked to leave last time i took a camera in a casino!', '2002-05-22 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62280, 1692, 878, '<td valign="top">Monte Carlo?</td>', 'Monte Carlo?', '2002-05-22 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62281, 1692, 714, '<td valign="top">Oh ya,  Give me the money!  Nicely done.  Great framing.</td>', 'Oh ya,  Give me the money!  Nicely done.  Great framing.', '2002-05-22 18:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62282, 1692, 842, '<td valign="top">mmm.. pretty car...</td>', 'mmm.. pretty car...', '2002-05-22 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62283, 1692, 1707, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, reminds me of my wedding in Las Vegas!</td>', 'Ahhh, reminds me of my wedding in Las Vegas!', '2002-05-23 06:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62284, 1692, 1336, '<td valign="top">i think i would have liked more of a focus on a specific slot machine than the car.  also, the lighting isnt very good.  it feels like a snapshot taken as you were leaving the casino.</td>', 'i think i would have liked more of a focus on a specific slot machine than the car.  also, the lighting isnt very good.  it feels like a snapshot taken as you were leaving the casino.', '2002-05-23 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62285, 1692, 1799, '<td valign="top">Too much reflection on the top half of the photo.</td>', 'Too much reflection on the top half of the photo.', '2002-05-23 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62286, 1692, 748, '<td valign="top">Nice composition</td>', 'Nice composition', '2002-05-23 21:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62287, 1692, 543, '<td valign="top">Good exposure in a tough situation.  Did you have to get permission to shoot there?  Signpost detracts, but I don''t guess there was much you could do about it.</td>', 'Good exposure in a tough situation.  Did you have to get permission to shoot there?  Signpost detracts, but I don''t guess there was much you could do about it.', '2002-05-25 03:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62288, 1692, 1031, '<td valign="top">But I couldn''t afford to insure/drive it unless I won ANOTHER jackpot!</td>', 'But I couldn''t afford to insure/drive it unless I won ANOTHER jackpot!', '2002-05-25 21:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62289, 1692, 661, '<td valign="top">A game lots of us would like to win.  Photo is a little dark on my monitor.  And where are all the people?</td>', 'A game lots of us would like to win.  Photo is a little dark on my monitor.  And where are all the people?', '2002-05-26 20:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62290, 1692, 1, '<td valign="top">Quite the game, I feel a wider angle could''ve done somethign for your composition.</td>', 'Quite the game, I feel a wider angle could''ve done somethign for your composition.', '2002-05-27 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62291, 1692, 117, '<td valign="top">I asked security the night before if I could take pictures in the casino. He told me I could in this casino as long as I did not get up close to the slots as they were tumbling. It was earlier in the morning and security was watching me from everywhere. So the best thing I did was to go up and confront them by talking to them. It would have been nice to get the tripod out and take pictures of people but I think that would have been pushing it a bit.</td>', 'I asked security the night before if I could take pictures in the casino. He told me I could in this casino as long as I did not get up close to the slots as they were tumbling. It was earlier in the morning and security was watching me from everywhere. So the best thing I did was to go up and confront them by talking to them. It would have been nice to get the tripod out and take pictures of people but I think that would have been pushing it a bit.', '2002-05-27 09:32:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(62292, 1694, 113, '<td valign="top">I think theres just too much in this photo.  It''s nice and clear, but just wanders too far.</td>', 'I think theres just too much in this photo.  It''s nice and clear, but just wanders too far.', '2002-05-20 03:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62293, 1694, 885, '<td valign="top">I like how you used the box as a background.</td>', 'I like how you used the box as a background.', '2002-05-20 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62294, 1694, 862, '<td valign="top">Well done, but the background seems a bit dark.</td>', 'Well done, but the background seems a bit dark.', '2002-05-20 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62295, 1694, 1, '<td valign="top">The image seems too cluttered with the packaging in the back.</td>', 'The image seems too cluttered with the packaging in the back.', '2002-05-20 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62296, 1694, 1748, '<td valign="top">too cluttered, no focal point</td>', 'too cluttered, no focal point', '2002-05-20 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62297, 1694, 259, '<td valign="top">very crisp full photo.  the one thing that i would change would be the background box.  the kids on the box throw off the balance of the overall photo.  however, overall it is a really good photo.</td>', 'very crisp full photo.  the one thing that i would change would be the background box.  the kids on the box throw off the balance of the overall photo.  however, overall it is a really good photo.', '2002-05-20 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62298, 1694, 327, '<td valign="top">Great colors here, good light.</td>', 'Great colors here, good light.', '2002-05-20 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62299, 1694, 117, '<td valign="top">volleyball</td>', 'volleyball', '2002-05-20 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62300, 1694, 54, '<td valign="top">Very colorful.</td>', 'Very colorful.', '2002-05-20 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62301, 1694, 1750, '<td valign="top">Good color and composition. Personal Opinion: good enough be a commercial level photo.</td>', 'Good color and composition. Personal Opinion: good enough be a commercial level photo.', '2002-05-20 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62302, 1694, 1455, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and clarity too</td>', 'Nice colors and clarity too', '2002-05-21 09:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62303, 1694, 301, '<td valign="top">I wanna play volleyball with badminton racquets :)  I think there is just too much going on in this photo.</td>', 'I wanna play volleyball with badminton racquets :)  I think there is just too much going on in this photo.', '2002-05-21 11:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62304, 1694, 1446, '<td valign="top">I like the natural lighting here.  The colors are good. A lot going on there huh?</td>', 'I like the natural lighting here.  The colors are good. A lot going on there huh?', '2002-05-21 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62305, 1694, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen a "bird" that color before.</td>', 'I''ve never seen a "bird" that color before.', '2002-05-21 19:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62306, 1694, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice setup on this photo... I like the array of colors.. the sunlight on the right side of the volleyball is a little bright... This photo is just a tad too busy for my preferences... There is a lot to look at... I probably would have left out the instruction sheets... good job!</td>', 'Nice setup on this photo... I like the array of colors.. the sunlight on the right side of the volleyball is a little bright... This photo is just a tad too busy for my preferences... There is a lot to look at... I probably would have left out the instruction sheets... good job!', '2002-05-21 20:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62307, 1694, 640, '<td valign="top">Too busy</td>', 'Too busy', '2002-05-22 07:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62308, 1694, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice contrast of colors and a crsip shot</td>', 'nice contrast of colors and a crsip shot', '2002-05-23 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62309, 1694, 1041, '<td valign="top">Decisions, decisions . . . this gear all looks brand-new, what do you usually play?  Anyway, I like the shot.</td>', 'Decisions, decisions . . . this gear all looks brand-new, what do you usually play?  Anyway, I like the shot.', '2002-05-24 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62310, 1694, 1202, '<td valign="top">Super sharp picture with a great lay out.</td>', 'Super sharp picture with a great lay out.', '2002-05-24 19:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62311, 1694, 543, '<td valign="top">Wilson!!!  Nice colors, but much too busy, IMO.  I''d have lost the net, sideways box and instructions at the very least.</td>', 'Wilson!!!  Nice colors, but much too busy, IMO.  I''d have lost the net, sideways box and instructions at the very least.', '2002-05-26 03:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62312, 1694, 1831, '<td valign="top">Very colourful and sharp. A nice photo.</td>', 'Very colourful and sharp. A nice photo.', '2002-05-26 08:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62313, 1695, 1605, '<td valign="top">Oooooooh... a bit touchy. Are you sure the subject matter is tasteful?</td>', 'Oooooooh... a bit touchy. Are you sure the subject matter is tasteful?', '2002-05-20 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62314, 1695, 772, '<td valign="top">I''m not familiar with this game...  The quality of the photo also makes it a bit difficult to determine that this is a gun in this photo....</td>', 'I''m not familiar with this game...  The quality of the photo also makes it a bit difficult to determine that this is a gun in this photo....', '2002-05-20 08:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62315, 1695, 878, '<td valign="top">Someone plays a bit too much Quake :)</td>', 'Someone plays a bit too much Quake :)', '2002-05-20 09:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62316, 1695, 1585, '<td valign="top">The dog doesn''t even know that the game has started.</td>', 'The dog doesn''t even know that the game has started.', '2002-05-20 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62317, 1695, 1344, '<td valign="top">hahahahah</td>', 'hahahahah', '2002-05-20 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62318, 1695, 327, '<td valign="top">This was a cute idea. I''m only sorry I can''t see it a little better. [object to the right?]<br/>Still a fun idea.</td>', 'This was a cute idea. I''m only sorry I can''t see it a little better. [object to the right?]Still a fun idea.', '2002-05-20 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62319, 1695, 1446, '<td valign="top">Very cute dog.  I wish you would have made the subject of your picture a little more prevelent in the picture.  By the way.......you are a sick puppy yourself....but I suspect you knew that.......lol<br/></td>', 'Very cute dog.  I wish you would have made the subject of your picture a little more prevelent in the picture.  By the way.......you are a sick puppy yourself....but I suspect you knew that.......lol', '2002-05-20 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62320, 1695, 1041, '<td valign="top">Now there''s a new twist to games . . . clever thought!  A straight shot w/out quite as much graininess and zoomed in a little more on the subject would''ve got better ratings from me.</td>', 'Now there''s a new twist to games . . . clever thought!  A straight shot w/out quite as much graininess and zoomed in a little more on the subject would''ve got better ratings from me.', '2002-05-20 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62321, 1695, 259, '<td valign="top">haha, insaine</td>', 'haha, insaine', '2002-05-20 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62322, 1695, 203, '<td valign="top">I was just about to give you a 2 when I saw the front sight.  Nice gun-RWS?</td>', 'I was just about to give you a 2 when I saw the front sight.  Nice gun-RWS?', '2002-05-20 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62323, 1695, 633, '<td valign="top">funny.</td>', 'funny.', '2002-05-20 19:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62324, 1695, 737, '<td valign="top">While I am not a cat lover, poor ( but original) choice of subjects IMHO. Besides, the target is sleeping, not on the prowl.</td>', 'While I am not a cat lover, poor ( but original) choice of subjects IMHO. Besides, the target is sleeping, not on the prowl.', '2002-05-20 20:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62325, 1695, 616, '<td valign="top">that''s some good eat''n</td>', 'that''s some good eat''n', '2002-05-20 21:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62326, 1695, 1211, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea, looks very much like a video game.  Too bad the lighting wasn''t very good.</td>', 'Very creative idea, looks very much like a video game.  Too bad the lighting wasn''t very good.', '2002-05-21 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62327, 1695, 1143, '<td valign="top">Is that a gun? I really don''t get it even with the title.</td>', 'Is that a gun? I really don''t get it even with the title.', '2002-05-21 00:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62328, 1695, 1559, '<td valign="top">Just a little too macabre for my tastes.</td>', 'Just a little too macabre for my tastes.', '2002-05-21 07:43:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(62329, 1695, 1040, '<td valign="top">I think you play a little too much Quake there...</td>', 'I think you play a little too much Quake there...', '2002-05-21 09:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62330, 1695, 543, '<td valign="top">Is that a cat''s paw holding the rifle?  A bit noisy from underexposure, but what can you do in the dark?  Maybe a little more care in composition (dog on white something looks kind of like two dogs, something at base of railing interferes with the barrel), but I like the tilt.</td>', 'Is that a cat''s paw holding the rifle?  A bit noisy from underexposure, but what can you do in the dark?  Maybe a little more care in composition (dog on white something looks kind of like two dogs, something at base of railing interferes with the barrel), but I like the tilt.', '2002-05-21 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62331, 1695, 862, '<td valign="top">You make me laugh.  Perhaps of a little more indirect lighting on the rifle would enhance the photo.  The foreground is terribly dark.</td>', 'You make me laugh.  Perhaps of a little more indirect lighting on the rifle would enhance the photo.  The foreground is terribly dark.', '2002-05-21 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62332, 1695, 1175, '<td valign="top">That''s mean, but I won''t hold it against you.  Its an interesting shot down the barrel of the gun.  I think it might have been a little better if you were zoomed in on the dog a little more.</td>', 'That''s mean, but I won''t hold it against you.  Its an interesting shot down the barrel of the gun.  I think it might have been a little better if you were zoomed in on the dog a little more.', '2002-05-21 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62333, 1695, 1009, '<td valign="top">Scary... but cool</td>', 'Scary... but cool', '2002-05-21 17:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62334, 1695, 1037, '<td valign="top">Eeek! That better be a water pistol!</td>', 'Eeek! That better be a water pistol!', '2002-05-22 01:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62335, 1695, 301, '<td valign="top">lighting is a bit off, and you can''t really identify the gun clearly enough.  Looking directly down the barrel and getting rid of the door might have made it better</td>', 'lighting is a bit off, and you can''t really identify the gun clearly enough.  Looking directly down the barrel and getting rid of the door might have made it better', '2002-05-22 03:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62336, 1695, 1054, '<td valign="top">Oh, please.</td>', 'Oh, please.', '2002-05-22 09:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62337, 1695, 741, '<td valign="top">Bit too dark and far away to really see what''s going on here.  What''s the thing in the foreground?  A shotgun??</td>', 'Bit too dark and far away to really see what''s going on here.  What''s the thing in the foreground?  A shotgun??', '2002-05-22 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62338, 1695, 842, '<td valign="top">poor doggie.<br/></td>', 'poor doggie.', '2002-05-22 19:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62339, 1695, 1597, '<td valign="top">I''d rather play other games</td>', 'I''d rather play other games', '2002-05-22 20:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62340, 1695, 244, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors, I would have to say that you were a little to reliant on your title to carry your shot.  Your subject is too far back to be the focus of your picture, there is too much going on here to really be able to draw my attention to the animals in the background</td>', 'Interesting colors, I would have to say that you were a little to reliant on your title to carry your shot.  Your subject is too far back to be the focus of your picture, there is too much going on here to really be able to draw my attention to the animals in the background', '2002-05-22 23:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62341, 1695, 1707, '<td valign="top">Ok, I DON''T like the indication of this photo, but I have to admit, good job (photographically!)</td>', 'Ok, I DON''T like the indication of this photo, but I have to admit, good job (photographically!)', '2002-05-23 06:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62342, 1695, 1, '<td valign="top">Very funny, but I really dislike like the lighting.  The orange cast is unappealing.  I like that you''re going from a dark room, it gives a sense that you''re really hunting (ie- sneaking up on the dog).  BUT-- the orange light bleeds into the dark room and makes it a bit grainy.  With brighter light in the room with the dog, and a white balance fix, I think the image could''ve been better.</td>', 'Very funny, but I really dislike like the lighting.  The orange cast is unappealing.  I like that you''re going from a dark room, it gives a sense that you''re really hunting (ie- sneaking up on the dog).  BUT-- the orange light bleeds into the dark room and makes it a bit grainy.  With brighter light in the room with the dog, and a white balance fix, I think the image could''ve been better.', '2002-05-23 10:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62343, 1695, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sick little boy</td>', 'Sick little boy', '2002-05-23 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62344, 1695, 1042, '<td valign="top">Sadistic...I love this....lol.</td>', 'Sadistic...I love this....lol.', '2002-05-23 21:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62345, 1695, 1696, '<td valign="top">you fag.</td>', 'you fag.', '2002-05-23 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62346, 1695, 255, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of this picture, but overall it is too dark and grainy and not much focus. I also find the setup ironic, since many hunters I <br/>hear about wait until the deer come up to their man-made feeding grounds to shoot them. Great sport and challenging, too!</td>', 'I like the angle of this picture, but overall it is too dark and grainy and not much focus. I also find the setup ironic, since many hunters I hear about wait until the deer come up to their man-made feeding grounds to shoot them. Great sport and challenging, too!', '2002-05-24 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62347, 1695, 173, '<td valign="top">Love it! Great job!</td>', 'Love it! Great job!', '2002-05-24 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62348, 1695, 1202, '<td valign="top">I will be surprised if this one is very popular with the voters.   Besides the controversial subject, the exposure is in need of help.   I tried to be constructive but I am changing my mind.</td>', 'I will be surprised if this one is very popular with the voters.   Besides the controversial subject, the exposure is in need of help.   I tried to be constructive but I am changing my mind.', '2002-05-24 21:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62349, 1695, 689, '<td valign="top">The cat is out of focus .... not a cat lover? or do you love them TOO much?</td>', 'The cat is out of focus .... not a cat lover? or do you love them TOO much?', '2002-05-24 23:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62350, 1695, 1128, '<td valign="top">A little dark and disturbing, but OK.</td>', 'A little dark and disturbing, but OK.', '2002-05-25 09:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
