(62356, 1695, 47, '<td valign="top">&amp;lt;3 lina<br/>that''s my mother''s dog. its not a cat. its. a. dog. you should wear your glasses when you vote.<br/>i actually hate my mother''s dog, and i dont like dogs in general.<br/>i dont play quake, i play counter-strike (www.teamrenegade.com).<br/>it''s a gamo cadet delta, not an rws. break action. 525 fps.<br/>aiming a safed and unloaded airgun at a dog is not cruel; pulling the trigger when its unsafed and loaded is cruel.. especially since i have fine tip ammo. yallz priorities be mixed like motherfuckers<br/><br/>thanks for lots of other good points about the shot. except the lighting, as i liked it like that.<br/><br/>and oh hey look, i fucking got swashbuckler to comment like a normal human being this time !</td>', '&lt;3 linathat''s my mother''s dog. its not a cat. its. a. dog. you should wear your glasses when you vote.i actually hate my mother''s dog, and i dont like dogs in general.i dont play quake, i play counter-strike (www.teamrenegade.com).it''s a gamo cadet delta, not an rws. break action. 525 fps.aiming a safed and unloaded airgun at a dog is not cruel; pulling the trigger when its unsafed and loaded is cruel.. especially since i have fine tip ammo. yallz priorities be mixed like motherfuckersthanks for lots of other good points about the shot. except the lighting, as i liked it like that.and oh hey look, i fucking got swashbuckler to comment like a normal human being this time !', '2002-05-27 09:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
