(62366, 1696, 1755, '<td valign="top">Great timing the fluffy hair of the dog is a good plus in this pic!</td>', 'Great timing the fluffy hair of the dog is a good plus in this pic!', '2002-05-20 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62367, 1696, 1750, '<td valign="top">Nice catch! Good air too.</td>', 'Nice catch! Good air too.', '2002-05-20 19:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62368, 1696, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful capture... This would have been a great entry for the stopped motion challenge a few weeks ago as well...  Black dogs are VERY difficult to photograph and get any detail in the fur...  I don''t think this photo could have been framed any better and it scores a 9 with me :)</td>', 'This is a wonderful capture... This would have been a great entry for the stopped motion challenge a few weeks ago as well...  Black dogs are VERY difficult to photograph and get any detail in the fur...  I don''t think this photo could have been framed any better and it scores a 9 with me :)', '2002-05-20 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62369, 1696, 156, '<td valign="top">this is a wonderful action shot...too bad the poles in the background look as if they''re holding the dog up</td>', 'this is a wonderful action shot...too bad the poles in the background look as if they''re holding the dog up', '2002-05-21 07:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62370, 1696, 301, '<td valign="top">watch out for things in the background of your photos.  This could have been great if it wasn''t for two poles and the tree above the dog''s tail.  Tighter crop may have helped as well.  Well done stopping the action tho.</td>', 'watch out for things in the background of your photos.  This could have been great if it wasn''t for two poles and the tree above the dog''s tail.  Tighter crop may have helped as well.  Well done stopping the action tho.', '2002-05-21 11:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62371, 1696, 1446, '<td valign="top">Great idea.....too bad the goal posts in the background cut your picture up so much.  The expresion on your dogs face is great!</td>', 'Great idea.....too bad the goal posts in the background cut your picture up so much.  The expresion on your dogs face is great!', '2002-05-21 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62372, 1696, 1617, '<td valign="top">Fun and funny.</td>', 'Fun and funny.', '2002-05-21 19:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62373, 1696, 244, '<td valign="top">I could never get my dog to do that, the only thing he would do was eat my shoes and wallet.  I know it is hard to stop action but maybe if you would have shot it from another angle you could have gotten the lamp posts out of the background or at least kept them from sticking straight out of his back and nose.  The color looks a little flat too, if you are using photoshop try auto levels, if not try to brighten the picture and add a little red and blue. Should make it look a little better</td>', 'I could never get my dog to do that, the only thing he would do was eat my shoes and wallet.  I know it is hard to stop action but maybe if you would have shot it from another angle you could have gotten the lamp posts out of the background or at least kept them from sticking straight out of his back and nose.  The color looks a little flat too, if you are using photoshop try auto levels, if not try to brighten the picture and add a little red and blue. Should make it look a little better', '2002-05-21 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62374, 1696, 1054, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2002-05-22 08:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62375, 1696, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love the way you caught the dog in action, but the colours here are very dull. Some good photoshop work (or some other application) would be very helpful here.</td>', 'I love the way you caught the dog in action, but the colours here are very dull. Some good photoshop work (or some other application) would be very helpful here.', '2002-05-22 09:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62376, 1696, 113, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool.  My monitor is dark and I almost missed him.  It looks like he''s standing flatfooted on air.  Nice shot.</td>', 'This is pretty cool.  My monitor is dark and I almost missed him.  It looks like he''s standing flatfooted on air.  Nice shot.', '2002-05-22 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
