(62422, 1702, 327, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Your flash/glare just got ya a bit. Still nice job.</td>', 'Good idea. Your flash/glare just got ya a bit. Still nice job.', '2002-05-20 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62423, 1702, 1446, '<td valign="top">Simple set up.  I like simple.  The lighting seems a little harsh on the dots of the dominos to me. Also the edges seem a little "rough".  Wondering if its just a lower end camera?</td>', 'Simple set up.  I like simple.  The lighting seems a little harsh on the dots of the dominos to me. Also the edges seem a little "rough".  Wondering if its just a lower end camera?', '2002-05-21 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62424, 1702, 1175, '<td valign="top">I''m gonn have to put this in my boring category.  Yes its a game.  Yes its dominos and its all in focus.  But it ends right there.  I''d say go for some more interesting angles, maybe get a little lower and closer on the dominos.  Let some of the dominos fall out of the frame, by having them all within the frame you are telling me the entire story and not allowing me to use my imagination about where everything else is.</td>', 'I''m gonn have to put this in my boring category.  Yes its a game.  Yes its dominos and its all in focus.  But it ends right there.  I''d say go for some more interesting angles, maybe get a little lower and closer on the dominos.  Let some of the dominos fall out of the frame, by having them all within the frame you are telling me the entire story and not allowing me to use my imagination about where everything else is.', '2002-05-21 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62425, 1702, 1712, '<td valign="top">Lots of people did dominos. Nice picture! And good back ground!</td>', 'Lots of people did dominos. Nice picture! And good back ground!', '2002-05-21 19:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62426, 1702, 1128, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop might have made this photo more appealing to me.  Because it is not depending on color to make a mark, it needs something dramatic in the composition or focus.  It''s clear and I like the black background.</td>', 'A tighter crop might have made this photo more appealing to me.  Because it is not depending on color to make a mark, it needs something dramatic in the composition or focus.  It''s clear and I like the black background.', '2002-05-21 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62427, 1702, 1054, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but I think there''s a lot of wasted space in this shot.  More efficient use of the space would have improved it some.</td>', 'A good idea, but I think there''s a lot of wasted space in this shot.  More efficient use of the space would have improved it some.', '2002-05-22 08:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62428, 1702, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the darkened background but I almost want to see some surface under the dominoes... good shot!</td>', 'I like the darkened background but I almost want to see some surface under the dominoes... good shot!', '2002-05-22 20:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
