(62432, 1702, 543, '<td valign="top">Since there isn''t much color here to begin with, I think B/W would have been a good choice.  Composition doesn''t really lead the eye to any center of interest, and the on-camera flash put those irritating highlights in the wells on the dominoes.</td>', 'Since there isn''t much color here to begin with, I think B/W would have been a good choice.  Composition doesn''t really lead the eye to any center of interest, and the on-camera flash put those irritating highlights in the wells on the dominoes.', '2002-05-26 02:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
