(62470, 1707, 1446, '<td valign="top">Amazing light and color, great focus.  I like the way you filled the frame with your subject.<br/></td>', 'Amazing light and color, great focus.  I like the way you filled the frame with your subject.', '2002-05-20 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62471, 1707, 1569, '<td valign="top">A little too close.</td>', 'A little too close.', '2002-05-20 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62472, 1707, 301, '<td valign="top">isn''t 20 meant to be at the top? :)  I think I would have preferred less DOF, thus blurring the ''top'' (left for this pic) of the board.  I like the placement of the bullseye in the photo and the darts and wires of the board leading your eye to it, but the black shafts of the darts blend in with the black background.  Still good IMO</td>', 'isn''t 20 meant to be at the top? :)  I think I would have preferred less DOF, thus blurring the ''top'' (left for this pic) of the board.  I like the placement of the bullseye in the photo and the darts and wires of the board leading your eye to it, but the black shafts of the darts blend in with the black background.  Still good IMO', '2002-05-21 06:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62473, 1707, 1455, '<td valign="top">Very Nice, wish my board was this colorful..........</td>', 'Very Nice, wish my board was this colorful..........', '2002-05-21 09:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62474, 1707, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. Must have taken a million tries, though, to get it set up just...no...wait...I get it...</td>', 'I like the composition. Must have taken a million tries, though, to get it set up just...no...wait...I get it...', '2002-05-21 19:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62475, 1707, 1597, '<td valign="top">Crisp, clear, shot</td>', 'Crisp, clear, shot', '2002-05-21 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62476, 1707, 244, '<td valign="top">good shot, well three good shots, I think I would have liked it better if it wasn''t a brand new dart board, or if one was off the mark. I would also have used a larger apatrure to blur out the background, the other side of the board with the numbers is too sharp in focus and keeps pulling my eye over to it.</td>', 'good shot, well three good shots, I think I would have liked it better if it wasn''t a brand new dart board, or if one was off the mark. I would also have used a larger apatrure to blur out the background, the other side of the board with the numbers is too sharp in focus and keeps pulling my eye over to it.', '2002-05-21 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62477, 1707, 1, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, great colors, good angle.</td>', 'Nicely done, great colors, good angle.', '2002-05-22 10:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62478, 1707, 1054, '<td valign="top">A beautiful shot, and the lighting is perfect.  What kind of light setup did you use?</td>', 'A beautiful shot, and the lighting is perfect.  What kind of light setup did you use?', '2002-05-22 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62479, 1707, 824, '<td valign="top">The colors of the dart board don''t seem that attractive. However, this is a unique game, however, it may have been better to have a person with a dart in their hand or something.</td>', 'The colors of the dart board don''t seem that attractive. However, this is a unique game, however, it may have been better to have a person with a dart in their hand or something.', '2002-05-22 22:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62480, 1707, 573, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp image.</td>', 'Nice crisp image.', '2002-05-23 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62481, 1707, 1078, '<td valign="top">Those darts need a little light from this side to bring out the golden glow of the grips and to differentiate the rest of the shaft from the black portions of the board a little better.  (Right now, in some places you can''t tell where the board -- or bakground -- ends and the dart begins, apart from visualy continuity.  That''s not exactly the right word, but if you''re not sure what I''m getting at, ask)  The board itself is well lit -- the reds and greens really pop, and the wire is perfect.</td>', 'Those darts need a little light from this side to bring out the golden glow of the grips and to differentiate the rest of the shaft from the black portions of the board a little better.  (Right now, in some places you can''t tell where the board -- or bakground -- ends and the dart begins, apart from visualy continuity.  That''s not exactly the right word, but if you''re not sure what I''m getting at, ask)  The board itself is well lit -- the reds and greens really pop, and the wire is perfect.', '2002-05-23 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62482, 1707, 1042, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, good lighting, great color plus I really like darts. :) Nice cropping too.</td>', 'Nice angle, good lighting, great color plus I really like darts. :) Nice cropping too.', '2002-05-23 21:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62483, 1707, 1814, '<td valign="top">Bullseye ! good composition</td>', 'Bullseye ! good composition', '2002-05-24 07:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62484, 1707, 255, '<td valign="top">great closeup, good lighting, very well executed picture! 10.</td>', 'great closeup, good lighting, very well executed picture! 10.', '2002-05-24 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62485, 1707, 748, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, I actually did this once!</td>', 'Nice angle, I actually did this once!', '2002-05-24 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62486, 1707, 1202, '<td valign="top">Great focus and color.   This is really being nit-picky but the composition would have been much better if the board had been old with the center almost eaten away.   Also would have been a good candidate for "advertisement" challenge.</td>', 'Great focus and color.   This is really being nit-picky but the composition would have been much better if the board had been old with the center almost eaten away.   Also would have been a good candidate for "advertisement" challenge.', '2002-05-24 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62487, 1707, 689, '<td valign="top">seems a little too staged ....</td>', 'seems a little too staged ....', '2002-05-24 23:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62488, 1707, 1135, '<td valign="top">Nice color and Focus.</td>', 'Nice color and Focus.', '2002-05-25 01:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62489, 1707, 543, '<td valign="top">Great colors, tack sharp, well lit and nicely composed.  Why''d you rotate it?  (Come to think of it, why''d you shoot it from below in the first place?)  If you had a tripod it might have been good to shoot a little more head-on and include the fletching on the darts, but that''s another image.  Raising your score on my second look.</td>', 'Great colors, tack sharp, well lit and nicely composed.  Why''d you rotate it?  (Come to think of it, why''d you shoot it from below in the first place?)  If you had a tripod it might have been good to shoot a little more head-on and include the fletching on the darts, but that''s another image.  Raising your score on my second look.', '2002-05-25 03:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62490, 1707, 637, '<td valign="top">Since its a setup, I feel like you could''ve done more with this.... A different perspective? A wider angle?  I''m not sure what I''m looking for.</td>', 'Since its a setup, I feel like you could''ve done more with this.... A different perspective? A wider angle?  I''m not sure what I''m looking for.', '2002-05-26 00:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62491, 1707, 527, '<td valign="top">Nice. It reminds me of mine. It so clean which definitely helps the contrast and makes the whole scene ''pop''.</td>', 'Nice. It reminds me of mine. It so clean which definitely helps the contrast and makes the whole scene ''pop''.', '2002-05-26 02:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62492, 1707, 2, '<td valign="top">The amazingly bright colors, sharp focus, and wonderful framing of this image really set your photograph high above the other darts shots -- and above many of the shots in the challenge!</td>', 'The amazingly bright colors, sharp focus, and wonderful framing of this image really set your photograph high above the other darts shots -- and above many of the shots in the challenge!', '2002-05-27 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62493, 1707, 2, '<td valign="top">Of course this had to be John :)  -- disappointed to see that you didn''t place higher, but great job nonetheless.</td>', 'Of course this had to be John :)  -- disappointed to see that you didn''t place higher, but great job nonetheless.', '2002-05-27 08:16:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(62494, 1709, 509, '<td valign="top">The way chess was meant to be played ; )  I''m not that fond of the background, it is interesting, but I wish it was consistent throughout the image - especially in the upper left corner</td>', 'The way chess was meant to be played ; )  I''m not that fond of the background, it is interesting, but I wish it was consistent throughout the image - especially in the upper left corner', '2002-05-20 01:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62495, 1709, 1605, '<td valign="top">Odd background....</td>', 'Odd background....', '2002-05-20 02:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62496, 1709, 1585, '<td valign="top">I can almost smell death in the air.</td>', 'I can almost smell death in the air.', '2002-05-20 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62497, 1709, 885, '<td valign="top">I like the chess pieces, but I''m not sure about the choice of background.  I think it''s a little distracting, and the color clashes.</td>', 'I like the chess pieces, but I''m not sure about the choice of background.  I think it''s a little distracting, and the color clashes.', '2002-05-20 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62498, 1709, 1, '<td valign="top">The leopard print background doesn''t work too well with the chess pieces.</td>', 'The leopard print background doesn''t work too well with the chess pieces.', '2002-05-20 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62499, 1709, 862, '<td valign="top">I like the concept.  It does indeed have the look of a battlefield.  Good job with depth of field, but it could be a little better.  Some objects that are mostly in focus are a little fuzzy around the edges.  Looks like one of the better entries.</td>', 'I like the concept.  It does indeed have the look of a battlefield.  Good job with depth of field, but it could be a little better.  Some objects that are mostly in focus are a little fuzzy around the edges.  Looks like one of the better entries.', '2002-05-20 13:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62500, 1709, 1748, '<td valign="top">good picture but let down by background</td>', 'good picture but let down by background', '2002-05-20 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62501, 1709, 327, '<td valign="top">Dern good job, my only little nit is the background is too busy and the light on the pieces could of been better.<br/>Still all in all I like this shot.</td>', 'Dern good job, my only little nit is the background is too busy and the light on the pieces could of been better.Still all in all I like this shot.', '2002-05-20 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62502, 1709, 1041, '<td valign="top">That must''ve been one hell of a battle!  Good job on having the front piece at the side blurred, makes me feel I''m right there on the chessboard.  Also like the pieces, and how you''ve photographed them, however, the background is very distracting in my opinion, and the same photo with a plain black background would''ve scored higher with me.</td>', 'That must''ve been one hell of a battle!  Good job on having the front piece at the side blurred, makes me feel I''m right there on the chessboard.  Also like the pieces, and how you''ve photographed them, however, the background is very distracting in my opinion, and the same photo with a plain black background would''ve scored higher with me.', '2002-05-20 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62503, 1709, 1750, '<td valign="top">Good texture in the forefront. Like the lighting.<br/>Personal taste: the background draws attention away from the subject.</td>', 'Good texture in the forefront. Like the lighting.Personal taste: the background draws attention away from the subject.', '2002-05-20 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62504, 1709, 1569, '<td valign="top">Works for me.</td>', 'Works for me.', '2002-05-20 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62505, 1709, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice photo.. I love your chess set.  The only thing I don''t care for in this shot is the background.  I won''t say that it''s distracting, but it doesn''t really fit this artistic chess set.  With both colors of chess pieces being on the darker side, I would have tried to set them off a little more with a lighter colored (solid) background possibly.</td>', 'This is a really nice photo.. I love your chess set.  The only thing I don''t care for in this shot is the background.  I won''t say that it''s distracting, but it doesn''t really fit this artistic chess set.  With both colors of chess pieces being on the darker side, I would have tried to set them off a little more with a lighter colored (solid) background possibly.', '2002-05-20 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62506, 1709, 1512, '<td valign="top">What''s in the background?</td>', 'What''s in the background?', '2002-05-20 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62507, 1709, 1455, '<td valign="top">Very cool chess pieces..........</td>', 'Very cool chess pieces..........', '2002-05-21 09:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62508, 1709, 1040, '<td valign="top">Too much harry potter me thinks...</td>', 'Too much harry potter me thinks...', '2002-05-21 09:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62509, 1709, 1175, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture, but I have some problems with it.  The knight is a wonderful piece with some great detail.  I would have loved if I could have seen its front, at the very least, turn it 45-90 degrees to the right so that its not backlit.  The focus appears to be mainly on the fallen pieces.  This is fine except that you have two pieces right in the middle obstructing the view.  I think in this case focus should have been on those two pices.  I like the way you used the piece all the way to the right to frame the photograph.  I have no problem with it being out of focus.  I also dislike your background it is too noisy and detracts from your subject.</td>', 'I really like this picture, but I have some problems with it.  The knight is a wonderful piece with some great detail.  I would have loved if I could have seen its front, at the very least, turn it 45-90 degrees to the right so that its not backlit.  The focus appears to be mainly on the fallen pieces.  This is fine except that you have two pieces right in the middle obstructing the view.  I think in this case focus should have been on those two pices.  I like the way you used the piece all the way to the right to frame the photograph.  I have no problem with it being out of focus.  I also dislike your background it is too noisy and detracts from your subject.', '2002-05-21 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62510, 1709, 1446, '<td valign="top">Good focus and dof on this shot.  Not sure I understand the correlation of the leopard print in the background.</td>', 'Good focus and dof on this shot.  Not sure I understand the correlation of the leopard print in the background.', '2002-05-21 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62511, 1709, 1009, '<td valign="top">Interesting way of looking at the game...</td>', 'Interesting way of looking at the game...', '2002-05-21 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62512, 1709, 1078, '<td valign="top">Yay -- the chaos that most of us feel about chess because we only barely even know the rules.  Only two comments.  First, I would have turned the knight slightly counter-clockwise so we can see it''s face a little better and to get it lit more than just on the mane.  Second, I''m not sure the leopard print background is the best choice for the picture.  I don''t have a better suggestion, but it just seems out of place.</td>', 'Yay -- the chaos that most of us feel about chess because we only barely even know the rules.  Only two comments.  First, I would have turned the knight slightly counter-clockwise so we can see it''s face a little better and to get it lit more than just on the mane.  Second, I''m not sure the leopard print background is the best choice for the picture.  I don''t have a better suggestion, but it just seems out of place.', '2002-05-21 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62513, 1709, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and lighting  control.</td>', 'Nice DOF and lighting  control.', '2002-05-21 19:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62514, 1709, 1647, '<td valign="top">Good DOF and focus point</td>', 'Good DOF and focus point', '2002-05-21 20:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62515, 1709, 244, '<td valign="top">I like the clarity of this shot, but what is with the leopard skin in the back?  A little distracting</td>', 'I like the clarity of this shot, but what is with the leopard skin in the back?  A little distracting', '2002-05-21 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62516, 1709, 640, '<td valign="top">I like the drama of the chess pieces. The tiger-skin backdrop seems out of place</td>', 'I like the drama of the chess pieces. The tiger-skin backdrop seems out of place', '2002-05-22 07:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62517, 1709, 878, '<td valign="top">Thats quite the battle</td>', 'Thats quite the battle', '2002-05-22 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62518, 1709, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  Maybe it''s me, but isn''t this a little too close?  Just wondering....(no score effect) why leapard skin background?<br/>Photo 8 Creativity 7 (I like the jumbled look!)  Games 8 total 8</td>', 'Nice concept.  Maybe it''s me, but isn''t this a little too close?  Just wondering....(no score effect) why leapard skin background?Photo 8 Creativity 7 (I like the jumbled look!)  Games 8 total 8', '2002-05-22 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62519, 1709, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice contrast of colors and crsip</td>', 'nice contrast of colors and crsip', '2002-05-22 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62520, 1709, 1336, '<td valign="top">this photo seems a little too busy to me.  also, i dont like the leopard print background - i think it would have been better with just solid white or black</td>', 'this photo seems a little too busy to me.  also, i dont like the leopard print background - i think it would have been better with just solid white or black', '2002-05-23 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62521, 1709, 748, '<td valign="top">The background is quite distracting.  Would have been better with less chess pieces and more board showing.</td>', 'The background is quite distracting.  Would have been better with less chess pieces and more board showing.', '2002-05-24 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62522, 1709, 428, '<td valign="top">That leopard backdrop is distracting</td>', 'That leopard backdrop is distracting', '2002-05-25 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62523, 1709, 527, '<td valign="top">This is very good, definitely one of the best. I just love the richness and clarity of it.</td>', 'This is very good, definitely one of the best. I just love the richness and clarity of it.', '2002-05-26 02:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62524, 1713, 1296, '<td valign="top">Would have been better with a different backdrop (sans head)</td>', 'Would have been better with a different backdrop (sans head)', '2002-05-20 06:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62525, 1713, 1336, '<td valign="top">i think this would have been better without the person in the background... just a nice black or white backdrop would have worked better.  still, good photo.</td>', 'i think this would have been better without the person in the background... just a nice black or white backdrop would have worked better.  still, good photo.', '2002-05-20 07:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62526, 1713, 327, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2002-05-20 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62527, 1713, 259, '<td valign="top">i like the depth of field in the photo, but i am don''t know if it works as well as it should since my eye has a tendency to return to the person at the back which is not in focus who is not the subject of the photo.</td>', 'i like the depth of field in the photo, but i am don''t know if it works as well as it should since my eye has a tendency to return to the person at the back which is not in focus who is not the subject of the photo.', '2002-05-20 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62528, 1713, 1377, '<td valign="top">I love this game!</td>', 'I love this game!', '2002-05-20 19:33:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(62529, 1713, 1009, '<td valign="top">Hehe... sweet. Reminds me of when me and my friends played Risk all the time.</td>', 'Hehe... sweet. Reminds me of when me and my friends played Risk all the time.', '2002-05-21 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62530, 1713, 1446, '<td valign="top">I am pretty sure the intent of this shot was to show the interaction of people with your game.......but I think it would have been a better shot without the human element.</td>', 'I am pretty sure the intent of this shot was to show the interaction of people with your game.......but I think it would have been a better shot without the human element.', '2002-05-21 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62531, 1713, 113, '<td valign="top">I like this, only too much red in the background face and wall.  Zoom instead of macro or vise versa.</td>', 'I like this, only too much red in the background face and wall.  Zoom instead of macro or vise versa.', '2002-05-22 07:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62532, 1713, 301, '<td valign="top">Foreground is great.  I''m not a fan of the head in the background though - it seems to take too much away from the ''action'' in front</td>', 'Foreground is great.  I''m not a fan of the head in the background though - it seems to take too much away from the ''action'' in front', '2002-05-22 07:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62533, 1713, 1054, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but I think the person in the background detracts from the shot and pulls the focus away from the subject.   A plain backdrop might have worked better.</td>', 'A good idea, but I think the person in the background detracts from the shot and pulls the focus away from the subject.   A plain backdrop might have worked better.', '2002-05-22 08:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62534, 1713, 1037, '<td valign="top">The face in the background adds something to this that a lot of other photos of board games in this challenge completely lack, ie. a bit of life, a bit of the attraction of playing games. I like it :)</td>', 'The face in the background adds something to this that a lot of other photos of board games in this challenge completely lack, ie. a bit of life, a bit of the attraction of playing games. I like it :)', '2002-05-22 08:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62535, 1713, 1, '<td valign="top">I think the head in the background doesn''t help to show how the game is played: perhaps a hand or two near the pieces like it''s ready to move them.</td>', 'I think the head in the background doesn''t help to show how the game is played: perhaps a hand or two near the pieces like it''s ready to move them.', '2002-05-22 10:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62536, 1713, 772, '<td valign="top">Risk is a fun game... I can''t make up my mind if I really like the ''guy'' in the background or not... I am wondering what the photo would look like without his presence... excellent photo, great composition... good job!</td>', 'Risk is a fun game... I can''t make up my mind if I really like the ''guy'' in the background or not... I am wondering what the photo would look like without his presence... excellent photo, great composition... good job!', '2002-05-22 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62537, 1713, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice view</td>', 'nice view', '2002-05-22 20:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62538, 1713, 1169, '<td valign="top">it would''ve been mad without the face...</td>', 'it would''ve been mad without the face...', '2002-05-22 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62539, 1713, 824, '<td valign="top">Would have been better as an overhead shot.</td>', 'Would have been better as an overhead shot.', '2002-05-22 23:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62540, 1713, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool board!  Jury is still out on the face in the background.  Photo 8 Creativity 8 Games 8 total 8</td>', 'Cool board!  Jury is still out on the face in the background.  Photo 8 Creativity 8 Games 8 total 8', '2002-05-23 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62541, 1713, 748, '<td valign="top">I think the face distracts from the pieces.</td>', 'I think the face distracts from the pieces.', '2002-05-23 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62542, 1713, 255, '<td valign="top">I love the angle and DOF of this picture and I''m sure you are going to get people saying the exact opposite of this--but I think it <br/>would have been better without the face in it. This is just IMO, of course. I think it is because it throws the perspective off and takes <br/>away from the impact of the game.</td>', 'I love the angle and DOF of this picture and I''m sure you are going to get people saying the exact opposite of this--but I think it would have been better without the face in it. This is just IMO, of course. I think it is because it throws the perspective off and takes away from the impact of the game.', '2002-05-24 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62543, 1713, 527, '<td valign="top">I always sucked at this game but this is a very interesting and well taken photo. I wish the person appeared like they were concentrating a little more instead of looking into the camera.</td>', 'I always sucked at this game but this is a very interesting and well taken photo. I wish the person appeared like they were concentrating a little more instead of looking into the camera.', '2002-05-26 02:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62544, 1713, 543, '<td valign="top">Great game, although I''ve gotta say I hate those new pieces.  Don''t know what your oof head in the bg adds.  Some black paper might have been a better choice.</td>', 'Great game, although I''ve gotta say I hate those new pieces.  Don''t know what your oof head in the bg adds.  Some black paper might have been a better choice.', '2002-05-26 02:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62545, 1717, 113, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the red cast to this photo.</td>', 'I don''t care for the red cast to this photo.', '2002-05-20 03:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62546, 1717, 1606, '<td valign="top">just marvelous and mind boggling</td>', 'just marvelous and mind boggling', '2002-05-20 08:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62547, 1717, 327, '<td valign="top">Not sure why you did the red..? I''m guessing to make it more interesting. It''s not a bad shot.</td>', 'Not sure why you did the red..? I''m guessing to make it more interesting. It''s not a bad shot.', '2002-05-20 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62548, 1717, 587, '<td valign="top">sorry, this doesn''t do much for me, I don''t like the coloring. The "O" is distracting since it''s scuffed.</td>', 'sorry, this doesn''t do much for me, I don''t like the coloring. The "O" is distracting since it''s scuffed.', '2002-05-20 14:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62549, 1717, 301, '<td valign="top">Red lighting doesn''t really do it for me</td>', 'Red lighting doesn''t really do it for me', '2002-05-21 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62550, 1717, 1009, '<td valign="top">I like the red effect</td>', 'I like the red effect', '2002-05-21 17:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62551, 1717, 1446, '<td valign="top">Certainly the most interesting colors of the boggle shots. Good focus..just not that interesting overall....sorry</td>', 'Certainly the most interesting colors of the boggle shots. Good focus..just not that interesting overall....sorry', '2002-05-21 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62552, 1717, 1041, '<td valign="top">Boggle, egg, leak, cog, peg, beg, bog, peck . . . oh, sorry, got distracted ;o)  Good shot, all nicely in focus, just wondering why the red?</td>', 'Boggle, egg, leak, cog, peg, beg, bog, peck . . . oh, sorry, got distracted ;o)  Good shot, all nicely in focus, just wondering why the red?', '2002-05-22 08:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62553, 1717, 878, '<td valign="top">Dark Room Boggle? :)</td>', 'Dark Room Boggle? :)', '2002-05-22 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62554, 1717, 772, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that I like the red tint, but the composition on this shot is ok... I would have flipped the O that is damaged to another letter... good job!!</td>', 'I''m not sure that I like the red tint, but the composition on this shot is ok... I would have flipped the O that is damaged to another letter... good job!!', '2002-05-22 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62555, 1717, 1005, '<td valign="top">Is there a subliminal message?  Why the red tint?  Photo 9 Creativity 6 Games 7 total 7</td>', 'Is there a subliminal message?  Why the red tint?  Photo 9 Creativity 6 Games 7 total 7', '2002-05-22 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62556, 1717, 244, '<td valign="top">Lighting is kinda strange, was that intentional?</td>', 'Lighting is kinda strange, was that intentional?', '2002-05-22 23:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62557, 1717, 674, '<td valign="top">Good focus but a think a better background would have improved this shot and better lighting</td>', 'Good focus but a think a better background would have improved this shot and better lighting', '2002-05-23 06:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62558, 1717, 757, '<td valign="top">Too red</td>', 'Too red', '2002-05-23 19:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62559, 1717, 1597, '<td valign="top">I think this would have looked better with natural color, nice effort</td>', 'I think this would have looked better with natural color, nice effort', '2002-05-23 22:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62560, 1717, 1066, '<td valign="top">Just a little dark.  I like the idea of red but red lights always seem to screw up a photo more than help em when used as the sole light source.<br/><br/>Use of natural light with a red light highlighter gets a better effect often and gives you more options for photo editing.</td>', 'Just a little dark.  I like the idea of red but red lights always seem to screw up a photo more than help em when used as the sole light source.Use of natural light with a red light highlighter gets a better effect often and gives you more options for photo editing.', '2002-05-25 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62561, 1717, 280, '<td valign="top">I like the red lighting how ever the pencil(I think thats what it is) on the right isnt very clear which I find distracting, maybe if it had been on the left or even removed?</td>', 'I like the red lighting how ever the pencil(I think thats what it is) on the right isnt very clear which I find distracting, maybe if it had been on the left or even removed?', '2002-05-25 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62562, 1717, 527, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color.</td>', 'Nice use of color.', '2002-05-26 02:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62563, 1717, 1, '<td valign="top">Not sure that the red light  or the downward angle is appealing.</td>', 'Not sure that the red light  or the downward angle is appealing.', '2002-05-27 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62564, 1719, 1744, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.</td>', 'I like the composition.', '2002-05-20 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62565, 1719, 1446, '<td valign="top">A wonderful simplistic shot!  Excellent focus, The black background works perfectly.  One of my top 5!</td>', 'A wonderful simplistic shot!  Excellent focus, The black background works perfectly.  One of my top 5!', '2002-05-20 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62566, 1719, 1680, '<td valign="top">i love it.  When i was a kid we played a game that looked just like that called pick-up sticks.</td>', 'i love it.  When i was a kid we played a game that looked just like that called pick-up sticks.', '2002-05-20 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62567, 1719, 327, '<td valign="top">Great game......do kids still play pick-up sticks? Fun shot, great color, good DOF&amp;gt; Nice work.</td>', 'Great game......do kids still play pick-up sticks? Fun shot, great color, good DOF&gt; Nice work.', '2002-05-20 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62568, 1719, 1078, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.  For a minute, I thought maybe you''d PSed the stick at the bottom in the lower left corner -- then I realized it was just the blue stripe in the middle of the stick.  While I really like the lighting, I think it''s a little too strong on the two main sticks in the picture.  The grain of the wood in the highlights seems to be there, but not really enough to see.  That''s a relatively minor thing though.  Good work.</td>', 'Nice abstract.  For a minute, I thought maybe you''d PSed the stick at the bottom in the lower left corner -- then I realized it was just the blue stripe in the middle of the stick.  While I really like the lighting, I think it''s a little too strong on the two main sticks in the picture.  The grain of the wood in the highlights seems to be there, but not really enough to see.  That''s a relatively minor thing though.  Good work.', '2002-05-21 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62569, 1719, 878, '<td valign="top">Not familiar with the game but this is a good shot.  Nice lighting, color and texture.</td>', 'Not familiar with the game but this is a good shot.  Nice lighting, color and texture.', '2002-05-22 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62570, 1719, 772, '<td valign="top">i really like the lighting and the contrasts in this photo.  The composition is also very nice!  Good job!</td>', 'i really like the lighting and the contrasts in this photo.  The composition is also very nice!  Good job!', '2002-05-22 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62571, 1719, 1005, '<td valign="top">It''s a stick game, right?  Maybe a little too close, or not enough subject.  Photo 9 Creativity 7 Games 7 total 7</td>', 'It''s a stick game, right?  Maybe a little too close, or not enough subject.  Photo 9 Creativity 7 Games 7 total 7', '2002-05-22 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62572, 1719, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice color contrast</td>', 'nice color contrast', '2002-05-22 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62573, 1719, 1336, '<td valign="top">this is a really good photo.  it''s simple, very sharp, and it has a great use of color.  the black background is perfect.</td>', 'this is a really good photo.  it''s simple, very sharp, and it has a great use of color.  the black background is perfect.', '2002-05-23 10:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62574, 1719, 1066, '<td valign="top">Clean, simple well photographed.  Good photo</td>', 'Clean, simple well photographed.  Good photo', '2002-05-25 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62575, 1719, 1, '<td valign="top">The heck is Mikado?  I''m not sure this image is a good representation of how it''s played.  Showing how it''s played might''ve worked out better.</td>', 'The heck is Mikado?  I''m not sure this image is a good representation of how it''s played.  Showing how it''s played might''ve worked out better.', '2002-05-26 23:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62576, 1719, 543, '<td valign="top">Nice one.  The points are a little close to the bottom of the frame,IMO, but nice.</td>', 'Nice one.  The points are a little close to the bottom of the frame,IMO, but nice.', '2002-05-27 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62577, 1719, 715, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the nice comments and the votes. For those who didn''t know: Mikado is a game where you have to pick up the sticks one by one, without moving the others. <br/></td>', 'Thanks for the nice comments and the votes. For those who didn''t know: Mikado is a game where you have to pick up the sticks one by one, without moving the others. ', '2002-05-27 04:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(62578, 1721, 798, '<td valign="top">Nice view!</td>', 'Nice view!', '2002-05-20 02:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62579, 1721, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective, lines, and symmetry in this photo.  I generally do not like sections of the ''foreground'' of a photo being out of focus (personal preference).  Phototgraphs taken as a macro at a low angle are quite difficult to bring into focus throughout the entire frame.  Sometimes, it''s purely impossible.  In this photo, since the ''triple word score'' is red and stands out from the others, I would have preferred it being in sharper focus.</td>', 'I like the perspective, lines, and symmetry in this photo.  I generally do not like sections of the ''foreground'' of a photo being out of focus (personal preference).  Phototgraphs taken as a macro at a low angle are quite difficult to bring into focus throughout the entire frame.  Sometimes, it''s purely impossible.  In this photo, since the ''triple word score'' is red and stands out from the others, I would have preferred it being in sharper focus.', '2002-05-20 05:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62580, 1721, 1, '<td valign="top">Excellent framing and use of DOF.  Your focal point is flawless, very well done.</td>', 'Excellent framing and use of DOF.  Your focal point is flawless, very well done.', '2002-05-20 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62581, 1721, 327, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, clear, clean shot.</td>', 'Good DOF, clear, clean shot.', '2002-05-20 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62582, 1721, 1175, '<td valign="top">The repeating pattern in this is great.  I would have prefered if you brought that point down till it was almost touching the bottom frame and then you made the "Triple Word Score" square in focus and then let the rest behind drown out.</td>', 'The repeating pattern in this is great.  I would have prefered if you brought that point down till it was almost touching the bottom frame and then you made the "Triple Word Score" square in focus and then let the rest behind drown out.', '2002-05-20 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62583, 1721, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great angle.  I would''ve liked to see the triple word score and corner in focus and the fields in the background going blurry.  Still, pretty good shot.</td>', 'Great angle.  I would''ve liked to see the triple word score and corner in focus and the fields in the background going blurry.  Still, pretty good shot.', '2002-05-20 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62584, 1721, 1446, '<td valign="top">I know its just a preference, but I personally dont like out of focus things in the front. Otherwise well done.</td>', 'I know its just a preference, but I personally dont like out of focus things in the front. Otherwise well done.', '2002-05-21 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62585, 1721, 587, '<td valign="top">This is really good. Had I done this, this would have been the angle I would try to do. I wish there was less shadow in the triple word score area but I like it. good job.</td>', 'This is really good. Had I done this, this would have been the angle I would try to do. I wish there was less shadow in the triple word score area but I like it. good job.', '2002-05-21 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62586, 1721, 1031, '<td valign="top">If only we had time to play endlessly...</td>', 'If only we had time to play endlessly...', '2002-05-21 19:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62587, 1721, 301, '<td valign="top">I like the angle you''ve found here, but would prefer the Triple word score to be in focus.  That corner is where all the lines in your picture lead, but the focus and therefore subject of the photo is on the double word score above it.</td>', 'I like the angle you''ve found here, but would prefer the Triple word score to be in focus.  That corner is where all the lines in your picture lead, but the focus and therefore subject of the photo is on the double word score above it.', '2002-05-22 03:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62588, 1721, 113, '<td valign="top">Was this macro.  I really like your angle, but wouldn''t have kept alot of the bottom.  Other than that its very nice.</td>', 'Was this macro.  I really like your angle, but wouldn''t have kept alot of the bottom.  Other than that its very nice.', '2002-05-22 07:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62589, 1721, 1054, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  There were some comments in the forums about the DOF and the near corner being out of focus, but that actually works for me... I think it helps draw the viewer in to the board.</td>', 'I really like this one.  There were some comments in the forums about the DOF and the near corner being out of focus, but that actually works for me... I think it helps draw the viewer in to the board.', '2002-05-22 08:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62590, 1721, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice view but shadows on bottom of pic</td>', 'nice view but shadows on bottom of pic', '2002-05-22 20:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62591, 1721, 1169, '<td valign="top">the picture is on a triple score, but it is titled double score?</td>', 'the picture is on a triple score, but it is titled double score?', '2002-05-22 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62592, 1721, 878, '<td valign="top">Nice technical photo even though there is no game play in progress.</td>', 'Nice technical photo even though there is no game play in progress.', '2002-05-23 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62593, 1721, 1814, '<td valign="top">Good play of  "Depth of field". good clarity, Good Job</td>', 'Good play of  "Depth of field". good clarity, Good Job', '2002-05-24 07:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62594, 1721, 255, '<td valign="top">Cool idea! This photo has great potential!  I already love the angle, but to me, the red triple word score stands out the most. I might have pulled the <br/>lighting towards the front to accentuate the red square, then  focused on it and let the rest fade into the shadow. Um,  I guess this really isn''t <br/>helpful criticism, since it is just my opinion! Still, high marks for you!</td>', 'Cool idea! This photo has great potential!  I already love the angle, but to me, the red triple word score stands out the most. I might have pulled the lighting towards the front to accentuate the red square, then  focused on it and let the rest fade into the shadow. Um,  I guess this really isn''t helpful criticism, since it is just my opinion! Still, high marks for you!', '2002-05-24 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62595, 1721, 748, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, framing, DOF.  Great work.</td>', 'Nice angle, framing, DOF.  Great work.', '2002-05-24 14:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
