(62625, 1722, 543, '<td valign="top">Good catch of the action.  Better, IMO, without the third ball in the bg.  Had to look pretty hard to figure out why the moving ball was "doubled".  The reflection in the ball at R is a great touch.  This would make a good B/W, too, with all the contrasts and texture.</td>', 'Good catch of the action.  Better, IMO, without the third ball in the bg.  Had to look pretty hard to figure out why the moving ball was "doubled".  The reflection in the ball at R is a great touch.  This would make a good B/W, too, with all the contrasts and texture.', '2002-05-25 03:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
