(62650, 1725, 1446, '<td valign="top">Wonderful action shot....Racetracks have so many annoying horizontal lines dont they?  I wonder if it might have been less noticable if cropped differently. You might have also been able to get rid of that overprocessed look at the top. I gave you a 7, because I love the action part of this photo.</td>', 'Wonderful action shot....Racetracks have so many annoying horizontal lines dont they?  I wonder if it might have been less noticable if cropped differently. You might have also been able to get rid of that overprocessed look at the top. I gave you a 7, because I love the action part of this photo.', '2002-05-21 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
