(62673, 1727, 1054, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing how two shots can be so similar and yet so different.  The composition on this shot is absolutely flawless.  You do an outstanding job of bringing a large number of elements together and combining them into a scene.  Even the rails and fences, which can easily be a distraction if not dealt with properly, manage to lead the eye back into the main subject.  This is the kind of detail I often miss.  Also, your shot conveys competition much more than mine does.  The only thing I might have done differently would have been to step the aperture up just a little bit to tighten the focus and soften the background.  The extra light also would have helped separate the horses from each other.  Overall, this is a top-quality shot, and one of my three 10''s for the week.</td>', 'It''s amazing how two shots can be so similar and yet so different.  The composition on this shot is absolutely flawless.  You do an outstanding job of bringing a large number of elements together and combining them into a scene.  Even the rails and fences, which can easily be a distraction if not dealt with properly, manage to lead the eye back into the main subject.  This is the kind of detail I often miss.  Also, your shot conveys competition much more than mine does.  The only thing I might have done differently would have been to step the aperture up just a little bit to tighten the focus and soften the background.  The extra light also would have helped separate the horses from each other.  Overall, this is a top-quality shot, and one of my three 10''s for the week.', '2002-05-22 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62674, 1727, 878, '<td valign="top">Good action shot, a bit on the dark side.</td>', 'Good action shot, a bit on the dark side.', '2002-05-22 15:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
