(62678, 1727, 1814, '<td valign="top">great action</td>', 'great action', '2002-05-24 07:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62679, 1727, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot with good stop action.</td>', 'Nice action shot with good stop action.', '2002-05-24 19:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62680, 1727, 661, '<td valign="top">Great motion shot.</td>', 'Great motion shot.', '2002-05-24 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62681, 1727, 1679, '<td valign="top">Judging from the shadows, you were shooting against the sun. This has resulted to the horses being underexposed. Probably use of a fill-in flash would have made things better. Although you would need a powerful one.<br/>My eye immediately headed for the strong logos in the background (Nissan etc). In general the background is too clumsy. Probably, using a slower shutter speed with the panning method would have taken care of this and also have given your photo more impact.</td>', 'Judging from the shadows, you were shooting against the sun. This has resulted to the horses being underexposed. Probably use of a fill-in flash would have made things better. Although you would need a powerful one.My eye immediately headed for the strong logos in the background (Nissan etc). In general the background is too clumsy. Probably, using a slower shutter speed with the panning method would have taken care of this and also have given your photo more impact.', '2002-05-25 09:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62682, 1727, 428, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Great capture of the race! Nice focusing and stop action.  The only thing I would have changed is to frame it just a bit tighter cropping out the top, right above the white picket fence.</td>', 'Beautiful! Great capture of the race! Nice focusing and stop action.  The only thing I would have changed is to frame it just a bit tighter cropping out the top, right above the white picket fence.', '2002-05-25 20:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62683, 1727, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot!  Suprisingly no motion blurs that I can see.  Good depth of field as well.</td>', 'Nice action shot!  Suprisingly no motion blurs that I can see.  Good depth of field as well.', '2002-05-25 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62684, 1727, 637, '<td valign="top">Nice stopped action.</td>', 'Nice stopped action.', '2002-05-26 01:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62685, 1727, 527, '<td valign="top">Is horse racing a game? It''s not what I would think of as a game but rather a sport.</td>', 'Is horse racing a game? It''s not what I would think of as a game but rather a sport.', '2002-05-26 02:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62686, 1727, 1061, '<td valign="top">You took this?  You actually took this?  I give you a good score!</td>', 'You took this?  You actually took this?  I give you a good score!', '2002-05-26 04:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62687, 1727, 1, '<td valign="top">Nicely caught, though I would''ve preferred to see it banned with a little blur.</td>', 'Nicely caught, though I would''ve preferred to see it banned with a little blur.', '2002-05-26 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62688, 1728, 1607, '<td valign="top">Why would he be moving into a clearly pointless position?<br/>:D</td>', 'Why would he be moving into a clearly pointless position?:D', '2002-05-20 04:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62689, 1728, 885, '<td valign="top">Creative idea.  I wish the right side weren''t to glare-y though.</td>', 'Creative idea.  I wish the right side weren''t to glare-y though.', '2002-05-20 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62690, 1728, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, though I feel you need a tighter crop.</td>', 'Nice idea, though I feel you need a tighter crop.', '2002-05-20 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62691, 1728, 327, '<td valign="top">Your very creative. Nice job.</td>', 'Your very creative. Nice job.', '2002-05-20 14:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62692, 1728, 117, '<td valign="top">cat</td>', 'cat', '2002-05-20 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62693, 1728, 1750, '<td valign="top">Clever photo.</td>', 'Clever photo.', '2002-05-20 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62694, 1728, 1143, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. I don''t like the table that you chose to set up on.</td>', 'I like the idea. I don''t like the table that you chose to set up on.', '2002-05-21 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62695, 1728, 741, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Would have gone for a tighter crop myself to take out the boring bits of the table and the flash highlight on the left.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Would have gone for a tighter crop myself to take out the boring bits of the table and the flash highlight on the left.', '2002-05-21 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62696, 1728, 193, '<td valign="top">I think including a flame would have been cool.</td>', 'I think including a flame would have been cool.', '2002-05-21 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62697, 1728, 1446, '<td valign="top">matches to play tic tac toe....thats a novel approach.....but playing with matches is not a good thing.....is it?</td>', 'matches to play tic tac toe....thats a novel approach.....but playing with matches is not a good thing.....is it?', '2002-05-21 16:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62698, 1728, 1009, '<td valign="top">Cool idea...</td>', 'Cool idea...', '2002-05-21 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62699, 1728, 1175, '<td valign="top">I like your idea for a game but I don''t like your background.  The glare on the wood from the lighting on the right is distracting.  The straight down view to the playing area is just a little dull.  I think a lower angle that that showed the hand placing in the match would have been great.</td>', 'I like your idea for a game but I don''t like your background.  The glare on the wood from the lighting on the right is distracting.  The straight down view to the playing area is just a little dull.  I think a lower angle that that showed the hand placing in the match would have been great.', '2002-05-21 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62700, 1728, 878, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the game.</td>', 'Interesting take on the game.', '2002-05-22 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62701, 1728, 1005, '<td valign="top">Are the circles "spent" matches?  Good photo, is there something in the upper center square?  Looks like a small piece of a burnt match.<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 8 Games 7 total 8</td>', 'Are the circles "spent" matches?  Good photo, is there something in the upper center square?  Looks like a small piece of a burnt match.Photo 9 Creativity 8 Games 7 total 8', '2002-05-22 18:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62702, 1728, 1597, '<td valign="top">creative</td>', 'creative', '2002-05-22 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62703, 1728, 1169, '<td valign="top">quite clever</td>', 'quite clever', '2002-05-22 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62704, 1728, 811, '<td valign="top">Very interesting idea.  I think a different background would''ve done it more justice though.</td>', 'Very interesting idea.  I think a different background would''ve done it more justice though.', '2002-05-27 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62705, 1729, 205, '<td valign="top">you either have consistent hand writing or you typed that out.</td>', 'you either have consistent hand writing or you typed that out.', '2002-05-20 02:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62706, 1729, 1647, '<td valign="top">Brilliance focus and lighting.  Making the words easy to read helps people absorb the image (they don''t become distracted trying to work them out)  Choosing a portrait layout was interesting.  If I was selling Boggle in a magazine I would seriously consider this image - well done!</td>', 'Brilliance focus and lighting.  Making the words easy to read helps people absorb the image (they don''t become distracted trying to work them out)  Choosing a portrait layout was interesting.  If I was selling Boggle in a magazine I would seriously consider this image - well done!', '2002-05-20 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62707, 1729, 47, '<td valign="top">familiar font. dirt cheap ?</td>', 'familiar font. dirt cheap ?', '2002-05-20 08:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62708, 1729, 878, '<td valign="top">Clean shot very good colors, great lighting.</td>', 'Clean shot very good colors, great lighting.', '2002-05-20 09:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62709, 1729, 1, '<td valign="top">Very nicely laid out.  This shot would also work great for advertising.</td>', 'Very nicely laid out.  This shot would also work great for advertising.', '2002-05-20 10:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62710, 1729, 1379, '<td valign="top">(Peggy Hill could have gotten WAY more words!)<br/>Nice lighting and the composition is really balanced.  I especially like the extreme point on the pencil!</td>', '(Peggy Hill could have gotten WAY more words!)Nice lighting and the composition is really balanced.  I especially like the extreme point on the pencil!', '2002-05-20 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62711, 1729, 189, '<td valign="top">Best Boggle Shot.</td>', 'Best Boggle Shot.', '2002-05-20 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62712, 1729, 327, '<td valign="top">Composition is very good, clear, clean crisp shot.</td>', 'Composition is very good, clear, clean crisp shot.', '2002-05-20 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62713, 1729, 885, '<td valign="top">the white background looks very clean, but the white paper really blends into it</td>', 'the white background looks very clean, but the white paper really blends into it', '2002-05-20 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62714, 1729, 1585, '<td valign="top">Nice Photo. Very clear well ballanced color.</td>', 'Nice Photo. Very clear well ballanced color.', '2002-05-20 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62715, 1729, 587, '<td valign="top">sorry, just seems too sterile. but on the flip side of that, it is VERY crisp and clear. :)</td>', 'sorry, just seems too sterile. but on the flip side of that, it is VERY crisp and clear. :)', '2002-05-20 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62716, 1729, 616, '<td valign="top">nice use of white</td>', 'nice use of white', '2002-05-20 17:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62717, 1729, 1756, '<td valign="top">Digit,Digital,Digitally,Digiteyes. :) That neat. <br/></td>', 'Digit,Digital,Digitally,Digiteyes. :) That neat. ', '2002-05-20 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62718, 1729, 1143, '<td valign="top">Simple, well-lit, colorful. Maybe the paper could stand out a little more. No other suggestions. Nice shot.</td>', 'Simple, well-lit, colorful. Maybe the paper could stand out a little more. No other suggestions. Nice shot.', '2002-05-21 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62719, 1729, 1263, '<td valign="top">This really should be a ad for Boggle! It made me want to play.....10</td>', 'This really should be a ad for Boggle! It made me want to play.....10', '2002-05-21 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62720, 1729, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo but it makes me want to put my sunglasses on :)  This would have also been a good entry in the advertisement challenge two weeks ago.</td>', 'This is a good photo but it makes me want to put my sunglasses on :)  This would have also been a good entry in the advertisement challenge two weeks ago.', '2002-05-21 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62721, 1729, 1446, '<td valign="top">Nice use of white. I would really like to know how you managed to get so few shadows....Interesting shot.</td>', 'Nice use of white. I would really like to know how you managed to get so few shadows....Interesting shot.', '2002-05-21 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62722, 1729, 1078, '<td valign="top">This seems a little sterile.  I think a different base color would have been useful to differentiate from the paper.  Also, I appreciate why you might want to use a freshly sharpened pencil, but if all those words have already been written, wouldn''t it be not quite so sharp?  In fact, it may be the words themselves that make me think of this as sterile.  If I''m playing a timed game like this, my own writing is nowhere near that neat and tidy.  This all makes it sound worse than I really think it is.  Good work.</td>', 'This seems a little sterile.  I think a different base color would have been useful to differentiate from the paper.  Also, I appreciate why you might want to use a freshly sharpened pencil, but if all those words have already been written, wouldn''t it be not quite so sharp?  In fact, it may be the words themselves that make me think of this as sterile.  If I''m playing a timed game like this, my own writing is nowhere near that neat and tidy.  This all makes it sound worse than I really think it is.  Good work.', '2002-05-21 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62723, 1729, 113, '<td valign="top">mat, hid, etc.    Sharp and clear.</td>', 'mat, hid, etc.    Sharp and clear.', '2002-05-22 07:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62724, 1729, 1054, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing the inclusion of the word "digitally" was intentional?  This is a beautiful image... my only complaint, a very minor one, is that the white-balance seems just off.</td>', 'I''m guessing the inclusion of the word "digitally" was intentional?  This is a beautiful image... my only complaint, a very minor one, is that the white-balance seems just off.', '2002-05-22 08:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62725, 1729, 1681, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of lighting for this photo.  It compliments the colors quite well.  I probably would have tightend the composition up some, but that may have ruined the clean crisp look.  Good job.</td>', 'I like your choice of lighting for this photo.  It compliments the colors quite well.  I probably would have tightend the composition up some, but that may have ruined the clean crisp look.  Good job.', '2002-05-23 07:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62726, 1729, 1005, '<td valign="top">You missed digital</td>', 'You missed digital', '2002-05-23 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62727, 1729, 1042, '<td valign="top">This really appeals to the graphic designer in me. I love the subtle use of color, the sharpness and clarity of the game and words...it would make an excellent product shot for Boggle as well. Good job.</td>', 'This really appeals to the graphic designer in me. I love the subtle use of color, the sharpness and clarity of the game and words...it would make an excellent product shot for Boggle as well. Good job.', '2002-05-23 21:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62728, 1729, 1597, '<td valign="top">I think this would have looked beeter with alittle more contrast of colors</td>', 'I think this would have looked beeter with alittle more contrast of colors', '2002-05-23 22:18:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(62729, 1729, 1202, '<td valign="top">I found a nine letter word, which might be a subliminal message.   Good lay out and idea.    White balance might be improved due to the overbearing blue tones.</td>', 'I found a nine letter word, which might be a subliminal message.   Good lay out and idea.    White balance might be improved due to the overbearing blue tones.', '2002-05-24 18:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62730, 1729, 543, '<td valign="top">Very fine.  Great colors and composition.  Slight oversharpening shows in the lettering and around the edges of the cubes, and the lighitng isn''t quite even (falls off at the bottom and in the ULHC), but these are minor issues.  You did see "digitally, right?</td>', 'Very fine.  Great colors and composition.  Slight oversharpening shows in the lettering and around the edges of the cubes, and the lighitng isn''t quite even (falls off at the bottom and in the ULHC), but these are minor issues.  You did see "digitally, right?', '2002-05-25 02:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62731, 1729, 1066, '<td valign="top">Clean, well photographed..best of the board game set shots for me this week.  I am guessing you have a nice light set or you really can work the table lamps to great effect to get such even lighting :-)</td>', 'Clean, well photographed..best of the board game set shots for me this week.  I am guessing you have a nice light set or you really can work the table lamps to great effect to get such even lighting :-)', '2002-05-25 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62732, 1729, 255, '<td valign="top">digit, metal, easy, games, tally, gates, sell... Go for those big words! 12 extra points for you!! <br/>Just kidding. Cool picture, fun game. I like the plain composition and the starkness of this picture. Good job.</td>', 'digit, metal, easy, games, tally, gates, sell... Go for those big words! 12 extra points for you!! Just kidding. Cool picture, fun game. I like the plain composition and the starkness of this picture. Good job.', '2002-05-25 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62733, 1729, 280, '<td valign="top">Love this photo great composition and lighting.</td>', 'Love this photo great composition and lighting.', '2002-05-25 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62734, 1731, 47, '<td valign="top">clever what with the hands there.</td>', 'clever what with the hands there.', '2002-05-20 07:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62735, 1731, 1585, '<td valign="top">Great idea.</td>', 'Great idea.', '2002-05-20 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62736, 1731, 1379, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Very clever!</td>', 'Awesome!  Very clever!', '2002-05-20 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62737, 1731, 327, '<td valign="top">Cute, clever, creative idea. I thought of it also, but you''ve done it well.<br/>Maybe a bit too dark and the rock is a little lost here. Still it''s a fun shot!<br/></td>', 'Cute, clever, creative idea. I thought of it also, but you''ve done it well.Maybe a bit too dark and the rock is a little lost here. Still it''s a fun shot!', '2002-05-20 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62738, 1731, 933, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo &amp; fun concept.  A little dark.</td>', 'Interesting photo & fun concept.  A little dark.', '2002-05-20 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62739, 1731, 1175, '<td valign="top">This is a cool photo but I think having the hand and the paper is a little too much.  I think there might be too much going on in this picture.  Either all hands or all elements definitely would have been cool.</td>', 'This is a cool photo but I think having the hand and the paper is a little too much.  I think there might be too much going on in this picture.  Either all hands or all elements definitely would have been cool.', '2002-05-20 14:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62740, 1731, 1750, '<td valign="top">good use of zone technique. The story is amusing and clear.</td>', 'good use of zone technique. The story is amusing and clear.', '2002-05-20 15:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62741, 1731, 1756, '<td valign="top">Tie</td>', 'Tie', '2002-05-20 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62742, 1731, 570, '<td valign="top">good one</td>', 'good one', '2002-05-20 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62743, 1731, 1712, '<td valign="top">At first I did''nt get it but now I do!!</td>', 'At first I did''nt get it but now I do!!', '2002-05-20 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62744, 1731, 772, '<td valign="top">I was hoping someone would do this shot!  You have done an excellent job with it as well.  The contrast is maybe a little weak to suit me but I do like the black background quite a bit.  = 9</td>', 'I was hoping someone would do this shot!  You have done an excellent job with it as well.  The contrast is maybe a little weak to suit me but I do like the black background quite a bit.  = 9', '2002-05-20 21:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62745, 1731, 543, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  A bit dark, especially against the white DPC background.  The wrinkles and sloppy edge on the paper detract a little, and the scissors and hand are just out of focus range, but a great idea and well executed overall.</td>', 'Interesting.  A bit dark, especially against the white DPC background.  The wrinkles and sloppy edge on the paper detract a little, and the scissors and hand are just out of focus range, but a great idea and well executed overall.', '2002-05-21 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62746, 1731, 509, '<td valign="top">Very creative - made my top ten.  Nice sharp focus as well</td>', 'Very creative - made my top ten.  Nice sharp focus as well', '2002-05-21 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62747, 1731, 1446, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea for a shot....if you had done this with one type of stuff or the other I would have liked it better.</td>', 'I really like this idea for a shot....if you had done this with one type of stuff or the other I would have liked it better.', '2002-05-21 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62748, 1731, 1009, '<td valign="top">Very nice, artistic, magazine quality...</td>', 'Very nice, artistic, magazine quality...', '2002-05-21 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62749, 1731, 441, '<td valign="top">good idea, nice shot, difficult to find right crop.</td>', 'good idea, nice shot, difficult to find right crop.', '2002-05-21 17:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62750, 1731, 587, '<td valign="top">points for originality! Very creative, like the b&amp;w, but perhaps a smaller rock would keep it looking like an unidentifiable object ( a little too dark to see it right away) or maybe it''s the way it''s cropped (?) good job, like it.</td>', 'points for originality! Very creative, like the b&w, but perhaps a smaller rock would keep it looking like an unidentifiable object ( a little too dark to see it right away) or maybe it''s the way it''s cropped (?) good job, like it.', '2002-05-21 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62751, 1731, 878, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on RPS</td>', 'Interesting take on RPS', '2002-05-21 18:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62752, 1731, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very funny :)</td>', 'Very funny :)', '2002-05-22 08:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62753, 1731, 1054, '<td valign="top">Beautiful....</td>', 'Beautiful....', '2002-05-22 09:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62754, 1731, 1, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, the lighting is cool too, though the scissors may be dark.</td>', 'Nicely done, the lighting is cool too, though the scissors may be dark.', '2002-05-22 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62755, 1731, 1005, '<td valign="top">Love the concept!  Good illustration, effectively done.  (Not the oldest game, though)  Photo 9 Creativity 10 Games 9 total 10</td>', 'Love the concept!  Good illustration, effectively done.  (Not the oldest game, though)  Photo 9 Creativity 10 Games 9 total 10', '2002-05-22 18:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62756, 1731, 842, '<td valign="top">creative idea.</td>', 'creative idea.', '2002-05-22 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62757, 1731, 1597, '<td valign="top">very creative</td>', 'very creative', '2002-05-22 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62758, 1731, 824, '<td valign="top">Smart!</td>', 'Smart!', '2002-05-22 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62759, 1731, 301, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting concept and well done on deciding on something very different.  I''m not sure I would have used the props - one arm of the scissors blocks almost all of a finger.  Not sure I really like having the black space in the centre of the photo either</td>', 'This is an interesting concept and well done on deciding on something very different.  I''m not sure I would have used the props - one arm of the scissors blocks almost all of a finger.  Not sure I really like having the black space in the centre of the photo either', '2002-05-23 06:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62760, 1731, 332, '<td valign="top">Actually the oldest game in the book is "Bocce".<br/><br/>As early as 5000 B.C. the Egyptians played a form of bocce with polished rocks. Graphic representations of figures tossing a ball or polished stone have been recorded as early as 5200 B.C. While bocce today looks quite different from its early predecessors, the unbroken thread of bocces lineage is the consistently common objective of trying to come as close to a fixed target as possible.</td>', 'Actually the oldest game in the book is "Bocce".As early as 5000 B.C. the Egyptians played a form of bocce with polished rocks. Graphic representations of figures tossing a ball or polished stone have been recorded as early as 5200 B.C. While bocce today looks quite different from its early predecessors, the unbroken thread of bocces lineage is the consistently common objective of trying to come as close to a fixed target as possible.', '2002-05-23 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62761, 1731, 1042, '<td valign="top">I saw this in thumbnail size and really thought it was cool....and seeing it larger just confirms it. I like the idea and I love the use of black and white with this.Very nice.</td>', 'I saw this in thumbnail size and really thought it was cool....and seeing it larger just confirms it. I like the idea and I love the use of black and white with this.Very nice.', '2002-05-23 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62762, 1731, 1793, '<td valign="top">*laughs* this took me a while to figure out. fun!</td>', '*laughs* this took me a while to figure out. fun!', '2002-05-23 22:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62763, 1731, 173, '<td valign="top">Clever!</td>', 'Clever!', '2002-05-24 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
