(62874, 1736, 1, '<td valign="top">Colors are nice, though something needs to be done about the shadow in the foreground.</td>', 'Colors are nice, though something needs to be done about the shadow in the foreground.', '2002-05-26 09:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62875, 1736, 441, '<td valign="top">good colours, dof and composition</td>', 'good colours, dof and composition', '2002-05-26 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62876, 1737, 327, '<td valign="top">Good mood, good composition.</td>', 'Good mood, good composition.', '2002-05-20 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62877, 1737, 1585, '<td valign="top">Wish I could get this much depth of field. Doesn''t feel like it''s raining though. <br/>Is that sunlight coming through the window?</td>', 'Wish I could get this much depth of field. Doesn''t feel like it''s raining though. Is that sunlight coming through the window?', '2002-05-20 13:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62878, 1737, 862, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and background.</td>', 'Nice perspective and background.', '2002-05-20 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62879, 1737, 724, '<td valign="top">I love the "Grandma''s kitchen" feel.</td>', 'I love the "Grandma''s kitchen" feel.', '2002-05-20 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62880, 1737, 1175, '<td valign="top">I like this image.  The background is distracting though.  I would have prefered a horizontally oriented picture with more board on the sides.</td>', 'I like this image.  The background is distracting though.  I would have prefered a horizontally oriented picture with more board on the sides.', '2002-05-20 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62881, 1737, 1750, '<td valign="top">Good zone technique,  leading the eye,  and mood.</td>', 'Good zone technique,  leading the eye,  and mood.', '2002-05-20 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62882, 1737, 1569, '<td valign="top">Lots of distractions.</td>', 'Lots of distractions.', '2002-05-20 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62883, 1737, 301, '<td valign="top">The lines in the photo seem to lead my eye to the background, which isn''t really the main subject.  Perhaps some blur in the background through even less DOF may have eliminated this effect.  Seeing as the focus is on the middle black piece, you could probably have cropped the bottom to get rid of the edge of the board too.</td>', 'The lines in the photo seem to lead my eye to the background, which isn''t really the main subject.  Perhaps some blur in the background through even less DOF may have eliminated this effect.  Seeing as the focus is on the middle black piece, you could probably have cropped the bottom to get rid of the edge of the board too.', '2002-05-21 06:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62884, 1737, 1446, '<td valign="top">I like the nostalgic feel of this shot.  Black and White was a good choice.</td>', 'I like the nostalgic feel of this shot.  Black and White was a good choice.', '2002-05-21 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62885, 1737, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I like the black and white very much in this photo.. good job!</td>', 'Nice!  I like the black and white very much in this photo.. good job!', '2002-05-21 20:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62886, 1737, 1037, '<td valign="top">Great camera angle, and the lighting seems just right to me. Very nice photo.</td>', 'Great camera angle, and the lighting seems just right to me. Very nice photo.', '2002-05-21 22:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62887, 1737, 244, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black and white, I would have liked to see someone in the chair, would have added more feeling to this shot, as it stands it looks like an abandoned game.</td>', 'Nice use of black and white, I would have liked to see someone in the chair, would have added more feeling to this shot, as it stands it looks like an abandoned game.', '2002-05-21 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62888, 1737, 741, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, good focusing.  Slightly less depth of field might have made the background less cluttered.</td>', 'Nice angle, good focusing.  Slightly less depth of field might have made the background less cluttered.', '2002-05-22 11:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62889, 1737, 1597, '<td valign="top">Nice angle this looks good in B&amp;W</td>', 'Nice angle this looks good in B&W', '2002-05-23 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62890, 1737, 255, '<td valign="top">The angle on this picture is awesome. The background fits perfectly with your title and intent. I think that another way of looking at this picture<br/>might have been to crop it closer at the bottom to cut out the left corner (word?) and to put a solid black background at the end of the table to<br/>make it more dramatic--to fit with the dramatic angle. This is just an idea, of course! I really like this photo.</td>', 'The angle on this picture is awesome. The background fits perfectly with your title and intent. I think that another way of looking at this picturemight have been to crop it closer at the bottom to cut out the left corner (word?) and to put a solid black background at the end of the table tomake it more dramatic--to fit with the dramatic angle. This is just an idea, of course! I really like this photo.', '2002-05-24 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62891, 1737, 1041, '<td valign="top">B&amp;w works well here, love the angle, too.  Somehow the lighting doesn''t conjure up thoughts of rain, but who cares.  I would''ve cropped a smidgen more off the top so that the little bit of black at the top of the chair wasn''t there, but that''s a very minor change.  Good job!</td>', 'B&w works well here, love the angle, too.  Somehow the lighting doesn''t conjure up thoughts of rain, but who cares.  I would''ve cropped a smidgen more off the top so that the little bit of black at the top of the chair wasn''t there, but that''s a very minor change.  Good job!', '2002-05-24 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62892, 1737, 689, '<td valign="top">The background is distracting ... been nicer in color, since there is so much dark and light in checkers ....</td>', 'The background is distracting ... been nicer in color, since there is so much dark and light in checkers ....', '2002-05-25 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62893, 1737, 1128, '<td valign="top">Don''t know about the choice of B&amp; W for this.  Might have stood out a little more in color.  The photo has a very relaxing quality to it.</td>', 'Don''t know about the choice of B& W for this.  Might have stood out a little more in color.  The photo has a very relaxing quality to it.', '2002-05-25 09:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62894, 1737, 1066, '<td valign="top">Probably the best use of depth of field this week.<br/><br/>Great shot, nice use of black and white, well photographed.  This is a nice camera as well or you handle it well or both. :-)</td>', 'Probably the best use of depth of field this week.Great shot, nice use of black and white, well photographed.  This is a nice camera as well or you handle it well or both. :-)', '2002-05-25 11:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62895, 1737, 637, '<td valign="top">Too much chazerai (Yiddish for stuff) in the background.</td>', 'Too much chazerai (Yiddish for stuff) in the background.', '2002-05-26 00:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62896, 1737, 527, '<td valign="top">I think I would have adjust the angle a little bit so you showed a little less of the background.. Black and white works well here.</td>', 'I think I would have adjust the angle a little bit so you showed a little less of the background.. Black and white works well here.', '2002-05-26 02:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62897, 1737, 1, '<td valign="top">Angle is strange, I would''nt have chosen to include the chair and table in the shot -- it''s a bit distracting.</td>', 'Angle is strange, I would''nt have chosen to include the chair and table in the shot -- it''s a bit distracting.', '2002-05-27 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62898, 1740, 798, '<td valign="top">This is a winner!</td>', 'This is a winner!', '2002-05-20 02:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62899, 1740, 92, '<td valign="top">My second 10 of the day ! PERFECT photo !</td>', 'My second 10 of the day ! PERFECT photo !', '2002-05-20 07:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62900, 1740, 1336, '<td valign="top">wow.  nice picture.  it looks like they''re playing in the clouds.  other than the diagonal (wire?) on the left side of the photo, there are no distractions in the picture.  this is in my top 5.</td>', 'wow.  nice picture.  it looks like they''re playing in the clouds.  other than the diagonal (wire?) on the left side of the photo, there are no distractions in the picture.  this is in my top 5.', '2002-05-20 07:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62901, 1740, 1379, '<td valign="top">Great sky!</td>', 'Great sky!', '2002-05-20 07:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62902, 1740, 681, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, I like the lighting and shadow effects. Excellent photograph.</td>', 'I like the subject, I like the lighting and shadow effects. Excellent photograph.', '2002-05-20 08:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62903, 1740, 878, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.</td>', 'This is a great shot.', '2002-05-20 09:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62904, 1740, 1585, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.', '2002-05-20 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62905, 1740, 1344, '<td valign="top">Awesome cept for that thing behind the ump....</td>', 'Awesome cept for that thing behind the ump....', '2002-05-20 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62906, 1740, 327, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Horizion is a bit of a problem, but this is good work. Creative.</td>', 'Great idea. Horizion is a bit of a problem, but this is good work. Creative.', '2002-05-20 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62907, 1740, 1446, '<td valign="top">A great composition!  The only thing I marked you down for is that String?  Wire? behind your umpire.  Its probably supposed to be here judging by how perfect the rest of the picture is, but I personally found it a little distracting.    Still one of my top 5!</td>', 'A great composition!  The only thing I marked you down for is that String?  Wire? behind your umpire.  Its probably supposed to be here judging by how perfect the rest of the picture is, but I personally found it a little distracting.    Still one of my top 5!', '2002-05-20 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62908, 1740, 587, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot. I wish that line or pole or whatever that is behind the umpire wasn''t there, I''m sure you do to :) Great job.</td>', 'this is a great shot. I wish that line or pole or whatever that is behind the umpire wasn''t there, I''m sure you do to :) Great job.', '2002-05-20 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62909, 1740, 689, '<td valign="top">Cool shot ... a little too much headroom for my taste ... but overall good.</td>', 'Cool shot ... a little too much headroom for my taste ... but overall good.', '2002-05-20 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62910, 1740, 1, '<td valign="top">Great use of a silhouette, the shot looks great.</td>', 'Great use of a silhouette, the shot looks great.', '2002-05-20 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62911, 1740, 885, '<td valign="top">Amazing.  I really like the reddish highlights that give a little bit of texture to the silhouettes.  The ONLY thing I don''t like is that wire that seems to be poking from the umpire''s bottom, but that''s a nitpick, cause this is great.</td>', 'Amazing.  I really like the reddish highlights that give a little bit of texture to the silhouettes.  The ONLY thing I don''t like is that wire that seems to be poking from the umpire''s bottom, but that''s a nitpick, cause this is great.', '2002-05-20 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62912, 1740, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photograph and the only (very small) critsism is the antenna or something on the left hand border.  I gave this very high marks.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photograph and the only (very small) critsism is the antenna or something on the left hand border.  I gave this very high marks.', '2002-05-20 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62913, 1740, 772, '<td valign="top">This is very nicely done!  I wouldn''t change a thing about it.  Sorry that I don''t have a better comment.. = 10!  Good job!</td>', 'This is very nicely done!  I wouldn''t change a thing about it.  Sorry that I don''t have a better comment.. = 10!  Good job!', '2002-05-20 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62914, 1740, 1750, '<td valign="top">Like the drama and sharpness of the silhouettes. I can feel the pitcher winding up.</td>', 'Like the drama and sharpness of the silhouettes. I can feel the pitcher winding up.', '2002-05-20 19:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62915, 1740, 1263, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2002-05-21 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62916, 1740, 301, '<td valign="top">not sure whether it''s my screen, but there isn''t much detail below the the top of the clouds in the horizon.  The actual image itself is great ... I love the silhouettes of the players and umpire.  Not sure what the line coming from the umpire is either</td>', 'not sure whether it''s my screen, but there isn''t much detail below the the top of the clouds in the horizon.  The actual image itself is great ... I love the silhouettes of the players and umpire.  Not sure what the line coming from the umpire is either', '2002-05-21 08:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62917, 1740, 1078, '<td valign="top">I think I would have opted for cropping this one to the 640x427 size.  There seems to be just a little too much space over the tops of the subjects.  Love the way their roles all come through clearly (at least if you know baseball) even though they''re in silhouette.</td>', 'I think I would have opted for cropping this one to the 640x427 size.  There seems to be just a little too much space over the tops of the subjects.  Love the way their roles all come through clearly (at least if you know baseball) even though they''re in silhouette.', '2002-05-21 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62918, 1740, 1009, '<td valign="top">Awesome!</td>', 'Awesome!', '2002-05-21 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62919, 1740, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great photo (potential winner).  The framing is excellent and the backlight effect of the sky has turned reality into art.</td>', 'Great photo (potential winner).  The framing is excellent and the backlight effect of the sky has turned reality into art.', '2002-05-21 20:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62920, 1740, 1037, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous :). The feeling of expectation and tension here is really powerful. I love the use of silhouettes, creating a tight focus on the body language of the people. Definitely a 10 from me.</td>', 'Gorgeous :). The feeling of expectation and tension here is really powerful. I love the use of silhouettes, creating a tight focus on the body language of the people. Definitely a 10 from me.', '2002-05-21 22:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62921, 1740, 113, '<td valign="top">Nice sillouettes.  Maybe somre cropping at the bottom, yes I think thats it.</td>', 'Nice sillouettes.  Maybe somre cropping at the bottom, yes I think thats it.', '2002-05-22 06:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62922, 1740, 1054, '<td valign="top">The silhouetting in this image is a nice touch.</td>', 'The silhouetting in this image is a nice touch.', '2002-05-22 08:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62923, 1740, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shadow.  Too bad rules wouldn''t allow editing the sun reflections from the helmets.  Photo 9 Creativity 8 Games 8 total 8</td>', 'Nice use of shadow.  Too bad rules wouldn''t allow editing the sun reflections from the helmets.  Photo 9 Creativity 8 Games 8 total 8', '2002-05-22 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62924, 1740, 842, '<td valign="top">I love the silhouttes with the blue sky. nice shot.</td>', 'I love the silhouttes with the blue sky. nice shot.', '2002-05-22 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62925, 1740, 1597, '<td valign="top">neat angle and sky color and contrast</td>', 'neat angle and sky color and contrast', '2002-05-22 20:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62926, 1740, 554, '<td valign="top">my top 4</td>', 'my top 4', '2002-05-22 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62927, 1740, 1707, '<td valign="top">Love the colors in the sky!  Brings romance to baseball. Good job! -NBT</td>', 'Love the colors in the sky!  Brings romance to baseball. Good job! -NBT', '2002-05-23 06:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62928, 1740, 573, '<td valign="top">I like the use of back lighting and uncluttered background to tell the story.  FWIW I would crop with some moor sky on the right so the batter isn''t looking directly out of the frame.</td>', 'I like the use of back lighting and uncluttered background to tell the story.  FWIW I would crop with some moor sky on the right so the batter isn''t looking directly out of the frame.', '2002-05-23 09:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62929, 1740, 1195, '<td valign="top">I think this photo is awsome. With the silouette players (excuse my spelling please) and the cloud backround that is so cool. I give it a 10.</td>', 'I think this photo is awsome. With the silouette players (excuse my spelling please) and the cloud backround that is so cool. I give it a 10.', '2002-05-23 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62930, 1740, 1799, '<td valign="top">People silhouette graduates with sunset shading.  The sky behind does not match their coloring.  That would have added to the feel for the time of the photograph.</td>', 'People silhouette graduates with sunset shading.  The sky behind does not match their coloring.  That would have added to the feel for the time of the photograph.', '2002-05-23 17:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62931, 1740, 1808, '<td valign="top">Nice color and depth.</td>', 'Nice color and depth.', '2002-05-23 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62932, 1740, 173, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast!</td>', 'Nice contrast!', '2002-05-24 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62933, 1740, 748, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette shot.</td>', 'Nice silhouette shot.', '2002-05-24 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62934, 1740, 543, '<td valign="top">Nice silhhouette against a good, dramatic sky.  Doesn''t look to me like they''re at the ballpark, though.  Did you shoot this up on a rooftop?  XXX behind the ump detracts, and the batter looking out of the frame doesn''t work so well.  Don''t know how you could avoid the latter.  A lower angle to get some more of the players against the bright sky, maybe?</td>', 'Nice silhhouette against a good, dramatic sky.  Doesn''t look to me like they''re at the ballpark, though.  Did you shoot this up on a rooftop?  XXX behind the ump detracts, and the batter looking out of the frame doesn''t work so well.  Don''t know how you could avoid the latter.  A lower angle to get some more of the players against the bright sky, maybe?', '2002-05-25 03:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62935, 1740, 1679, '<td valign="top">Nice one! I like the silhouettes.<br/>I think you could have done beter with cropping out the top third of the photo. All it includes is a grey cloud. It does nothing to the warmth of the photo.<br/>Otherwise, very nice!<br/>I like the way your models are posed. Although I can not see their faces, it is enough to feel their anxiety and concentration on the game. Well done!</td>', 'Nice one! I like the silhouettes.I think you could have done beter with cropping out the top third of the photo. All it includes is a grey cloud. It does nothing to the warmth of the photo.Otherwise, very nice!I like the way your models are posed. Although I can not see their faces, it is enough to feel their anxiety and concentration on the game. Well done!', '2002-05-25 09:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62936, 1740, 441, '<td valign="top">greats silhouettes - I think that''s how you spell it!</td>', 'greats silhouettes - I think that''s how you spell it!', '2002-05-25 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62937, 1740, 428, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sillouettes, I love the way the light is highlighting them just a bit on their backs.  The only problem that I see is that building on the lower left. There is a wire coming out of it, right behind the umpire.</td>', 'Beautiful sillouettes, I love the way the light is highlighting them just a bit on their backs.  The only problem that I see is that building on the lower left. There is a wire coming out of it, right behind the umpire.', '2002-05-25 21:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62938, 1740, 527, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic lighting. I would have preferred that the scene be shifted to the left so there is more space in front of the batter and less space behind the umpire.</td>', 'Very dramatic lighting. I would have preferred that the scene be shifted to the left so there is more space in front of the batter and less space behind the umpire.', '2002-05-26 02:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62939, 1740, 1360, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely wonderful photo.</td>', 'This is an absolutely wonderful photo.', '2002-05-26 03:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62940, 1740, 3280, '<td valign="top">I really love this photo.  One of my favorites on dpchallenge.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'I really love this photo.  One of my favorites on dpchallenge.  Keep up the good work.', '2002-08-20 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(62941, 1741, 1379, '<td valign="top">I love the scale of this picture!  This looks like a winner!</td>', 'I love the scale of this picture!  This looks like a winner!', '2002-05-20 10:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62942, 1741, 1585, '<td valign="top">I wanna play.</td>', 'I wanna play.', '2002-05-20 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62943, 1741, 1744, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Is this a candid shot?</td>', 'Nice.  Is this a candid shot?', '2002-05-20 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62944, 1741, 587, '<td valign="top">lol, this is a great shot. looks like fun. good job.</td>', 'lol, this is a great shot. looks like fun. good job.', '2002-05-20 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62945, 1741, 259, '<td valign="top">the background is really washed out.</td>', 'the background is really washed out.', '2002-05-20 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62946, 1741, 1, '<td valign="top">A different time of day could''ve allowed you to have under the tree lit up, and the background/water not so over-exposed.  Otherwise a cute idea.</td>', 'A different time of day could''ve allowed you to have under the tree lit up, and the background/water not so over-exposed.  Otherwise a cute idea.', '2002-05-20 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(62947, 1741, 689, '<td valign="top">It would have been nice if you had a better background behind the boy on the ground, but I think overall, it is a good shot .... cute too ....</td>', 'It would have been nice if you had a better background behind the boy on the ground, but I think overall, it is a good shot .... cute too ....', '2002-05-20 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62948, 1741, 327, '<td valign="top">Wow that is some tree, cute kids. Maybe a crop at the bottom would of helped this.<br/>All in all a good try.</td>', 'Wow that is some tree, cute kids. Maybe a crop at the bottom would of helped this.All in all a good try.', '2002-05-20 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62949, 1741, 724, '<td valign="top">Great tree, the background (lake?) is just too blown out!</td>', 'Great tree, the background (lake?) is just too blown out!', '2002-05-20 14:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62950, 1741, 1143, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot. I wish that the..is it water?...wasn''t overexposed.</td>', 'Really nice shot. I wish that the..is it water?...wasn''t overexposed.', '2002-05-21 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62951, 1741, 543, '<td valign="top">The pose on ground-boy is classic!  Very tough lighting situation shooting from open shade into bright sunlight.  The blown background only really detracts near the top where it shows through the leaves, IMO.  It would take a pretty mighty strobe to fill this scene.</td>', 'The pose on ground-boy is classic!  Very tough lighting situation shooting from open shade into bright sunlight.  The blown background only really detracts near the top where it shows through the leaves, IMO.  It would take a pretty mighty strobe to fill this scene.', '2002-05-21 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62952, 1741, 862, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  Needs a little more light.  I''d try spot metering on a something that''s not too dark or too bright, maybe the ground to the left of the tree.</td>', 'Great composition.  Needs a little more light.  I''d try spot metering on a something that''s not too dark or too bright, maybe the ground to the left of the tree.', '2002-05-21 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62953, 1741, 1446, '<td valign="top">Great idea...This would have been a really good photo it you had cropped it lighter to that adorable little boy in the tree....</td>', 'Great idea...This would have been a really good photo it you had cropped it lighter to that adorable little boy in the tree....', '2002-05-21 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62954, 1741, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love this photo, such tiny boys and such a big tree. They look virtually lilliputian :)</td>', 'I love this photo, such tiny boys and such a big tree. They look virtually lilliputian :)', '2002-05-22 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62955, 1741, 772, '<td valign="top">Thats a huge tree!  The background in this photo looks a little over exposed but I like the overall image... good job!</td>', 'Thats a huge tree!  The background in this photo looks a little over exposed but I like the overall image... good job!', '2002-05-22 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62956, 1741, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, horrible background.  Photo 7 Creativity 8 Games 7 total 7</td>', 'Cute idea, horrible background.  Photo 7 Creativity 8 Games 7 total 7', '2002-05-22 18:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
