(62962, 1741, 193, '<td valign="top">I gave you one of my highest scores!  I''m disappointed you didn''t score higher overall.  What a great picture!  You really captured children playing this game!  I love how the child at the bottom is in that dynamic pose.  Gorgeous tree.  Personally, I like that the background is washed-out; otherwise it would detract from the foreground action.  Well done.</td>', 'I gave you one of my highest scores!  I''m disappointed you didn''t score higher overall.  What a great picture!  You really captured children playing this game!  I love how the child at the bottom is in that dynamic pose.  Gorgeous tree.  Personally, I like that the background is washed-out; otherwise it would detract from the foreground action.  Well done.', '2002-05-27 08:26:00.000000', NULL, 0),
