(62974, 1742, 1446, '<td valign="top">Good focus, Great color.</td>', 'Good focus, Great color.', '2002-05-21 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62975, 1742, 1647, '<td valign="top">If your version of scrabble is what I suspect it is (ie: you get to eat the candy when you place a letter on it''s square) - then I want to play too.  You have just invented a game I want to play - I think that meets the criteria of this challenge - Well done.</td>', 'If your version of scrabble is what I suspect it is (ie: you get to eat the candy when you place a letter on it''s square) - then I want to play too.  You have just invented a game I want to play - I think that meets the criteria of this challenge - Well done.', '2002-05-21 21:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62976, 1742, 772, '<td valign="top">I like your concept with this photo... very unique!  The only critique I have for this photo is the uneven lighting... the light is brigher in the lower right corner and it gets darker across the subject as it moves diagonally to the left.  When I am making indoor photos, I try to avoid the need to use my flash by positioning my subject in a naturally lit area, like in front of a window or sliding glass door. Nice job!</td>', 'I like your concept with this photo... very unique!  The only critique I have for this photo is the uneven lighting... the light is brigher in the lower right corner and it gets darker across the subject as it moves diagonally to the left.  When I am making indoor photos, I try to avoid the need to use my flash by positioning my subject in a naturally lit area, like in front of a window or sliding glass door. Nice job!', '2002-05-22 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62977, 1742, 1597, '<td valign="top">very creative crisp and clear shot</td>', 'very creative crisp and clear shot', '2002-05-22 20:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
