(62992, 1743, 1446, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of action.  I find the movement right thru the center of the picture keeps bringing my eye to that spot.</td>', 'Nice capture of action.  I find the movement right thru the center of the picture keeps bringing my eye to that spot.', '2002-05-20 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62993, 1743, 1, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Awesome use of shutter.  I personally think it looks a lot better if you auto-level it.  I think you''ve despeckled it, which always brightens the darker spots up a bit.  Auto-level brings em right back down.</td>', 'Wow!  Awesome use of shutter.  I personally think it looks a lot better if you auto-level it.  I think you''ve despeckled it, which always brightens the darker spots up a bit.  Auto-level brings em right back down.', '2002-05-20 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62994, 1743, 1750, '<td valign="top">Good action shot.</td>', 'Good action shot.', '2002-05-20 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62995, 1743, 327, '<td valign="top">Just good, whole thing. Comp, DOF, sharp, clean! Wonderful job.</td>', 'Just good, whole thing. Comp, DOF, sharp, clean! Wonderful job.', '2002-05-20 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62996, 1743, 772, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites this week... I really enjoy a photograph that does a crisp and clean job of relaying motion.  Conveying motion in a photo effectively is difficult to do sometimes.  I suppose that this shot is a rather long exposure with a single light source off to the left of the frame.  I thought it may be second curtain sync but I''m not sure.. I would love to know!  I''ll hopefully see this one in the ''how''d they do that'' section next week sometime!  Good job! = 10</td>', 'This is one of my favorites this week... I really enjoy a photograph that does a crisp and clean job of relaying motion.  Conveying motion in a photo effectively is difficult to do sometimes.  I suppose that this shot is a rather long exposure with a single light source off to the left of the frame.  I thought it may be second curtain sync but I''m not sure.. I would love to know!  I''ll hopefully see this one in the ''how''d they do that'' section next week sometime!  Good job! = 10', '2002-05-20 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62997, 1743, 737, '<td valign="top">Best of the dice. Good transition shot.</td>', 'Best of the dice. Good transition shot.', '2002-05-20 20:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62998, 1743, 301, '<td valign="top">pretty cool.  nicer if you''d rolled a 6 and called it ''High Roller'' :)  I''m guessing it took a while to get that shot anyway.</td>', 'pretty cool.  nicer if you''d rolled a 6 and called it ''High Roller'' :)  I''m guessing it took a while to get that shot anyway.', '2002-05-21 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(62999, 1743, 741, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot.  Would probably have been even better if the dice with a 2 on top was either moving as well (just a bit) or wasn''t so obviously blocking the path of the other one.</td>', 'Nice action shot.  Would probably have been even better if the dice with a 2 on top was either moving as well (just a bit) or wasn''t so obviously blocking the path of the other one.', '2002-05-21 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
