(63003, 1743, 1647, '<td valign="top">I''m curious as to how you took this picture...  At first I thought "good use of long exposure" yet there is no blur between the dice landing and rolling over.  Is it infact two dice (ie: one stationary) ?  Is this is a single exposure photo then you have done very well.</td>', 'I''m curious as to how you took this picture...  At first I thought "good use of long exposure" yet there is no blur between the dice landing and rolling over.  Is it infact two dice (ie: one stationary) ?  Is this is a single exposure photo then you have done very well.', '2002-05-21 19:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63004, 1743, 1597, '<td valign="top">Nice catch of this effect</td>', 'Nice catch of this effect', '2002-05-21 20:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63005, 1743, 1037, '<td valign="top">The motion blur on the die is very effective, but unfortunately the hand has become a big, pink blob, which I think is a bit distracting. Cool photo though.</td>', 'The motion blur on the die is very effective, but unfortunately the hand has become a big, pink blob, which I think is a bit distracting. Cool photo though.', '2002-05-21 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63006, 1743, 901, '<td valign="top">awesome picture</td>', 'awesome picture', '2002-05-22 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
