(63009, 1743, 1681, '<td valign="top">I like the motion.  Will be interested to hear about the exact technique.  Fits the catagory well.  I think it is missing something, just not sure what.  I think it may have been better with more die (like in Yatzee).</td>', 'I like the motion.  Will be interested to hear about the exact technique.  Fits the catagory well.  I think it is missing something, just not sure what.  I think it may have been better with more die (like in Yatzee).', '2002-05-23 07:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
