(63052, 1744, 1042, '<td valign="top">this is one of my 10''s, I love the setup and the well-worn baseball is a great touch. I remember watching many a little league game in my lifetime...days gone by is a great title.</td>', 'this is one of my 10''s, I love the setup and the well-worn baseball is a great touch. I remember watching many a little league game in my lifetime...days gone by is a great title.', '2002-05-21 07:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63053, 1744, 1078, '<td valign="top">I dig the lighting and texture and tone and mood and everything.  I''m trying to figure out if I like the photo or not.  It seems out of place (why would a photo be in a mitt with a ball?), and it also seems too "new" (in relation to the status of the ball and glove).  However, I do like the image it portrays.  Maybe a compromise -- age the picture a little, make it look older than it is.  Totally just a suggestion.  Good work.</td>', 'I dig the lighting and texture and tone and mood and everything.  I''m trying to figure out if I like the photo or not.  It seems out of place (why would a photo be in a mitt with a ball?), and it also seems too "new" (in relation to the status of the ball and glove).  However, I do like the image it portrays.  Maybe a compromise -- age the picture a little, make it look older than it is.  Totally just a suggestion.  Good work.', '2002-05-21 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63054, 1744, 1009, '<td valign="top">Very nice mood, I like it. After further review and viewing the rest of the submissions, I''ve decided this one deserves my "10".<br/><br/>This pictures is really good technically, but its the wonderful mood and the title that make it great.</td>', 'Very nice mood, I like it. After further review and viewing the rest of the submissions, I''ve decided this one deserves my "10".This pictures is really good technically, but its the wonderful mood and the title that make it great.', '2002-05-21 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63055, 1744, 587, '<td valign="top">this is my favorite type of picture. For some reason I like all this new technology to make everything look very old. :) I wish this was a touch brighter, but you captured the warmth of the "good old days" very well. good job.</td>', 'this is my favorite type of picture. For some reason I like all this new technology to make everything look very old. :) I wish this was a touch brighter, but you captured the warmth of the "good old days" very well. good job.', '2002-05-21 17:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
