(63072, 1744, 543, '<td valign="top">Fantastic textures and wonderful light.  This is what B/W is for.  Don''t let anyone tell you otherwise.  The photograph vanishing into the shadow bothers me a little, and its edge shows some jaggies from sharpening.  I find that for web images, a positive gamma adjustment of 1.1 is a good idea, as shadow detail seems to get lost otherwise.  Top ten.</td>', 'Fantastic textures and wonderful light.  This is what B/W is for.  Don''t let anyone tell you otherwise.  The photograph vanishing into the shadow bothers me a little, and its edge shows some jaggies from sharpening.  I find that for web images, a positive gamma adjustment of 1.1 is a good idea, as shadow detail seems to get lost otherwise.  Top ten.', '2002-05-25 03:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
