(63129, 1746, 1549, '<td valign="top">To answer the questions in the comments....<br/>&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;<br/>The paper is there because I was in the process of setting up a Yatzee shot with dice, a score sheet and a white background.  <br/>&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;<br/>I didn''t try to get the cat to do this. She sat on some of the dice and started picking up the others one at a time and dropping them.  I grabbed the camera, but didn''t have a change to move the paper from under her.<br/>&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;<br/>Lastly, yes, this is my cat.  We have another cat too, but he was busy playing cat soccer with another set of dice.<br/></td>', 'To answer the questions in the comments....&lt;p&gt;The paper is there because I was in the process of setting up a Yatzee shot with dice, a score sheet and a white background.  &lt;p&gt;I didn''t try to get the cat to do this. She sat on some of the dice and started picking up the others one at a time and dropping them.  I grabbed the camera, but didn''t have a change to move the paper from under her.&lt;p&gt;Lastly, yes, this is my cat.  We have another cat too, but he was busy playing cat soccer with another set of dice.', '2002-05-27 06:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(63130, 1747, 113, '<td valign="top">Clever, but not a very interesting shot.  Blurry.</td>', 'Clever, but not a very interesting shot.  Blurry.', '2002-05-20 01:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63131, 1747, 1476, '<td valign="top">a game nobody thought of ...bravo</td>', 'a game nobody thought of ...bravo', '2002-05-20 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63132, 1747, 1693, '<td valign="top">I like your idea, but the background and knee are a bit distracting</td>', 'I like your idea, but the background and knee are a bit distracting', '2002-05-20 12:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63133, 1747, 587, '<td valign="top">looks like fun!! I wouldn''t change anything, well...maybe have ''hairy'' put a shirt on too. ;) Good job.</td>', 'looks like fun!! I wouldn''t change anything, well...maybe have ''hairy'' put a shirt on too. ;) Good job.', '2002-05-20 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63134, 1747, 1446, '<td valign="top">I wish the subject wasn''t quite so centered in this picture.  I like that you captured some movement of the thumbs.</td>', 'I wish the subject wasn''t quite so centered in this picture.  I like that you captured some movement of the thumbs.', '2002-05-20 13:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63135, 1747, 885, '<td valign="top">If you could have, I think that zooming in on or cropping in on the hands would have strengthened it.  I''m not sure the the knees and arms add.  I like the background though.</td>', 'If you could have, I think that zooming in on or cropping in on the hands would have strengthened it.  I''m not sure the the knees and arms add.  I like the background though.', '2002-05-20 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63136, 1747, 327, '<td valign="top">Fun, clever, creative idea.</td>', 'Fun, clever, creative idea.', '2002-05-20 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63137, 1747, 1756, '<td valign="top">Andthe new champ is!!!!! HER!!!!!!</td>', 'Andthe new champ is!!!!! HER!!!!!!', '2002-05-20 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63138, 1747, 1563, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait of a father son activities and games on a day off.</td>', 'Nice portrait of a father son activities and games on a day off.', '2002-05-20 18:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63139, 1747, 1041, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering how this photo would''ve done in color (depending on what colors the background is, if it''s very bright, then b&amp;w probably is better.  I just feel I would like to have something additional to hold my interest.  Of course, that''s just my opinion.  I do like that you can see the movement on the thumbs.</td>', 'I''m wondering how this photo would''ve done in color (depending on what colors the background is, if it''s very bright, then b&w probably is better.  I just feel I would like to have something additional to hold my interest.  Of course, that''s just my opinion.  I do like that you can see the movement on the thumbs.', '2002-05-21 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63140, 1747, 1581, '<td valign="top">cool picture but im not sure if i like the blury. but hey i know those comments are annoying so im done.</td>', 'cool picture but im not sure if i like the blury. but hey i know those comments are annoying so im done.', '2002-05-21 22:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63141, 1747, 301, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject, but I would have liked to have seen a tighter crop.  The legs especially aren''t required in the picture.  Background isn''t really the best either</td>', 'An interesting subject, but I would have liked to have seen a tighter crop.  The legs especially aren''t required in the picture.  Background isn''t really the best either', '2002-05-22 03:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63142, 1747, 1054, '<td valign="top">Cute :)</td>', 'Cute :)', '2002-05-22 08:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63143, 1747, 1005, '<td valign="top">Mostly there.  Photo 7 Creativity 7 Games 8 total 7</td>', 'Mostly there.  Photo 7 Creativity 7 Games 8 total 7', '2002-05-22 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63144, 1747, 772, '<td valign="top">Good use of motion blur in this photo... the sense of motion makes this photo work nicely!  good job!</td>', 'Good use of motion blur in this photo... the sense of motion makes this photo work nicely!  good job!', '2002-05-22 20:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63145, 1747, 1597, '<td valign="top">creative but a bit blurry</td>', 'creative but a bit blurry', '2002-05-22 20:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63146, 1747, 543, '<td valign="top">Lisae?  (I''d recognize those forearms anywhere.)  It looks to me like the camera decided to focus on the pattern on the couch instead of on your hands, since the sleeve of your shirt and BF''s arm hair are oof.  The motion blur on the thumbs works, but the still bits ought to be a little sharper.  Compositionally, I''d like more focus on the hands rather than including your knee and the whatsit at the LLHC.</td>', 'Lisae?  (I''d recognize those forearms anywhere.)  It looks to me like the camera decided to focus on the pattern on the couch instead of on your hands, since the sleeve of your shirt and BF''s arm hair are oof.  The motion blur on the thumbs works, but the still bits ought to be a little sharper.  Compositionally, I''d like more focus on the hands rather than including your knee and the whatsit at the LLHC.', '2002-05-25 04:32:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(63147, 1747, 1128, '<td valign="top">Don''t know about the B &amp; W choice for this, but points for a clever idea!</td>', 'Don''t know about the B & W choice for this, but points for a clever idea!', '2002-05-25 09:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63148, 1747, 1, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, I think a little color could''ve worked well for this.</td>', 'Interesting shot, I think a little color could''ve worked well for this.', '2002-05-26 23:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63149, 1747, 1037, '<td valign="top">I included the knees in the framing of this photo because the subject wasn''t really the thumb wrestling as much as the relationship between the two people. The knees show their proximity and orientation, ie. enough information for you to know they''re close together and facing each other without including the whole bodies.  Because of this, I really like the comment that this is a father and son (even though I had a moonstone ring on my thumb), since it shows that I captured a relationship at least for some people.<br/><br/>The black and white was partly because of the reason I gave in the details, partly because it set the hands off better against the background, and partly because my camera can create bands of noise in dark areas, which were mostly removed in the black and white version.<br/><br/>I took quite a few photos and chose this one because it had the most motion blur on the thumbs. It''s funny how people either love the blur or hate it :)<br/><br/>Oh, and I really think that bodyhair thing some people have is cultural. Australian men are proud of their hair :)</td>', 'I included the knees in the framing of this photo because the subject wasn''t really the thumb wrestling as much as the relationship between the two people. The knees show their proximity and orientation, ie. enough information for you to know they''re close together and facing each other without including the whole bodies.  Because of this, I really like the comment that this is a father and son (even though I had a moonstone ring on my thumb), since it shows that I captured a relationship at least for some people.The black and white was partly because of the reason I gave in the details, partly because it set the hands off better against the background, and partly because my camera can create bands of noise in dark areas, which were mostly removed in the black and white version.I took quite a few photos and chose this one because it had the most motion blur on the thumbs. It''s funny how people either love the blur or hate it :)Oh, and I really think that bodyhair thing some people have is cultural. Australian men are proud of their hair :)', '2002-05-27 01:16:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(63150, 1748, 113, '<td valign="top">Is this macro?  I think the photo would have more umph if they would have all been clear.</td>', 'Is this macro?  I think the photo would have more umph if they would have all been clear.', '2002-05-20 04:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63151, 1748, 189, '<td valign="top">Good focus job.</td>', 'Good focus job.', '2002-05-20 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63152, 1748, 1585, '<td valign="top">I can''t say it!</td>', 'I can''t say it!', '2002-05-20 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63153, 1748, 862, '<td valign="top">The out of focus ball front and center is very distracting.  Greater depth of field would help.  If you''re going for a narrow depth of field perspective, then maybe increase the camera angle slightly (or crop the photo)  to minimize the foreground ugliness.</td>', 'The out of focus ball front and center is very distracting.  Greater depth of field would help.  If you''re going for a narrow depth of field perspective, then maybe increase the camera angle slightly (or crop the photo)  to minimize the foreground ugliness.', '2002-05-20 14:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63154, 1748, 259, '<td valign="top">very nice job getting the focus only on the eight ball.</td>', 'very nice job getting the focus only on the eight ball.', '2002-05-20 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63155, 1748, 724, '<td valign="top">Might be more pleasing to the eyes if the 8 ball was clean. Another thought would be to not be so straight on to the balls and take the photo more at an angle.</td>', 'Might be more pleasing to the eyes if the 8 ball was clean. Another thought would be to not be so straight on to the balls and take the photo more at an angle.', '2002-05-20 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63156, 1748, 570, '<td valign="top">dirty balls</td>', 'dirty balls', '2002-05-20 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63157, 1748, 1750, '<td valign="top">Subject stands out well. Good use of lowlight technique.</td>', 'Subject stands out well. Good use of lowlight technique.', '2002-05-20 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63158, 1748, 1512, '<td valign="top">I''m sure i''ve heard that name before....... but 8/10 nonetheless!!!!</td>', 'I''m sure i''ve heard that name before....... but 8/10 nonetheless!!!!', '2002-05-20 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63159, 1748, 741, '<td valign="top">Great use of depth of field to focus the eye on the key point.  A bit dark at the back.</td>', 'Great use of depth of field to focus the eye on the key point.  A bit dark at the back.', '2002-05-21 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63160, 1748, 1078, '<td valign="top">I love the perfect DOF in this photo.  This takes the somewhat clichè "bunch of eggs" shots and gives it a new twist.  That dead space at the top of the image bothers me.  I don''t think you could have got the same DOF with a more directly overhead shot, but what if you created the illusion of a set of pool balls that had been racked when they were actually spread out over the table a little bit?  This may not make sense.  If you''re curious about what I mean, email me when the voting is over.</td>', 'I love the perfect DOF in this photo.  This takes the somewhat clichè "bunch of eggs" shots and gives it a new twist.  That dead space at the top of the image bothers me.  I don''t think you could have got the same DOF with a more directly overhead shot, but what if you created the illusion of a set of pool balls that had been racked when they were actually spread out over the table a little bit?  This may not make sense.  If you''re curious about what I mean, email me when the voting is over.', '2002-05-21 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63161, 1748, 1446, '<td valign="top">I am really trying to like photos with the foreground out of focus.....honest I am...........</td>', 'I am really trying to like photos with the foreground out of focus.....honest I am...........', '2002-05-21 16:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63162, 1748, 772, '<td valign="top">You have done an excellent job with depth of field in this photo... Perfect focus on the 8-ball... My eyes are drawn directly to the object of the photo.. nice work!</td>', 'You have done an excellent job with depth of field in this photo... Perfect focus on the 8-ball... My eyes are drawn directly to the object of the photo.. nice work!', '2002-05-21 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63163, 1748, 1597, '<td valign="top">Nice angle shot</td>', 'Nice angle shot', '2002-05-21 20:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63164, 1748, 1024, '<td valign="top">Your focus is right on target for this photo.</td>', 'Your focus is right on target for this photo.', '2002-05-22 08:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63165, 1748, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, though I dislike the angle -- there''s too much dead space at the top.</td>', 'Nice DOF, though I dislike the angle -- there''s too much dead space at the top.', '2002-05-22 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63166, 1748, 878, '<td valign="top">Tight depth of field, good colors but a little dark.  Interesting shot though.</td>', 'Tight depth of field, good colors but a little dark.  Interesting shot though.', '2002-05-22 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63167, 1748, 1005, '<td valign="top">Photo 7 Creativity 6 Games 5 total 6</td>', 'Photo 7 Creativity 6 Games 5 total 6', '2002-05-22 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63168, 1748, 1031, '<td valign="top">That''s going to be one tough shot!</td>', 'That''s going to be one tough shot!', '2002-05-22 20:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63169, 1748, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but I think I would''ve preferred a little more DOF in the foreground (or crop out the first row of balls).  Alternatively, add them in the back so that there''s less of just blank background.</td>', 'I like the composition, but I think I would''ve preferred a little more DOF in the foreground (or crop out the first row of balls).  Alternatively, add them in the back so that there''s less of just blank background.', '2002-05-23 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63170, 1748, 1814, '<td valign="top">nice close up</td>', 'nice close up', '2002-05-24 07:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63171, 1748, 748, '<td valign="top">Composition looks a litlle tilted to the right.  I like the DOF with the focus on the 8 ball.  The overhead lights distract a little to me, but overall, a good effort.</td>', 'Composition looks a litlle tilted to the right.  I like the DOF with the focus on the 8 ball.  The overhead lights distract a little to me, but overall, a good effort.', '2002-05-24 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63172, 1748, 651, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.. The purple ball behind the eight ball bothers my eyes..</td>', 'I love this picture.. The purple ball behind the eight ball bothers my eyes..', '2002-05-24 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63173, 1748, 509, '<td valign="top">I think for a pool shot, this could be done better (see Langdon''s winning entry for table shot).  I''m not suggesting copying that style, but the off center framing and the focus of this shot aren''t that appealing to me.</td>', 'I think for a pool shot, this could be done better (see Langdon''s winning entry for table shot).  I''m not suggesting copying that style, but the off center framing and the focus of this shot aren''t that appealing to me.', '2002-05-25 22:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63174, 1748, 543, '<td valign="top">Good idea to turn the other numbers away to keep the attention on the eight ball.  Wish it weren''t right in the center of the frame.  Seems a bit underexposed, as well.</td>', 'Good idea to turn the other numbers away to keep the attention on the eight ball.  Wish it weren''t right in the center of the frame.  Seems a bit underexposed, as well.', '2002-05-26 03:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63175, 1748, 1535, '<td valign="top">would be better if the balls r clean up a little, too much dirt on the white part of the ball.</td>', 'would be better if the balls r clean up a little, too much dirt on the white part of the ball.', '2002-05-26 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63176, 1748, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice set up.  The parts that are out of focus and the absence of numbers really forces the eye to the "8"</td>', 'Nice set up.  The parts that are out of focus and the absence of numbers really forces the eye to the "8"', '2002-05-27 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63177, 1749, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the edge effects on the die, how''d you do that?</td>', 'I like the edge effects on the die, how''d you do that?', '2002-05-20 01:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63178, 1749, 113, '<td valign="top">This is a nice phote, everything seems to be working for it.  Is it a macro?  Would explain the blurred edges of other dice.  I think I would have liked it better ith sharp edges on all di.</td>', 'This is a nice phote, everything seems to be working for it.  Is it a macro?  Would explain the blurred edges of other dice.  I think I would have liked it better ith sharp edges on all di.', '2002-05-20 03:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63179, 1749, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice setup, interesting colors.  I think the top needs to be croped tighter as the sides and bottom were.</td>', 'Nice setup, interesting colors.  I think the top needs to be croped tighter as the sides and bottom were.', '2002-05-20 08:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63180, 1749, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2002-05-20 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63181, 1749, 1175, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo.  I don''t really care for the purple hue though.</td>', 'This is a great photo.  I don''t really care for the purple hue though.', '2002-05-20 15:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63182, 1749, 327, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2002-05-20 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63183, 1749, 1446, '<td valign="top">I really like the shadows on this shot.</td>', 'I really like the shadows on this shot.', '2002-05-20 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63184, 1749, 1755, '<td valign="top">Nice! You might have let all the dices be in picture. That is not zooming a little out so the edges are in.</td>', 'Nice! You might have let all the dices be in picture. That is not zooming a little out so the edges are in.', '2002-05-21 06:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63185, 1749, 301, '<td valign="top">cool idea.  There is a funny glow occurring on the faces of the dice.  Not sure if it''s the lighting or chromatic aberrations from your camera.</td>', 'cool idea.  There is a funny glow occurring on the faces of the dice.  Not sure if it''s the lighting or chromatic aberrations from your camera.', '2002-05-21 07:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63186, 1749, 543, '<td valign="top">Ooooh!  Nice!  Just a little hot in the fg and slightly purple.</td>', 'Ooooh!  Nice!  Just a little hot in the fg and slightly purple.', '2002-05-21 11:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63187, 1749, 1360, '<td valign="top">This image shows one of the things I hate about digital photography, Chromatic Aberrations.  They ruin what would have been a very nice photo.</td>', 'This image shows one of the things I hate about digital photography, Chromatic Aberrations.  They ruin what would have been a very nice photo.', '2002-05-21 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63188, 1749, 1009, '<td valign="top">Great layout...</td>', 'Great layout...', '2002-05-21 17:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63189, 1749, 640, '<td valign="top">Nice blue effect around the die</td>', 'Nice blue effect around the die', '2002-05-22 07:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63190, 1749, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice composition!  I like your layout here... I think the lighting may be just a touch on the bright side, but its a good shot!  nice job!</td>', 'Nice composition!  I like your layout here... I think the lighting may be just a touch on the bright side, but its a good shot!  nice job!', '2002-05-22 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63191, 1749, 741, '<td valign="top">Good composition. lighting, focusinetc.  Technically everything is fine but the picture just doesn''t grab me.  I''m afraid it just looks like some things set up for a photograph.</td>', 'Good composition. lighting, focusinetc.  Technically everything is fine but the picture just doesn''t grab me.  I''m afraid it just looks like some things set up for a photograph.', '2002-05-22 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63192, 1749, 878, '<td valign="top">Good shot, I like the purple highlights.  What game are you trying to convey with this shot?</td>', 'Good shot, I like the purple highlights.  What game are you trying to convey with this shot?', '2002-05-22 15:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63193, 1749, 1549, '<td valign="top">The bottom left die is not quite as sharp as some of the others, but you''ve got a good setup and nice lighting.  One of my top three.  :)</td>', 'The bottom left die is not quite as sharp as some of the others, but you''ve got a good setup and nice lighting.  One of my top three.  :)', '2002-05-23 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63194, 1749, 1804, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. It caught my attention right away.The lighting is great, closeups are great and is very visually stimulating.</td>', 'I really like this photo. It caught my attention right away.The lighting is great, closeups are great and is very visually stimulating.', '2002-05-23 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63195, 1749, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the bluish reflection/tint that you have.  I also like the fuzziness around some of the area--it forces the eyes to the center.  You almost have Yahtzee there!</td>', 'I like the bluish reflection/tint that you have.  I also like the fuzziness around some of the area--it forces the eyes to the center.  You almost have Yahtzee there!', '2002-05-23 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63196, 1749, 1597, '<td valign="top">Looks like the pic has a purplish hue to it on my computer</td>', 'Looks like the pic has a purplish hue to it on my computer', '2002-05-23 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63197, 1749, 1202, '<td valign="top">Well executed use of light, with a good set up. Interesting.</td>', 'Well executed use of light, with a good set up. Interesting.', '2002-05-24 20:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63198, 1749, 661, '<td valign="top">Nice Macro shot</td>', 'Nice Macro shot', '2002-05-24 23:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63199, 1750, 113, '<td valign="top">This is a great stop action shot, a bit difficult to do, and I don''t even like baseball!</td>', 'This is a great stop action shot, a bit difficult to do, and I don''t even like baseball!', '2002-05-20 01:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63200, 1750, 1336, '<td valign="top">nice action shot</td>', 'nice action shot', '2002-05-20 07:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63201, 1750, 327, '<td valign="top">Fun action shot. Love the black and white. The composition is poor with the heads cut off.</td>', 'Fun action shot. Love the black and white. The composition is poor with the heads cut off.', '2002-05-20 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63202, 1750, 885, '<td valign="top">You get points for being obviously unstaged and spontaneous.  I love looking at the faces of the batter and the catcher.  Obviously, you clipped his left hand, and the top of the batter''s head.</td>', 'You get points for being obviously unstaged and spontaneous.  I love looking at the faces of the batter and the catcher.  Obviously, you clipped his left hand, and the top of the batter''s head.', '2002-05-20 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63203, 1750, 1750, '<td valign="top">Good Zone technique, story, and subject matter balance.</td>', 'Good Zone technique, story, and subject matter balance.', '2002-05-20 15:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63204, 1750, 1446, '<td valign="top">Nice action capture.  Like the use of B&amp;W here.  The crowd in the background is a little distracting, but what are you gonna do about that huh?  Nice photo.</td>', 'Nice action capture.  Like the use of B&W here.  The crowd in the background is a little distracting, but what are you gonna do about that huh?  Nice photo.', '2002-05-20 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63205, 1750, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture... This is an excellent photo for this challenge... I don''t like the batter''s head being clipped off but I know these types of shots are spur of the moment.. you don''t have much time to think about framing and composition... good job!</td>', 'Very nice capture... This is an excellent photo for this challenge... I don''t like the batter''s head being clipped off but I know these types of shots are spur of the moment.. you don''t have much time to think about framing and composition... good job!', '2002-05-21 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63206, 1750, 1037, '<td valign="top">Brilliant action shot. The black and white works really well in my opinion, placing more emphasis on the shapes and movement than on particular objects.</td>', 'Brilliant action shot. The black and white works really well in my opinion, placing more emphasis on the shapes and movement than on particular objects.', '2002-05-21 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63207, 1750, 1031, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like a steal play, but a nice photo...</td>', 'Doesn''t look like a steal play, but a nice photo...', '2002-05-22 01:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
