(63236, 1751, 1512, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting! When 900 years old you be, look so good you will not!</td>', 'Nice lighting! When 900 years old you be, look so good you will not!', '2002-05-20 21:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63237, 1751, 1175, '<td valign="top">I''m one of those that dislikes the forground subject to be out of focusand the background picture to be in focus.  I think both figures should have been in focus.  I think I understand why you did it though, the Jar Jar piece is passing go while the other piece is left behind.  To make this a bit more effective it might have been better to choose a smaller piece for the foreground so that it doesn''t detract from your subject and then maybe move the piece passing go closer to the line and maybe even crossing over the line.  Another good idea would have been to get more of a view of where the character passing go was actually going by turning the camera more to the left.</td>', 'I''m one of those that dislikes the forground subject to be out of focusand the background picture to be in focus.  I think both figures should have been in focus.  I think I understand why you did it though, the Jar Jar piece is passing go while the other piece is left behind.  To make this a bit more effective it might have been better to choose a smaller piece for the foreground so that it doesn''t detract from your subject and then maybe move the piece passing go closer to the line and maybe even crossing over the line.  Another good idea would have been to get more of a view of where the character passing go was actually going by turning the camera more to the left.', '2002-05-21 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63238, 1751, 1009, '<td valign="top">Great lighting!</td>', 'Great lighting!', '2002-05-21 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63239, 1751, 772, '<td valign="top">I like your composition on this photo... Interesting lighting as well :)</td>', 'I like your composition on this photo... Interesting lighting as well :)', '2002-05-21 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
