(63260, 1752, 1175, '<td valign="top">You have a really cool picture here.  Why is the S and I in the foreground yellow?  I wish the lighting was a little more even.  I like the far away S being out of focus and making it look like its so far away.  I also like the horizontal lines on your background it sort of points inward which works well.</td>', 'You have a really cool picture here.  Why is the S and I in the foreground yellow?  I wish the lighting was a little more even.  I like the far away S being out of focus and making it look like its so far away.  I also like the horizontal lines on your background it sort of points inward which works well.', '2002-05-21 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63261, 1752, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame there is a shadow on the bottom two letters - good otherwise.</td>', 'It''s a shame there is a shadow on the bottom two letters - good otherwise.', '2002-05-21 20:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63262, 1752, 1031, '<td valign="top">I can see where that game might end up taking up a lot of time...</td>', 'I can see where that game might end up taking up a lot of time...', '2002-05-22 01:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63263, 1752, 671, '<td valign="top">I like the dramatic yellow spotlight effect on the s, and just taking in part of the i.  Also how the f in focus is out of focus, leading the eye to the s.  It took me a minute to realize that there was a stairstep spelling "sin is in", but that''s because I don''t play boggle.  I also liked the repeats on "cosin"  Lots of stuff to look at.<br/></td>', 'I like the dramatic yellow spotlight effect on the s, and just taking in part of the i.  Also how the f in focus is out of focus, leading the eye to the s.  It took me a minute to realize that there was a stairstep spelling "sin is in", but that''s because I don''t play boggle.  I also liked the repeats on "cosin"  Lots of stuff to look at.', '2002-05-22 09:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63264, 1752, 1054, '<td valign="top">focuses, cosines, cousins.... ;-) -- Nice angle, my only complaint is the shadow in the foreground.</td>', 'focuses, cosines, cousins.... ;-) -- Nice angle, my only complaint is the shadow in the foreground.', '2002-05-22 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63265, 1752, 113, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of this shot.  The shadow kind of takes away from it though.</td>', 'I like the angle of this shot.  The shadow kind of takes away from it though.', '2002-05-22 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63266, 1752, 878, '<td valign="top">Good shot  but the yellow shadow on the bottom 2 pieces is a bit distratcing.  Looks like you were doing a macro shot and that was the area that was in the shadow from the camera''s flash.</td>', 'Good shot  but the yellow shadow on the bottom 2 pieces is a bit distratcing.  Looks like you were doing a macro shot and that was the area that was in the shadow from the camera''s flash.', '2002-05-22 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
