(63303, 1754, 1455, '<td valign="top">Where in the world did you find this game.  I didn''t even know that it was made. How is it played?</td>', 'Where in the world did you find this game.  I didn''t even know that it was made. How is it played?', '2002-05-21 09:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63304, 1754, 1446, '<td valign="top">The composition of this leads my eye around it.  I like that.  The light seems to be kind of harsh off the plastic piece of pac-man though.  But it sure brings back memories of standing in front of the video game for hours at the arcade.</td>', 'The composition of this leads my eye around it.  I like that.  The light seems to be kind of harsh off the plastic piece of pac-man though.  But it sure brings back memories of standing in front of the video game for hours at the arcade.', '2002-05-21 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63305, 1754, 441, '<td valign="top">good colourful shot - good DOF - awkward angle to get composition right</td>', 'good colourful shot - good DOF - awkward angle to get composition right', '2002-05-21 17:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63306, 1754, 772, '<td valign="top">Good shot!  I didn''t even know that there was a board game version of pac man!</td>', 'Good shot!  I didn''t even know that there was a board game version of pac man!', '2002-05-21 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63307, 1754, 878, '<td valign="top">Thats an old one.</td>', 'Thats an old one.', '2002-05-22 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63308, 1754, 1005, '<td valign="top">The board game?  Low tech meets high tech.  Cute.  Photo 9 Creativity 6 Games 8 total 7</td>', 'The board game?  Low tech meets high tech.  Cute.  Photo 9 Creativity 6 Games 8 total 7', '2002-05-22 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63309, 1754, 842, '<td valign="top">I haven''t seen this game in a long time.</td>', 'I haven''t seen this game in a long time.', '2002-05-22 20:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63310, 1754, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF and lighting.  Also like that you show sufficient amounts of the board, but not everything.</td>', 'I like the DOF and lighting.  Also like that you show sufficient amounts of the board, but not everything.', '2002-05-23 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63311, 1754, 1597, '<td valign="top">go pacie go!! nice contrasr of color a bit fuzzy on the 1st guy behind pacie but over shot is clear</td>', 'go pacie go!! nice contrasr of color a bit fuzzy on the 1st guy behind pacie but over shot is clear', '2002-05-23 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63312, 1754, 1175, '<td valign="top">You have a nice photo here.  I''ve never seen this board game before but the pieces are cute looking.  The one of the two things I have a problem with which I believe should be controllable is the focus.  Your Pac Man and Ghosts do not appear to be completey in focus.  The second controllable problem is the lighting.  There appears to be some sort of shadow in the lower right of your picture.  The next few things may not be controllable due to lack of software or a more sophisticated camera.  Your "white" balls have a yellowish tint to them.  The Pac Man logo and the lines above it all have jaggys in it.  Then the final unfortuante problem which might be correctable with proper lighting is that crease in the board.  Towards the top of the picture its reflecting light and its almost white and it detracts from your subject.  I think you had a good idea and you put forth a valiant effort.  You are on the right track.  Don''t give up.</td>', 'You have a nice photo here.  I''ve never seen this board game before but the pieces are cute looking.  The one of the two things I have a problem with which I believe should be controllable is the focus.  Your Pac Man and Ghosts do not appear to be completey in focus.  The second controllable problem is the lighting.  There appears to be some sort of shadow in the lower right of your picture.  The next few things may not be controllable due to lack of software or a more sophisticated camera.  Your "white" balls have a yellowish tint to them.  The Pac Man logo and the lines above it all have jaggys in it.  Then the final unfortuante problem which might be correctable with proper lighting is that crease in the board.  Towards the top of the picture its reflecting light and its almost white and it detracts from your subject.  I think you had a good idea and you put forth a valiant effort.  You are on the right track.  Don''t give up.', '2002-05-24 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63313, 1754, 1360, '<td valign="top">Oh man, I remember this game...</td>', 'Oh man, I remember this game...', '2002-05-26 03:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63314, 1754, 1, '<td valign="top">Seems a little over sharpened when i look at the maze borders and the pac-man logo.  You could use a little more lighting as well.</td>', 'Seems a little over sharpened when i look at the maze borders and the pac-man logo.  You could use a little more lighting as well.', '2002-05-26 09:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63315, 1754, 509, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for their votes.  Addressing the comments:  The jaggies and focus issues are from resizing the picture.  The original 3 mp is very clear, no jaggies at all ; )  What looks like a blur behind Pac Man is actually a continuation of the maze line.  I agree about the lighting, I hadn''t even noticed the shadow.  I think it is my arm, because the shot was taken in a dark room with light from a nearby room filtering in.  I was holding a small flashlight over the pieces to light them from the front.  I should have used an incandescent white balance to get all the marbles white I think - I just left it on auto.  I don''t know what to do about the crease.  <br/><br/>Yeah, this is an old one.  It predates me I think.  The box shows its age, but other than the ghost''s eyes falling off, it is practically mint.<br/><br/>I was surprised noone commented on the color of the base under the empty holes....I forgot to move my black background under the board...the brown color is that of the table I shot this on</td>', 'Thanks to all for their votes.  Addressing the comments:  The jaggies and focus issues are from resizing the picture.  The original 3 mp is very clear, no jaggies at all ; )  What looks like a blur behind Pac Man is actually a continuation of the maze line.  I agree about the lighting, I hadn''t even noticed the shadow.  I think it is my arm, because the shot was taken in a dark room with light from a nearby room filtering in.  I was holding a small flashlight over the pieces to light them from the front.  I should have used an incandescent white balance to get all the marbles white I think - I just left it on auto.  I don''t know what to do about the crease.  Yeah, this is an old one.  It predates me I think.  The box shows its age, but other than the ghost''s eyes falling off, it is practically mint.I was surprised noone commented on the color of the base under the empty holes....I forgot to move my black background under the board...the brown color is that of the table I shot this on', '2002-05-27 01:15:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(63316, 1755, 1336, '<td valign="top">it would have been nice to get this shot without the bench and door in the background</td>', 'it would have been nice to get this shot without the bench and door in the background', '2002-05-20 07:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63317, 1755, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photograph... I like black and whites.  I am asking myself why you may have chosen to have the chess pieces only on the left side of the photograph.  Did you consider taking a photo of the entire board?  The bench in the background indicates to me that these are rather large chess pieces!  Do people actually play chess on this set?  I think I would have liked to see this shot with more chess pieces in the photo and less empty space on the right...  Good job!</td>', 'This is an interesting photograph... I like black and whites.  I am asking myself why you may have chosen to have the chess pieces only on the left side of the photograph.  Did you consider taking a photo of the entire board?  The bench in the background indicates to me that these are rather large chess pieces!  Do people actually play chess on this set?  I think I would have liked to see this shot with more chess pieces in the photo and less empty space on the right...  Good job!', '2002-05-20 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63318, 1755, 327, '<td valign="top">I think something to show the scale other then the bench would of helped here.<br/>Very cool just the same.</td>', 'I think something to show the scale other then the bench would of helped here.Very cool just the same.', '2002-05-20 12:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63319, 1755, 259, '<td valign="top">the bench is a little distracting</td>', 'the bench is a little distracting', '2002-05-20 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63320, 1755, 1748, '<td valign="top">composition poor</td>', 'composition poor', '2002-05-20 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63321, 1755, 587, '<td valign="top">I wish this was....something, sorry - don''t know what it ''needs'' just seems dull to me, maybe it''s the b&amp;w or the lighting - nifty how they are so large in size though.</td>', 'I wish this was....something, sorry - don''t know what it ''needs'' just seems dull to me, maybe it''s the b&w or the lighting - nifty how they are so large in size though.', '2002-05-20 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63322, 1755, 714, '<td valign="top">How fun.  Are those people size?</td>', 'How fun.  Are those people size?', '2002-05-20 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63323, 1755, 1569, '<td valign="top">Too many distractions.</td>', 'Too many distractions.', '2002-05-20 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63324, 1755, 1169, '<td valign="top">you can only just tell it is a large chess set, someone there would''ve helped</td>', 'you can only just tell it is a large chess set, someone there would''ve helped', '2002-05-20 21:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63325, 1755, 1446, '<td valign="top">I looked and looked at this picture...Tried to figure out how to crop it differently so you didn''t see so much of the floor.  Realized that in order to show the size of these peices you had to leave it.  The wall in the background is kind of distracting to me.</td>', 'I looked and looked at this picture...Tried to figure out how to crop it differently so you didn''t see so much of the floor.  Realized that in order to show the size of these peices you had to leave it.  The wall in the background is kind of distracting to me.', '2002-05-21 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63326, 1755, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  Somehow, every time I look at this shot I try to scroll to see the top of the photo, and then realize that it''s landscape and I already see the top.  Have you tried doing this one in portrait format?  WIth less of the mall floor on the right side but more background up top?  Does that work?</td>', 'Great idea!  Somehow, every time I look at this shot I try to scroll to see the top of the photo, and then realize that it''s landscape and I already see the top.  Have you tried doing this one in portrait format?  WIth less of the mall floor on the right side but more background up top?  Does that work?', '2002-05-21 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63327, 1755, 1647, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of framing - What made you choose it?</td>', 'Interesting choice of framing - What made you choose it?', '2002-05-21 20:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63328, 1755, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice angle</td>', 'nice angle', '2002-05-22 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63329, 1755, 661, '<td valign="top">I would have like to see people in this shot (at the mall).</td>', 'I would have like to see people in this shot (at the mall).', '2002-05-24 23:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63330, 1755, 1128, '<td valign="top">Like the idea.  I''m not sure if I like all the blank space to the right.</td>', 'Like the idea.  I''m not sure if I like all the blank space to the right.', '2002-05-25 09:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63331, 1755, 1061, '<td valign="top">I like it, but there''s too much empty space on the right</td>', 'I like it, but there''s too much empty space on the right', '2002-05-26 04:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63332, 1755, 1808, '<td valign="top">Castled?</td>', 'Castled?', '2002-05-26 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63333, 1755, 1, '<td valign="top">Odd setting, I can''t relate.  There''s a lot of dead space in the image.</td>', 'Odd setting, I can''t relate.  There''s a lot of dead space in the image.', '2002-05-26 23:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63334, 1757, 1519, '<td valign="top">This photograph is precious. I like it in b/w. Adorable expression on her face.</td>', 'This photograph is precious. I like it in b/w. Adorable expression on her face.', '2002-05-20 07:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63335, 1757, 878, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot</td>', 'Very nice shot', '2002-05-20 09:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63336, 1757, 1379, '<td valign="top">Extreme cuteness!</td>', 'Extreme cuteness!', '2002-05-20 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63337, 1757, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice photo.. I like the look on the girl''s face :)  I personally believe that a vertical crop on this shot would bring the hiding girl in as a larger part of the image... it''s just personal preference though... good job!</td>', 'This is a really nice photo.. I like the look on the girl''s face :)  I personally believe that a vertical crop on this shot would bring the hiding girl in as a larger part of the image... it''s just personal preference though... good job!', '2002-05-20 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63338, 1757, 189, '<td valign="top">Would have been a tad better, imho, if this were taken level. Not shooting down.</td>', 'Would have been a tad better, imho, if this were taken level. Not shooting down.', '2002-05-20 11:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63339, 1757, 587, '<td valign="top">She is absolutely beautiful. What a precious moment - thanks for sharing your game. :)</td>', 'She is absolutely beautiful. What a precious moment - thanks for sharing your game. :)', '2002-05-20 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63340, 1757, 1, '<td valign="top">Very cute shot, but I think more DOF is needed to draw out the subject.</td>', 'Very cute shot, but I think more DOF is needed to draw out the subject.', '2002-05-20 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63341, 1757, 327, '<td valign="top">Just good, great black and white. More crop on the left would of been good to pull her forward. Nice work.</td>', 'Just good, great black and white. More crop on the left would of been good to pull her forward. Nice work.', '2002-05-20 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63342, 1757, 1748, '<td valign="top">best of the rest !</td>', 'best of the rest !', '2002-05-20 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63343, 1757, 259, '<td valign="top">nice use of the rule of thirds.</td>', 'nice use of the rule of thirds.', '2002-05-20 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63344, 1757, 1750, '<td valign="top">interesting composition. Good use of the zone tecnique.</td>', 'interesting composition. Good use of the zone tecnique.', '2002-05-20 14:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63345, 1757, 1024, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition ... it looks like she is really playing.</td>', 'Very nice composition ... it looks like she is really playing.', '2002-05-20 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63346, 1757, 1446, '<td valign="top">Adorable little girl!  The tree comming up out of the center of the shot is a little distracting IMO.</td>', 'Adorable little girl!  The tree comming up out of the center of the shot is a little distracting IMO.', '2002-05-20 16:56:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(63347, 1757, 1755, '<td valign="top">Great surroundings for a great photo!</td>', 'Great surroundings for a great photo!', '2002-05-20 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63348, 1757, 1581, '<td valign="top">so inocent and very nicely composed. great contrast and value</td>', 'so inocent and very nicely composed. great contrast and value', '2002-05-20 22:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63349, 1757, 509, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Black and white is definitely good here, and I like the off center subject.  Nice job</td>', 'Very nice.  Black and white is definitely good here, and I like the off center subject.  Nice job', '2002-05-21 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63350, 1757, 1009, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture... frame it</td>', 'Beautiful picture... frame it', '2002-05-21 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63351, 1757, 1712, '<td valign="top">Cute!!!!!!!!</td>', 'Cute!!!!!!!!', '2002-05-21 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63352, 1757, 1597, '<td valign="top">I like the Black and White it gives it a mysterious look.</td>', 'I like the Black and White it gives it a mysterious look.', '2002-05-21 20:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63353, 1757, 301, '<td valign="top">I like the expression you''ve captured here.  Seems very cheeky.  Not sure I''m totally happy with the vast space on the right.  I think I''d prefer the pic in portrait and cropped to show half the tree she is hiding behind.  Less DOF would keep the focus of the photo firmly on the girl rather than the background too.</td>', 'I like the expression you''ve captured here.  Seems very cheeky.  Not sure I''m totally happy with the vast space on the right.  I think I''d prefer the pic in portrait and cropped to show half the tree she is hiding behind.  Less DOF would keep the focus of the photo firmly on the girl rather than the background too.', '2002-05-22 04:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63354, 1757, 1054, '<td valign="top">Ok, now that is just *too* cute.</td>', 'Ok, now that is just *too* cute.', '2002-05-22 08:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63355, 1757, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful. I especially like the way the little girl''s hand gives away her excitement.</td>', 'Very beautiful. I especially like the way the little girl''s hand gives away her excitement.', '2002-05-22 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63356, 1757, 714, '<td valign="top">Very very beautiful!</td>', 'Very very beautiful!', '2002-05-22 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63357, 1757, 1175, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea for a photo.  I think I would have prefered a if the trees in the background were just a bit more out of focus.  My eyes are drawn to the girl but the trees or maybe the bright ground sort of distract me from it.   Good use of the rule of thirds.</td>', 'This is a great idea for a photo.  I think I would have prefered a if the trees in the background were just a bit more out of focus.  My eyes are drawn to the girl but the trees or maybe the bright ground sort of distract me from it.   Good use of the rule of thirds.', '2002-05-22 22:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63358, 1757, 824, '<td valign="top">Cute. Good use of Black and White.</td>', 'Cute. Good use of Black and White.', '2002-05-22 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63359, 1757, 1681, '<td valign="top">This one was tough for me.  I''m not sure I would have gotten the idea without the caption, but maybe.  However, when I viewed it full size, the expression on her face was priceless and made the photo fit the catagory.  Good job!</td>', 'This one was tough for me.  I''m not sure I would have gotten the idea without the caption, but maybe.  However, when I viewed it full size, the expression on her face was priceless and made the photo fit the catagory.  Good job!', '2002-05-23 07:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63360, 1757, 573, '<td valign="top">What child can resist a peek at the seeker?  My eye is pulled directly to the child''s face, good use of two/thirds.</td>', 'What child can resist a peek at the seeker?  My eye is pulled directly to the child''s face, good use of two/thirds.', '2002-05-23 09:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63361, 1757, 1336, '<td valign="top">nice use of black &amp; white.  great photo</td>', 'nice use of black & white.  great photo', '2002-05-23 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63362, 1757, 1005, '<td valign="top">No color?  Photo 7 Creativity 6 Games 5 total 6</td>', 'No color?  Photo 7 Creativity 6 Games 5 total 6', '2002-05-23 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63363, 1757, 1814, '<td valign="top">cute</td>', 'cute', '2002-05-24 07:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63364, 1757, 1128, '<td valign="top">She is so sweet.  There is just enough of her showing,  This is a nice take on Hide and Seek.</td>', 'She is so sweet.  There is just enough of her showing,  This is a nice take on Hide and Seek.', '2002-05-25 09:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63365, 1757, 1066, '<td valign="top">Probably my favorite shot this week.  Very nice use of Black and White and the shot has a Lion, Witch and the Wardrobe effect on me.  The trees look very mystical and the child gives that innocent look that begs childrens fiction.  I am guessing who this photographer is.  Interesting to see if I am right.</td>', 'Probably my favorite shot this week.  Very nice use of Black and White and the shot has a Lion, Witch and the Wardrobe effect on me.  The trees look very mystical and the child gives that innocent look that begs childrens fiction.  I am guessing who this photographer is.  Interesting to see if I am right.', '2002-05-25 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63366, 1757, 428, '<td valign="top">nice shot! The focusing is great on the girl and her tree. I love the way the other trees gradually fade into the background</td>', 'nice shot! The focusing is great on the girl and her tree. I love the way the other trees gradually fade into the background', '2002-05-25 20:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63367, 1757, 527, '<td valign="top">I don''t think black and white is necessary here. When I squint my eyes the child nearly disappears. It seems cold instead of warm and inviting.</td>', 'I don''t think black and white is necessary here. When I squint my eyes the child nearly disappears. It seems cold instead of warm and inviting.', '2002-05-26 02:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63368, 1758, 1605, '<td valign="top">No order.</td>', 'No order.', '2002-05-20 02:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63369, 1758, 878, '<td valign="top">Pretty basic shot, I think you could of gotten better with a different angle.</td>', 'Pretty basic shot, I think you could of gotten better with a different angle.', '2002-05-20 09:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63370, 1758, 772, '<td valign="top">I like to play solitaire too!  I am asking myself why you may have chosen to clip the cards on each edge of this frame... I think I would like either a tighter view showing less cards or a wider view showing all the cards rather than losing someting on each edge of the frame... Nice shot!</td>', 'I like to play solitaire too!  I am asking myself why you may have chosen to clip the cards on each edge of this frame... I think I would like either a tighter view showing less cards or a wider view showing all the cards rather than losing someting on each edge of the frame... Nice shot!', '2002-05-20 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63371, 1758, 327, '<td valign="top">Might of had more of an impact if it was cropped closer. Good idea.</td>', 'Might of had more of an impact if it was cropped closer. Good idea.', '2002-05-20 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63372, 1758, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice picture.  It makes me want to play solitare.</td>', 'This is a very nice picture.  It makes me want to play solitare.', '2002-05-20 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63373, 1758, 1446, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of backgrounds and the fact that it looks like someone was actually playing this game.  Not overly set up looking.</td>', 'I like your choice of backgrounds and the fact that it looks like someone was actually playing this game.  Not overly set up looking.', '2002-05-20 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63374, 1758, 1040, '<td valign="top">Hey look it''s solitare.</td>', 'Hey look it''s solitare.', '2002-05-21 09:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63375, 1758, 1175, '<td valign="top">Gimme some more.   Get a little lower and and give me some angle.  I''m not crazy about your background, there might be a bit too much contrast.</td>', 'Gimme some more.   Get a little lower and and give me some angle.  I''m not crazy about your background, there might be a bit too much contrast.', '2002-05-21 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63376, 1758, 1078, '<td valign="top">The angle helps give this a little bit of life.  I think I would have stopped way down on the aperture to get maximum depth of field -- if possible, maybe you were already there.  The cards in the background are just out of focus and this would help make them sharper.  Or, open way up and choose where you want your focus to be and let everything else be more unfocused.  Take your pick.  :-)</td>', 'The angle helps give this a little bit of life.  I think I would have stopped way down on the aperture to get maximum depth of field -- if possible, maybe you were already there.  The cards in the background are just out of focus and this would help make them sharper.  Or, open way up and choose where you want your focus to be and let everything else be more unfocused.  Take your pick.  :-)', '2002-05-21 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63377, 1758, 1597, '<td valign="top">clean &amp;crisp picture</td>', 'clean &crisp picture', '2002-05-21 21:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63378, 1758, 1054, '<td valign="top">At first I thought the background on this shot was too plain, but the more I look at the shot, I realize that it fits in well with the subject -- solitaire.  It was something that grew on me, unfortunately I''m sure a lot of voters don''t look at the pictures long enough to pick up that kind of subtlety.  The plain background gives a feeling of isolation and quiet that fits well with the theme.  Also, the arrangement of the cards does a good job of leading the eye across the picture.  Nicely done.</td>', 'At first I thought the background on this shot was too plain, but the more I look at the shot, I realize that it fits in well with the subject -- solitaire.  It was something that grew on me, unfortunately I''m sure a lot of voters don''t look at the pictures long enough to pick up that kind of subtlety.  The plain background gives a feeling of isolation and quiet that fits well with the theme.  Also, the arrangement of the cards does a good job of leading the eye across the picture.  Nicely done.', '2002-05-22 09:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63379, 1758, 1, '<td valign="top">The 3 of diamonds, and the ace of spaids seem to be a bit out of focus.  Try a larger aperature to capture everything.</td>', 'The 3 of diamonds, and the ace of spaids seem to be a bit out of focus.  Try a larger aperature to capture everything.', '2002-05-22 10:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63380, 1758, 1336, '<td valign="top">somewhat bland.  there''s just nothing special about this photo to give it a high score.</td>', 'somewhat bland.  there''s just nothing special about this photo to give it a high score.', '2002-05-23 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
