(63425, 1761, 637, '<td valign="top">Like the image... dislike the obviousness of the title, but maybe that''s cuz i''m a poker player.</td>', 'Like the image... dislike the obviousness of the title, but maybe that''s cuz i''m a poker player.', '2002-05-26 01:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
