(63466, 1763, 587, '<td valign="top">don''t know this game, but the whole ''it''s all fun and game ''till somebody loses an eye'' for some reason popped right into my head when I saw this :) The way this is cropped bugs me. don''t know exactly why. but I like the lighting and the color alot. good job.</td>', 'don''t know this game, but the whole ''it''s all fun and game ''till somebody loses an eye'' for some reason popped right into my head when I saw this :) The way this is cropped bugs me. don''t know exactly why. but I like the lighting and the color alot. good job.', '2002-05-21 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63467, 1763, 1031, '<td valign="top">We certainly ruined a bunch of inoffensive pocket knives which deserved better...</td>', 'We certainly ruined a bunch of inoffensive pocket knives which deserved better...', '2002-05-21 21:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63468, 1763, 1647, '<td valign="top">"Be creative, and make your game obvious and appealing! " - Hmm, I''m not sure your game is appealing...  Although I''m pretty sure I know what it is.</td>', '"Be creative, and make your game obvious and appealing! " - Hmm, I''m not sure your game is appealing...  Although I''m pretty sure I know what it is.', '2002-05-21 21:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63469, 1763, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, it''s very gritty :). Is the memory of just having penknives in general, or of throwing them so they stick in the ground?</td>', 'I like this photo, it''s very gritty :). Is the memory of just having penknives in general, or of throwing them so they stick in the ground?', '2002-05-21 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63470, 1763, 244, '<td valign="top">I remember that too, but I think the camera focused on the ground and not the knives as is it kinda makes me dizzy staring at it for too long.</td>', 'I remember that too, but I think the camera focused on the ground and not the knives as is it kinda makes me dizzy staring at it for too long.', '2002-05-21 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63471, 1763, 113, '<td valign="top">Heck, I still play that game.  The photo is kind of uninteresting although it does bring up memories.</td>', 'Heck, I still play that game.  The photo is kind of uninteresting although it does bring up memories.', '2002-05-22 06:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63472, 1763, 1, '<td valign="top">I can imagine that game can really ruin the blade of the knife, though I''ve never played it.  I think you need a tighter crop of a different angle.</td>', 'I can imagine that game can really ruin the blade of the knife, though I''ve never played it.  I think you need a tighter crop of a different angle.', '2002-05-23 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63473, 1763, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like that you have a totally different take on this challenge and that you survived your childhood playing with knives! ;o)  Good shot.</td>', 'I like that you have a totally different take on this challenge and that you survived your childhood playing with knives! ;o)  Good shot.', '2002-05-23 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63474, 1763, 1042, '<td valign="top">pretty neat shot</td>', 'pretty neat shot', '2002-05-23 21:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63475, 1763, 1597, '<td valign="top">a bit unfocused but creative</td>', 'a bit unfocused but creative', '2002-05-23 22:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63476, 1763, 1361, '<td valign="top">huh?!!?</td>', 'huh?!!?', '2002-05-25 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63477, 1763, 428, '<td valign="top">The knives don''t seem quite in focus</td>', 'The knives don''t seem quite in focus', '2002-05-25 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63478, 1763, 527, '<td valign="top">It seems a little ordinary to me. It needs some dramic lighting or long shadows or something.</td>', 'It seems a little ordinary to me. It needs some dramic lighting or long shadows or something.', '2002-05-26 02:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63479, 1763, 1528, '<td valign="top">unique idea<br/>focus seems a bit off though</td>', 'unique ideafocus seems a bit off though', '2002-05-27 00:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63480, 1763, 409, '<td valign="top">beautifully unsettling. <br/>why such a low score? <br/>sometimes.... aghh<br/>sorry<br/><br/>nicely done <br/>I like.</td>', 'beautifully unsettling. why such a low score? sometimes.... aghhsorrynicely done I like.', '2002-05-27 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(63481, 1763, 1945, '<td valign="top">very good dick<br/>from steve</td>', 'very good dickfrom steve', '2002-06-01 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(63482, 1764, 1336, '<td valign="top">very nice.  i like it.</td>', 'very nice.  i like it.', '2002-05-20 07:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63483, 1764, 878, '<td valign="top">Nice technical shot, good depth of field</td>', 'Nice technical shot, good depth of field', '2002-05-20 09:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63484, 1764, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice, nice reflections.  Great depth of field. Excellent composition.</td>', 'Nice, nice reflections.  Great depth of field. Excellent composition.', '2002-05-20 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63485, 1764, 327, '<td valign="top">Lovely reflection, nice colors, super DOF. Well done</td>', 'Lovely reflection, nice colors, super DOF. Well done', '2002-05-20 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63486, 1764, 616, '<td valign="top">The reflection in the table is a very kool effect</td>', 'The reflection in the table is a very kool effect', '2002-05-20 17:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63487, 1764, 1750, '<td valign="top">Like the reflection, color, and leading the eye.</td>', 'Like the reflection, color, and leading the eye.', '2002-05-20 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63488, 1764, 1446, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and the dof on this shot.  The problem I see with it is that nothing leads my eye around the picture.</td>', 'I really like the colors and the dof on this shot.  The problem I see with it is that nothing leads my eye around the picture.', '2002-05-21 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63489, 1764, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo!  I sorta wanna give that first domino a little push!  The reflections are nice as well... good job!</td>', 'Very nice photo!  I sorta wanna give that first domino a little push!  The reflections are nice as well... good job!', '2002-05-22 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63490, 1764, 1707, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections.  Good effect! -NBT</td>', 'I like the reflections.  Good effect! -NBT', '2002-05-23 06:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63491, 1764, 1681, '<td valign="top">How can you pass up those colorful dominoes (my entry was dominoes too).  Like the reflection on the table.  Might have liked to see a Little more dof, but it works for me the way it is too!</td>', 'How can you pass up those colorful dominoes (my entry was dominoes too).  Like the reflection on the table.  Might have liked to see a Little more dof, but it works for me the way it is too!', '2002-05-23 07:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63492, 1764, 1, '<td valign="top">Great reflection, composition, and colors -- thank god you didn''t convert it to grayscale like the rest of the dominoe shows.</td>', 'Great reflection, composition, and colors -- thank god you didn''t convert it to grayscale like the rest of the dominoe shows.', '2002-05-23 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63493, 1764, 1597, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of colors I thought about this same kind of shot</td>', 'Nice contrast of colors I thought about this same kind of shot', '2002-05-23 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63494, 1764, 748, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, I like the reflections.</td>', 'Nicely done, I like the reflections.', '2002-05-24 11:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63495, 1764, 661, '<td valign="top">Pretty tiles.  Nice reflection.</td>', 'Pretty tiles.  Nice reflection.', '2002-05-24 22:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63496, 1764, 1135, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I like the color and reflection. I little more light on the left side would have made this a 10.</td>', 'Very nice shot. I like the color and reflection. I little more light on the left side would have made this a 10.', '2002-05-25 01:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63497, 1764, 543, '<td valign="top">Moving the lightsource from the R to L would have avoided the shadows on the rear dominoes.  DOF trails off a little abruptly for my taste.</td>', 'Moving the lightsource from the R to L would have avoided the shadows on the rear dominoes.  DOF trails off a little abruptly for my taste.', '2002-05-25 04:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63498, 1764, 428, '<td valign="top">Oooh I just want to knock them down! I like the way you have the front one and its reflection in focus with the others fading into the background. Nice shot!</td>', 'Oooh I just want to knock them down! I like the way you have the front one and its reflection in focus with the others fading into the background. Nice shot!', '2002-05-25 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63499, 1764, 637, '<td valign="top">Great use of depth of field.</td>', 'Great use of depth of field.', '2002-05-26 01:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63500, 1764, 527, '<td valign="top">I want to push the first domino over and capture that. It''s a nice picture still.</td>', 'I want to push the first domino over and capture that. It''s a nice picture still.', '2002-05-26 02:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63501, 1765, 1, '<td valign="top">I think the image could''ve benefited better from a different background with perhaps the net and some opposing players.</td>', 'I think the image could''ve benefited better from a different background with perhaps the net and some opposing players.', '2002-05-20 10:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63502, 1765, 951, '<td valign="top">A very striking image.  Great use of colour.</td>', 'A very striking image.  Great use of colour.', '2002-05-20 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63503, 1765, 1585, '<td valign="top">Good color, nice choice of back ground.</td>', 'Good color, nice choice of back ground.', '2002-05-20 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63504, 1765, 92, '<td valign="top">I really like the color in this one. It''s a nice photo ! A 9 with me:)</td>', 'I really like the color in this one. It''s a nice photo ! A 9 with me:)', '2002-05-20 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63505, 1765, 327, '<td valign="top">Action added to the shot, good work.</td>', 'Action added to the shot, good work.', '2002-05-20 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63506, 1765, 1750, '<td valign="top">Very good contrast between subject and background. My personal preference: would have cropped the sky on top a bit.</td>', 'Very good contrast between subject and background. My personal preference: would have cropped the sky on top a bit.', '2002-05-20 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63507, 1765, 1582, '<td valign="top">This is a very clever and  eye catching shot, the blue background and the red racket and birdie make this and exceptionally great eye pleasing picture. I think it is definitly my favorite. You are probably a very awesome photographer and cute too!</td>', 'This is a very clever and  eye catching shot, the blue background and the red racket and birdie make this and exceptionally great eye pleasing picture. I think it is definitly my favorite. You are probably a very awesome photographer and cute too!', '2002-05-20 22:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63508, 1765, 1143, '<td valign="top">You might try this shot with a slower shutter speed so that it shows some movement. I like the deep blue sky.</td>', 'You might try this shot with a slower shutter speed so that it shows some movement. I like the deep blue sky.', '2002-05-21 00:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63509, 1765, 1455, '<td valign="top">Nice and clear.  No action movement at all.</td>', 'Nice and clear.  No action movement at all.', '2002-05-21 08:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63510, 1765, 1078, '<td valign="top">Wow -- polarizing filter, or saturation levels?  Great blue.  I find myself wanting that racket to be more perfectly horizontal.  If possible, I think I would have rotated the image a few degrees counter-clockwise too level it out.  This is a fun shot.</td>', 'Wow -- polarizing filter, or saturation levels?  Great blue.  I find myself wanting that racket to be more perfectly horizontal.  If possible, I think I would have rotated the image a few degrees counter-clockwise too level it out.  This is a fun shot.', '2002-05-21 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63511, 1765, 1446, '<td valign="top">great color.......nice looking background....I would have liked the birdie a little less centered.</td>', 'great color.......nice looking background....I would have liked the birdie a little less centered.', '2002-05-21 17:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63512, 1765, 1031, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if I''ll ever get used to those new neon colors...are the strings multi-colored or is that an effect of the light?</td>', 'I don''t know if I''ll ever get used to those new neon colors...are the strings multi-colored or is that an effect of the light?', '2002-05-21 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63513, 1765, 1024, '<td valign="top">Great colors, nice composition.</td>', 'Great colors, nice composition.', '2002-05-22 03:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63514, 1765, 113, '<td valign="top">On this photo, I may have liked it better cropped more at the top.  Did you try shooting through the netting at the birdie?</td>', 'On this photo, I may have liked it better cropped more at the top.  Did you try shooting through the netting at the birdie?', '2002-05-22 07:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63515, 1765, 640, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Nice colors and great stopped action!</td>', 'Beautiful! Nice colors and great stopped action!', '2002-05-22 07:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63516, 1765, 1041, '<td valign="top">Wow, you''ve been reading about that superchallenge, haven''t you.  Stopped motion, from the ground up, games, red . . . not bad at all.</td>', 'Wow, you''ve been reading about that superchallenge, haven''t you.  Stopped motion, from the ground up, games, red . . . not bad at all.', '2002-05-22 08:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63517, 1765, 741, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot - the cloud looks great.  Sharper focusing on the shuttlecock would have really set this off.</td>', 'Nice action shot - the cloud looks great.  Sharper focusing on the shuttlecock would have really set this off.', '2002-05-22 11:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63518, 1765, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this photo... The nice blue sky adds quite a bit... good job!</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this photo... The nice blue sky adds quite a bit... good job!', '2002-05-22 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63519, 1765, 842, '<td valign="top">pretty sky.</td>', 'pretty sky.', '2002-05-22 19:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63520, 1765, 824, '<td valign="top">what''s the background?</td>', 'what''s the background?', '2002-05-22 23:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63521, 1765, 674, '<td valign="top">Clever Sky alittle too blue to be true were you using a polariser.</td>', 'Clever Sky alittle too blue to be true were you using a polariser.', '2002-05-23 06:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63522, 1765, 573, '<td valign="top">So, what ever happened to Mathew Bradly?  Nice play on early photography.  I would have expected a Sepia tint though.  You could have used this in the ''From the Ground Up'' challenge and "Kill two bird(ie)s with one stone".  ;&amp;lt;)</td>', 'So, what ever happened to Mathew Bradly?  Nice play on early photography.  I would have expected a Sepia tint though.  You could have used this in the ''From the Ground Up'' challenge and "Kill two bird(ie)s with one stone".  ;&lt;)', '2002-05-23 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63523, 1765, 878, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I love the colors in it.  The reds are almost over saturated but nothing that ruins this shot for me. <br/><br/></td>', 'Nice shot, I love the colors in it.  The reds are almost over saturated but nothing that ruins this shot for me. ', '2002-05-23 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63524, 1765, 1799, '<td valign="top">Color combination is good.</td>', 'Color combination is good.', '2002-05-23 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63525, 1765, 748, '<td valign="top">Simple, but nice.  Good work. I would have filled the frame a bit more.</td>', 'Simple, but nice.  Good work. I would have filled the frame a bit more.', '2002-05-23 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63526, 1765, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice contrast of colors</td>', 'nice contrast of colors', '2002-05-23 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63527, 1765, 1808, '<td valign="top">Looks like fun!</td>', 'Looks like fun!', '2002-05-23 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63528, 1765, 543, '<td valign="top">Certainly pops.  Colors a little too saturated for my taste - maybe lighting the whole image just a little would help.  I''d like the birdie just a bit higher.  Fill flash would have helped avoid the bottom of the racquet and birdie being in shadow.  Did you use a polarizer?</td>', 'Certainly pops.  Colors a little too saturated for my taste - maybe lighting the whole image just a little would help.  I''d like the birdie just a bit higher.  Fill flash would have helped avoid the bottom of the racquet and birdie being in shadow.  Did you use a polarizer?', '2002-05-25 02:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63529, 1765, 280, '<td valign="top">Very nice perspective, however the sky looks a little grainy maybe you camera?</td>', 'Very nice perspective, however the sky looks a little grainy maybe you camera?', '2002-05-25 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63530, 1765, 509, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the framing of this that much.  To me, there''s too much sky here, not enough badminton.  Good action shot though</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the framing of this that much.  To me, there''s too much sky here, not enough badminton.  Good action shot though', '2002-05-26 07:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63531, 1765, 811, '<td valign="top">A little too much sky at the top, but it makes a nice contrast with the birdie.</td>', 'A little too much sky at the top, but it makes a nice contrast with the birdie.', '2002-05-27 00:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63532, 1765, 1135, '<td valign="top">Yes, I used a polarizer filter on this shot. Thanks for all of the good comments.</td>', 'Yes, I used a polarizer filter on this shot. Thanks for all of the good comments.', '2002-05-27 01:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(63533, 1765, 543, '<td valign="top">Waitaminute... how does BNC know you''re cute? {g}</td>', 'Waitaminute... how does BNC know you''re cute? {g}', '2002-05-28 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(63534, 1766, 47, '<td valign="top">hmm... cant see the board that much? this was my attempt, which i decided not to submit.<br/><br/>//fuck.org/~jon/photos/dpc/games/days_of_yore.jpg</td>', 'hmm... cant see the board that much? this was my attempt, which i decided not to submit.//fuck.org/~jon/photos/dpc/games/days_of_yore.jpg', '2002-05-20 07:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63535, 1766, 1336, '<td valign="top">this would have been nice if that stuff wasn''t in the background and the game board didnt have such a harsh glare on it.</td>', 'this would have been nice if that stuff wasn''t in the background and the game board didnt have such a harsh glare on it.', '2002-05-20 07:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63536, 1766, 1379, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but why black and white?  Gray candy is not that fun...</td>', 'I like the idea, but why black and white?  Gray candy is not that fun...', '2002-05-20 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63537, 1766, 714, '<td valign="top">This picture feels to dark and gloomy to be candyland.  Maybe if you would have got more of the gameboard with the little men.  Just a thought.  :)</td>', 'This picture feels to dark and gloomy to be candyland.  Maybe if you would have got more of the gameboard with the little men.  Just a thought.  :)', '2002-05-20 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63538, 1766, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, thougha better angle including the board would''ve been better.</td>', 'Nice DOF, thougha better angle including the board would''ve been better.', '2002-05-20 13:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63539, 1766, 259, '<td valign="top">too much going on in the background</td>', 'too much going on in the background', '2002-05-20 13:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63540, 1766, 327, '<td valign="top">Hee, hee fun shot, done well. Glare a little harsh, but nice.</td>', 'Hee, hee fun shot, done well. Glare a little harsh, but nice.', '2002-05-20 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63541, 1766, 587, '<td valign="top">Candyland to me should be bright and cheerful with it''s pastel colors, not b&amp;w. sorry, that and the hot spots take away from the photo for me.</td>', 'Candyland to me should be bright and cheerful with it''s pastel colors, not b&w. sorry, that and the hot spots take away from the photo for me.', '2002-05-20 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63542, 1766, 570, '<td valign="top">ok</td>', 'ok', '2002-05-20 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63543, 1766, 1175, '<td valign="top">The background is distracting.  You can''t make out the lines on the lighter piece.  There is too much glare on the board so it just looks distracting rather then adding anything to the picture.  I also question your choice of B&amp;W with a very colorful childs game.</td>', 'The background is distracting.  You can''t make out the lines on the lighter piece.  There is too much glare on the board so it just looks distracting rather then adding anything to the picture.  I also question your choice of B&W with a very colorful childs game.', '2002-05-20 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63544, 1766, 1569, '<td valign="top">Background too cluttered.</td>', 'Background too cluttered.', '2002-05-20 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63545, 1766, 1750, '<td valign="top">Makes me feel lighthearted.</td>', 'Makes me feel lighthearted.', '2002-05-20 19:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63546, 1766, 724, '<td valign="top">Candy land has such great colors, why go B&amp;W?  Background is a bit busy.</td>', 'Candy land has such great colors, why go B&W?  Background is a bit busy.', '2002-05-20 19:59:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(63547, 1766, 1759, '<td valign="top">Cute, but try a backdrop and some back lighting to increase contrast.</td>', 'Cute, but try a backdrop and some back lighting to increase contrast.', '2002-05-20 20:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63548, 1766, 509, '<td valign="top">Strangely frightening lol.  It has a certain tone about it that really makes it more interesting. - 7</td>', 'Strangely frightening lol.  It has a certain tone about it that really makes it more interesting. - 7', '2002-05-20 22:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63549, 1766, 1041, '<td valign="top">B&amp;w works well here.  Things that I would try and change for this kind of planned shot: slightly higer angle to get rid of the reflection on the game board (even though I really like the heads-on angle, and wouldn''t like to loose that - just something inbetween this and top-down).  Clean up background (a black piece of cardboard placed at a little distance from the subject can easily do the trick).  Although, your background is sufficiently out of focus to not be too distracting.</td>', 'B&w works well here.  Things that I would try and change for this kind of planned shot: slightly higer angle to get rid of the reflection on the game board (even though I really like the heads-on angle, and wouldn''t like to loose that - just something inbetween this and top-down).  Clean up background (a black piece of cardboard placed at a little distance from the subject can easily do the trick).  Although, your background is sufficiently out of focus to not be too distracting.', '2002-05-21 08:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63550, 1766, 301, '<td valign="top">The B&amp;W doesn''t work here with me.  The pieces don''t really jump out at me, even with the small DOF you''ve used.</td>', 'The B&W doesn''t work here with me.  The pieces don''t really jump out at me, even with the small DOF you''ve used.', '2002-05-21 09:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63551, 1766, 1446, '<td valign="top">A lot of glare on this photo</td>', 'A lot of glare on this photo', '2002-05-21 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63552, 1766, 244, '<td valign="top">Did you try to shoot this from a different angle?  Maybe from a little higher where we could see what is on the board too, as is it kinda looks like you got a couple of cookie cutters standing up on a strange table cloth. Also the clutter in the background distracts.</td>', 'Did you try to shoot this from a different angle?  Maybe from a little higher where we could see what is on the board too, as is it kinda looks like you got a couple of cookie cutters standing up on a strange table cloth. Also the clutter in the background distracts.', '2002-05-21 23:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63553, 1766, 1024, '<td valign="top">A lower angle would have helped with that background, but your use of limited depth of field did help in this aspect.</td>', 'A lower angle would have helped with that background, but your use of limited depth of field did help in this aspect.', '2002-05-22 08:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63554, 1766, 878, '<td valign="top">Whats in the background?  I would like to see some more of the game board.</td>', 'Whats in the background?  I would like to see some more of the game board.', '2002-05-22 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63555, 1766, 772, '<td valign="top">The blur of the background in this shot is helping but I think I would like to see more of the game board in this photo as well.  It appears that there is a little too much light on the gameboard too...</td>', 'The blur of the background in this shot is helping but I think I would like to see more of the game board in this photo as well.  It appears that there is a little too much light on the gameboard too...', '2002-05-22 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63556, 1766, 1597, '<td valign="top">Would have like to have seen this in color,pieces are to dark to see</td>', 'Would have like to have seen this in color,pieces are to dark to see', '2002-05-23 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
