(63672, 1774, 1446, '<td valign="top">You definately got the challenge part.......I think if you had zoomed out a bit, gotten rid of the big round thing on the left (most of it) and included the person in the upper right this might have been a winner in this competition.</td>', 'You definately got the challenge part.......I think if you had zoomed out a bit, gotten rid of the big round thing on the left (most of it) and included the person in the upper right this might have been a winner in this competition.', '2002-05-21 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63673, 1774, 878, '<td valign="top">Tell me that doesnt look like fun.  Good color, fun game.  I think getting slightly behind the shooter would make a better angle on the shot but would also add another target to the game :D. <br/><br/></td>', 'Tell me that doesnt look like fun.  Good color, fun game.  I think getting slightly behind the shooter would make a better angle on the shot but would also add another target to the game :D. ', '2002-05-21 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
