(63678, 1774, 824, '<td valign="top">Unique game, but not much that intrigues me with this choice of subject.</td>', 'Unique game, but not much that intrigues me with this choice of subject.', '2002-05-22 23:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63679, 1774, 244, '<td valign="top">I never played paintball, kinda looks like a BMX racer turned sniper.  Lighting, focus, and dept of field are good.  The subject dosen''t really do much for me though.</td>', 'I never played paintball, kinda looks like a BMX racer turned sniper.  Lighting, focus, and dept of field are good.  The subject dosen''t really do much for me though.', '2002-05-22 23:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63680, 1774, 1078, '<td valign="top">OK, one of the kind of comments I hate: I wish that person in the background were on the other team and sneaking up on this one.  :-)  While it is a cooly shaped piece of whatever, I''m not sure why you chose to give over about a third of your image to the canister being hidden behind.  It also looks like the image might be slightly rotated clockwise.  I''d either go for a more extreme angle, or level it out.</td>', 'OK, one of the kind of comments I hate: I wish that person in the background were on the other team and sneaking up on this one.  :-)  While it is a cooly shaped piece of whatever, I''m not sure why you chose to give over about a third of your image to the canister being hidden behind.  It also looks like the image might be slightly rotated clockwise.  I''d either go for a more extreme angle, or level it out.', '2002-05-23 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63681, 1774, 543, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed with the player''s head on a third.  An action shot might have been more interesting than crouching in cover.  Mid afternoon makes for kind of craptacular lighting outdoors, but I guess that''s when they play.  Needs some CCW rotation.</td>', 'Nicely composed with the player''s head on a third.  An action shot might have been more interesting than crouching in cover.  Mid afternoon makes for kind of craptacular lighting outdoors, but I guess that''s when they play.  Needs some CCW rotation.', '2002-05-26 03:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63682, 1774, 1, '<td valign="top">I would prefer to see the other paintball player uncropped, as well as the guy in the foreground''s feet.  Also you see to have a tilt problem a bit to the right.</td>', 'I would prefer to see the other paintball player uncropped, as well as the guy in the foreground''s feet.  Also you see to have a tilt problem a bit to the right.', '2002-05-26 09:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63683, 1776, 1647, '<td valign="top">You get points for working with a real life scenario and also for capturing a feel.  Everything about this photo - the uniforms, the chain-mesh fence, the glove and hat on the ground - complies with my typical mental image of baseball.  Well done.</td>', 'You get points for working with a real life scenario and also for capturing a feel.  Everything about this photo - the uniforms, the chain-mesh fence, the glove and hat on the ground - complies with my typical mental image of baseball.  Well done.', '2002-05-20 01:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63684, 1776, 878, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but there is a bit too much chain link fence.  It looks like there are 2 layers before you get to the subject.</td>', 'Nice shot but there is a bit too much chain link fence.  It looks like there are 2 layers before you get to the subject.', '2002-05-20 09:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63685, 1776, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  I love the uposed quality.  Those three blue cups though are unfortunate because they lead my eye to the edges of the frame, away from the subjects.</td>', 'Nice capture.  I love the uposed quality.  Those three blue cups though are unfortunate because they lead my eye to the edges of the frame, away from the subjects.', '2002-05-20 12:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63686, 1776, 92, '<td valign="top">I like this photo ! The girl and them so into the game...it just has that feel to it that makes it a 9 with me:)</td>', 'I like this photo ! The girl and them so into the game...it just has that feel to it that makes it a 9 with me:)', '2002-05-20 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63687, 1776, 327, '<td valign="top">Really like this shot. My only nit here would be to of cropped the right side and maybe zoomed in some. Fine composition, great creative idea.</td>', 'Really like this shot. My only nit here would be to of cropped the right side and maybe zoomed in some. Fine composition, great creative idea.', '2002-05-20 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63688, 1776, 724, '<td valign="top">Been there...great idea, nice shot, too much to look at with all of the chain link.</td>', 'Been there...great idea, nice shot, too much to look at with all of the chain link.', '2002-05-20 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63689, 1776, 616, '<td valign="top">hahaha...reminds me of the good ol'' days</td>', 'hahaha...reminds me of the good ol'' days', '2002-05-20 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63690, 1776, 1078, '<td valign="top">I was going to suggest cropping in tighter on the two on the bench, but the more I look at the image, the more I think that might be a bad idea.  Too many things in the fringes of the picture that help sets its mood and give it context -- the glove in LR, the helmet LL, the kid on the left side, etc.  So, I''m not sure.  Maybe something to try.  I really like the multiple layers of chain link fence.  Good work.</td>', 'I was going to suggest cropping in tighter on the two on the bench, but the more I look at the image, the more I think that might be a bad idea.  Too many things in the fringes of the picture that help sets its mood and give it context -- the glove in LR, the helmet LL, the kid on the left side, etc.  So, I''m not sure.  Maybe something to try.  I really like the multiple layers of chain link fence.  Good work.', '2002-05-21 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63691, 1776, 772, '<td valign="top">I think you have done an excellent job of capturing this game with this photo.  This looks like a photo that would make an excellent addition to someone''s family album!  good job! = 8</td>', 'I think you have done an excellent job of capturing this game with this photo.  This looks like a photo that would make an excellent addition to someone''s family album!  good job! = 8', '2002-05-21 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63692, 1776, 301, '<td valign="top">the fences really ruin this photo.  by getting right up against the first fence, you could eliminate at least one.  I still like the feeling of loneliness that this photo gives</td>', 'the fences really ruin this photo.  by getting right up against the first fence, you could eliminate at least one.  I still like the feeling of loneliness that this photo gives', '2002-05-21 12:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63693, 1776, 1446, '<td valign="top">This would have been a really good shot if I didn''t have to sort out the several layers of chain link fence from the subjects.</td>', 'This would have been a really good shot if I didn''t have to sort out the several layers of chain link fence from the subjects.', '2002-05-21 16:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63694, 1776, 1175, '<td valign="top">This is a good picture, but unfortunately there is just TOOO much fence.  Its very distracting and the subject gets lost within it.</td>', 'This is a good picture, but unfortunately there is just TOOO much fence.  Its very distracting and the subject gets lost within it.', '2002-05-21 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63695, 1776, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice capture of a moment in time</td>', 'nice capture of a moment in time', '2002-05-21 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63696, 1776, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge. I like it.  Like the composition of the photo, too, shooting through the fence makes it stand out from your average sports shot.  I know this is just one of those things, but the two layers of fence inbetween the camera and bench warmers makes the shot a little too busy.  Also, what''s the blue thing about the girl''s head.  Is that something that could''ve been removed before taking the shot?</td>', 'Great take on the challenge. I like it.  Like the composition of the photo, too, shooting through the fence makes it stand out from your average sports shot.  I know this is just one of those things, but the two layers of fence inbetween the camera and bench warmers makes the shot a little too busy.  Also, what''s the blue thing about the girl''s head.  Is that something that could''ve been removed before taking the shot?', '2002-05-22 10:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63697, 1776, 1005, '<td valign="top">Technically nothing really wrong, but hate the fences, really steals from your shot.  Photo 6 Creativity 6 Games 7 total 6</td>', 'Technically nothing really wrong, but hate the fences, really steals from your shot.  Photo 6 Creativity 6 Games 7 total 6', '2002-05-22 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63698, 1776, 1336, '<td valign="top">this is a great example of having kids in a photo where they''re not being used for "cute points."  i like it.</td>', 'this is a great example of having kids in a photo where they''re not being used for "cute points."  i like it.', '2002-05-23 10:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63699, 1776, 543, '<td valign="top">The double row of chain link fence is interesting.  Bottom just slightly tight (cut off cup and nearly lost the girl''s toe).  A little lower would have fixed that and cut off some of the burnt out sky and the cup hovering above the girl''s head.  Nits aside, quite nice.</td>', 'The double row of chain link fence is interesting.  Bottom just slightly tight (cut off cup and nearly lost the girl''s toe).  A little lower would have fixed that and cut off some of the burnt out sky and the cup hovering above the girl''s head.  Nits aside, quite nice.', '2002-05-25 03:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63700, 1776, 441, '<td valign="top">I would never have attempted this shot - but it works! well done</td>', 'I would never have attempted this shot - but it works! well done', '2002-05-25 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63701, 1776, 1031, '<td valign="top">Hope they got in the game eventually!</td>', 'Hope they got in the game eventually!', '2002-05-25 20:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63702, 1776, 428, '<td valign="top">People are probably going to tell you, you should have taken this without the fence! Well I for one am not going to say that, I think you did an excellent job at catching the "moment of this.</td>', 'People are probably going to tell you, you should have taken this without the fence! Well I for one am not going to say that, I think you did an excellent job at catching the "moment of this.', '2002-05-25 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63703, 1776, 527, '<td valign="top">If only the background could have been blurred more. I still really like it.</td>', 'If only the background could have been blurred more. I still really like it.', '2002-05-26 03:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63704, 1776, 1, '<td valign="top">Are there two or three fences between you and the subject?  I think 1 would''ve been enough -- maybe you could''ve found a better angle that only included one?</td>', 'Are there two or three fences between you and the subject?  I think 1 would''ve been enough -- maybe you could''ve found a better angle that only included one?', '2002-05-27 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63705, 1776, 2, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in the challenge -- amazing job capturing the mood.</td>', 'One of my favorites in the challenge -- amazing job capturing the mood.', '2002-05-27 00:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63706, 1777, 113, '<td valign="top">This would have fit in with the stop action challenge.  I think lighting could have helped a bunch....  My mom would never let me play this game!  tee hee</td>', 'This would have fit in with the stop action challenge.  I think lighting could have helped a bunch....  My mom would never let me play this game!  tee hee', '2002-05-20 03:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63707, 1777, 1, '<td valign="top">You definitely have a lighting problem here -- more light needs to be on the front of your subjects, rather than behind.  A flash might''ve worked.</td>', 'You definitely have a lighting problem here -- more light needs to be on the front of your subjects, rather than behind.  A flash might''ve worked.', '2002-05-20 08:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63708, 1777, 1379, '<td valign="top">Everyone loves this game!</td>', 'Everyone loves this game!', '2002-05-20 09:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63709, 1777, 327, '<td valign="top">Lucky kids. Fun action shot.</td>', 'Lucky kids. Fun action shot.', '2002-05-20 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
