(63716, 1777, 1041, '<td valign="top">This one could''ve been entered for stopped motion and (almost) from the ground up, too.  I love the idea, however, the picture is too dark, you can barely make out the two faces.  Try with a fill-flash next time?</td>', 'This one could''ve been entered for stopped motion and (almost) from the ground up, too.  I love the idea, however, the picture is too dark, you can barely make out the two faces.  Try with a fill-flash next time?', '2002-05-21 08:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63717, 1777, 1078, '<td valign="top">Really fun picture, but the best part I can barely see.  The setting is important to this shot, but it''s the only well lit portion.  I REALLY want to be able to see the expression of the child on the right.  It looks like it would be killer.  Your focus should be on the children and their faces -- they look like they''re having fun, but because they''re not well lit, your audience realy has to work at seeing it.</td>', 'Really fun picture, but the best part I can barely see.  The setting is important to this shot, but it''s the only well lit portion.  I REALLY want to be able to see the expression of the child on the right.  It looks like it would be killer.  Your focus should be on the children and their faces -- they look like they''re having fun, but because they''re not well lit, your audience realy has to work at seeing it.', '2002-05-21 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63718, 1777, 1175, '<td valign="top">That''s a wonderful picture but I think its ruined by the backlight.  Children have wonderful expressions on their faces so light should be on their front.</td>', 'That''s a wonderful picture but I think its ruined by the backlight.  Children have wonderful expressions on their faces so light should be on their front.', '2002-05-21 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
