(63720, 1777, 1037, '<td valign="top">So cute!! The lighting in this photo is a bit dim, but it has a lot of pathos. The looks on their faces are priceless :)</td>', 'So cute!! The lighting in this photo is a bit dim, but it has a lot of pathos. The looks on their faces are priceless :)', '2002-05-21 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63721, 1777, 1024, '<td valign="top">This would have worked in the stop motion challenge as well as here.</td>', 'This would have worked in the stop motion challenge as well as here.', '2002-05-22 03:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63722, 1777, 301, '<td valign="top">you needed to use the flash here. There isn''t a lot of light in the photo, and the kids are lit from behind.  Because you needed to stop the kids mid-air, you can''t use a longer exposure.  The ceiling isn''t the prettiest either ... unless you were really trying to get one of the kids to bump his head :)</td>', 'you needed to use the flash here. There isn''t a lot of light in the photo, and the kids are lit from behind.  Because you needed to stop the kids mid-air, you can''t use a longer exposure.  The ceiling isn''t the prettiest either ... unless you were really trying to get one of the kids to bump his head :)', '2002-05-22 07:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63723, 1777, 640, '<td valign="top">Seems that because there''s so much white, the actual subjects are too dark.</td>', 'Seems that because there''s so much white, the actual subjects are too dark.', '2002-05-22 07:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63724, 1777, 1054, '<td valign="top">ROFL! How cute!  A great capture, the only thng that might improve it would be a fill flash.</td>', 'ROFL! How cute!  A great capture, the only thng that might improve it would be a fill flash.', '2002-05-22 09:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63725, 1777, 741, '<td valign="top">More light in the kids'' faces would have made this even better - all the white has fooled the camera into underexposing this.</td>', 'More light in the kids'' faces would have made this even better - all the white has fooled the camera into underexposing this.', '2002-05-22 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63726, 1777, 772, '<td valign="top">A little additional foreground lighting would have brought the detail of these children out quite a bit more.  The back lighting is providing a ''sihlouette'' effect on the children and it''s hard to really see their facial expressions in this photo :)  Good job!</td>', 'A little additional foreground lighting would have brought the detail of these children out quite a bit more.  The back lighting is providing a ''sihlouette'' effect on the children and it''s hard to really see their facial expressions in this photo :)  Good job!', '2002-05-22 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63727, 1777, 1597, '<td valign="top">not focused well</td>', 'not focused well', '2002-05-22 20:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63728, 1777, 1336, '<td valign="top">good idea, poor lighting.</td>', 'good idea, poor lighting.', '2002-05-23 09:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63729, 1777, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen THAT game played recently! Of course,  I imagine there are regional rules variations...</td>', 'I''ve seen THAT game played recently! Of course,  I imagine there are regional rules variations...', '2002-05-25 19:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63730, 1777, 428, '<td valign="top">Now there''s a fun game!  From this angle it looks like they are hitting the ceiling, I think I would have tried to take it from a different angle.</td>', 'Now there''s a fun game!  From this angle it looks like they are hitting the ceiling, I think I would have tried to take it from a different angle.', '2002-05-25 20:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63731, 1777, 509, '<td valign="top">Good potential here, but I wish the kids weren''t underexposed.  Did you use flash on this?  That could help.  Also might get rid of that blur on the kid on the right.</td>', 'Good potential here, but I wish the kids weren''t underexposed.  Did you use flash on this?  That could help.  Also might get rid of that blur on the kid on the right.', '2002-05-26 07:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63732, 1777, 862, '<td valign="top">Wow... I''m surprised this didn''t do better.  I thought that the room and bed looked great.  Very photogenic.  I also felt that the silhouetted children made the shot more generic (as in; "this could be you or your children").</td>', 'Wow... I''m surprised this didn''t do better.  I thought that the room and bed looked great.  Very photogenic.  I also felt that the silhouetted children made the shot more generic (as in; "this could be you or your children").', '2002-05-28 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(63733, 1778, 878, '<td valign="top">I always enjoyed the colors of the backgammon board.  I think the black and white on this shot takes away from the game.</td>', 'I always enjoyed the colors of the backgammon board.  I think the black and white on this shot takes away from the game.', '2002-05-20 09:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63734, 1778, 587, '<td valign="top">Good color, great clarity - like it!!</td>', 'Good color, great clarity - like it!!', '2002-05-20 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63735, 1778, 1446, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W.  Good contrast.  Good use of light and shadows.</td>', 'Nice B&W.  Good contrast.  Good use of light and shadows.', '2002-05-20 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63736, 1778, 54, '<td valign="top">I think doing this in color may have added more interest.</td>', 'I think doing this in color may have added more interest.', '2002-05-20 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63737, 1778, 327, '<td valign="top">Beautiful b&amp;w. Nice work.</td>', 'Beautiful b&w. Nice work.', '2002-05-20 14:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63738, 1778, 1078, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Good lighting.  Nice texture on the board itself.  I think I would have moved the LL dice toward the right just a little bit -- it feels too close to the edge.  The white pieces also seem VERY white (especially in comparison to the dice), but maybe they really are.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Good lighting.  Nice texture on the board itself.  I think I would have moved the LL dice toward the right just a little bit -- it feels too close to the edge.  The white pieces also seem VERY white (especially in comparison to the dice), but maybe they really are.', '2002-05-21 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63739, 1778, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo!  Nice focus and depth of field as well... I never learned to play this game but i play a mean game of chess.. :) good job!</td>', 'Very nice photo!  Nice focus and depth of field as well... I never learned to play this game but i play a mean game of chess.. :) good job!', '2002-05-21 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63740, 1778, 113, '<td valign="top">I think different lighting would have helped this out a lot.  Then you could call it Black&amp;whitegammon.</td>', 'I think different lighting would have helped this out a lot.  Then you could call it Black&whitegammon.', '2002-05-22 07:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63741, 1778, 824, '<td valign="top">Might have been better in color.</td>', 'Might have been better in color.', '2002-05-22 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63742, 1778, 244, '<td valign="top">Been a long time since played this one, well lit and good focus.  Subject dosen''t do anything for me.</td>', 'Been a long time since played this one, well lit and good focus.  Subject dosen''t do anything for me.', '2002-05-22 23:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63743, 1778, 1597, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to seen this in  color</td>', 'I would have liked to seen this in  color', '2002-05-23 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63744, 1778, 1202, '<td valign="top">Anice clean shot.   It went to B/W well.   Looks to me like you captured most of the grey scale.</td>', 'Anice clean shot.   It went to B/W well.   Looks to me like you captured most of the grey scale.', '2002-05-24 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63745, 1778, 637, '<td valign="top">Great use of black and white.</td>', 'Great use of black and white.', '2002-05-26 01:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63746, 1778, 527, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred color here, but I think the composition is good.</td>', 'I would have preferred color here, but I think the composition is good.', '2002-05-26 02:03:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(63747, 1778, 543, '<td valign="top">An okay choice for B/W, but the composition could be better.</td>', 'An okay choice for B/W, but the composition could be better.', '2002-05-26 03:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63748, 1778, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, though I would prefer a little more symmetry on the lining up of the pieces.</td>', 'Nice shot, though I would prefer a little more symmetry on the lining up of the pieces.', '2002-05-26 09:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63749, 1779, 1379, '<td valign="top">I love this picture!  The expression on your cat''s face is incredible, and it looks like the jenga stack is about to go!</td>', 'I love this picture!  The expression on your cat''s face is incredible, and it looks like the jenga stack is about to go!', '2002-05-20 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63750, 1779, 327, '<td valign="top">Cute, fun shot. Dark, and poor focus.</td>', 'Cute, fun shot. Dark, and poor focus.', '2002-05-20 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63751, 1779, 1446, '<td valign="top">Looks a little out of focus on my monitor, the concept is very cute though.</td>', 'Looks a little out of focus on my monitor, the concept is very cute though.', '2002-05-20 13:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63752, 1779, 885, '<td valign="top">I don''t think she''ll win.  I like how the background is black, I wonder how many times you had to do this.  Is the top of the tower a little bit motion blurred?</td>', 'I don''t think she''ll win.  I like how the background is black, I wonder how many times you had to do this.  Is the top of the tower a little bit motion blurred?', '2002-05-20 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63753, 1779, 862, '<td valign="top">Focus could be better.  It is especially noticeable along the left side of the tower.  It appears that the shutter speed was a bit too slow.  More lighting or perhaps a flash would help avoid this.</td>', 'Focus could be better.  It is especially noticeable along the left side of the tower.  It appears that the shutter speed was a bit too slow.  More lighting or perhaps a flash would help avoid this.', '2002-05-20 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63754, 1779, 724, '<td valign="top">Are those your fingers under the cats chin...that''s cheating.  Great expression on the cats face, just down right confused!</td>', 'Are those your fingers under the cats chin...that''s cheating.  Great expression on the cats face, just down right confused!', '2002-05-20 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63755, 1779, 1750, '<td valign="top">No Fluffy! The Leaning Tower of Pisa doesn''t lean *that* much. Very cute</td>', 'No Fluffy! The Leaning Tower of Pisa doesn''t lean *that* much. Very cute', '2002-05-20 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63756, 1779, 1455, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. Needs to set a faster shutter speed</td>', 'Wonderful. Needs to set a faster shutter speed', '2002-05-21 09:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63757, 1779, 1078, '<td valign="top">Is that cat food, or somebody''s fingers on top of the Jenga tower?  This is very dark -- even a simple "auto-levels" in PS might help.  The focus is also very soft -- perhaps in part to the dark shooting environment.  I think maybe pointing the camera a little further to the left (moving the subject further into the frame) would have been beneficial.</td>', 'Is that cat food, or somebody''s fingers on top of the Jenga tower?  This is very dark -- even a simple "auto-levels" in PS might help.  The focus is also very soft -- perhaps in part to the dark shooting environment.  I think maybe pointing the camera a little further to the left (moving the subject further into the frame) would have been beneficial.', '2002-05-21 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63758, 1779, 301, '<td valign="top">understand that you probably only had one chance at this shot.  Cat has been chopped off, as well as the Jenga tower, and there is a lot of blank space on the right which isn''t needed.  Part of cat seems to blend into the background as well</td>', 'understand that you probably only had one chance at this shot.  Cat has been chopped off, as well as the Jenga tower, and there is a lot of blank space on the right which isn''t needed.  Part of cat seems to blend into the background as well', '2002-05-21 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63759, 1779, 741, '<td valign="top">Cool funny shot - could have done with a bit more light in the foreground</td>', 'Cool funny shot - could have done with a bit more light in the foreground', '2002-05-21 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63760, 1779, 1175, '<td valign="top">If you were in focus and just a little brighter I would have really liked this one.  Great timing on the shot though.  Its really great.</td>', 'If you were in focus and just a little brighter I would have really liked this one.  Great timing on the shot though.  Its really great.', '2002-05-21 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63761, 1779, 1128, '<td valign="top">Great "action" shot!</td>', 'Great "action" shot!', '2002-05-21 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63762, 1779, 616, '<td valign="top">Catzilla!</td>', 'Catzilla!', '2002-05-21 21:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63763, 1779, 1024, '<td valign="top">My daughter got a huge kick out of this photo!</td>', 'My daughter got a huge kick out of this photo!', '2002-05-22 08:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63764, 1779, 714, '<td valign="top">Oh NO,  Hehe.  Cute cat.</td>', 'Oh NO,  Hehe.  Cute cat.', '2002-05-22 18:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63765, 1779, 1597, '<td valign="top">how did you get that pic before it fell? nice shot a bit blurry</td>', 'how did you get that pic before it fell? nice shot a bit blurry', '2002-05-22 20:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63766, 1779, 772, '<td valign="top">Don''t u hate it when this happens?  nice shot!</td>', 'Don''t u hate it when this happens?  nice shot!', '2002-05-22 20:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63767, 1779, 1707, '<td valign="top">I like this game too.  How''d you get the cat to play?  -NBT</td>', 'I like this game too.  How''d you get the cat to play?  -NBT', '2002-05-23 06:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63768, 1779, 1, '<td valign="top">Slightly blurred/out of focus.  Try a faster shutter speed if it is in fact blur.  I would prefer to see it framed to the left more (more cat, less black space).</td>', 'Slightly blurred/out of focus.  Try a faster shutter speed if it is in fact blur.  I would prefer to see it framed to the left more (more cat, less black space).', '2002-05-23 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63769, 1779, 1005, '<td valign="top">Was this a "chance" shot or somewhat of a "set up"?  The cat''s expression is priceless!  Slight grainyness; motion blur +- thing.  Try more light and<br/>presetting your camera to manual, faster exposure.  Photo 8 Creativity 8 Games 8 total 8</td>', 'Was this a "chance" shot or somewhat of a "set up"?  The cat''s expression is priceless!  Slight grainyness; motion blur +- thing.  Try more light andpresetting your camera to manual, faster exposure.  Photo 8 Creativity 8 Games 8 total 8', '2002-05-23 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63770, 1779, 193, '<td valign="top">Okay, what did you put on top to make your cat do this?</td>', 'Okay, what did you put on top to make your cat do this?', '2002-05-23 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63771, 1779, 748, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft, but a cute shot.</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft, but a cute shot.', '2002-05-24 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63772, 1779, 1202, '<td valign="top">Too bad you didn''t have more light and better focus, "cause it would have been terrific.  I like the originality.</td>', 'Too bad you didn''t have more light and better focus, "cause it would have been terrific.  I like the originality.', '2002-05-24 18:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63773, 1779, 1361, '<td valign="top">aaaaaawwwwwwwww!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! HOW CUTE!!!</td>', 'aaaaaawwwwwwwww!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! HOW CUTE!!!', '2002-05-25 17:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63774, 1779, 661, '<td valign="top">An Action Shot!!  Nice clarity.  But I wanna know how the cat managed to get the other bones out?</td>', 'An Action Shot!!  Nice clarity.  But I wanna know how the cat managed to get the other bones out?', '2002-05-26 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63775, 1779, 1041, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments.  This picture was taken Sunday afternoon, and while I knew it wasn''t perfect I thought it was kind of fun anyway.  The score certainly reflects that.  To answer the questions, yes, this was the only shot I had, my cat went off cat treats (which you can see on the top of the tower, those are not my fingers) for the rest of the day.  Yes, the tower did collapse, in fact, I wish I had taken the picture a split-second later, but that didn''t happen.<br/><br/>I read up on working with photos in PhotoImpact after this, and found out just what I needed to do to sharpen and lighten the picture a little.  Since I wasn''t doing that one for the competition, I also included more of the left hand side and just cloned out some of the background which made me crop this way.<br/><br/>Last but not least, Mattias is still blending into the background, but I have to admit that I kind of liked that anyway.<br/><br/><a href="//www.langpage.com/gr8photos/catgames-w.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Improved Photo</a></td>', 'Thank you all for your comments.  This picture was taken Sunday afternoon, and while I knew it wasn''t perfect I thought it was kind of fun anyway.  The score certainly reflects that.  To answer the questions, yes, this was the only shot I had, my cat went off cat treats (which you can see on the top of the tower, those are not my fingers) for the rest of the day.  Yes, the tower did collapse, in fact, I wish I had taken the picture a split-second later, but that didn''t happen.I read up on working with photos in PhotoImpact after this, and found out just what I needed to do to sharpen and lighten the picture a little.  Since I wasn''t doing that one for the competition, I also included more of the left hand side and just cloned out some of the background which made me crop this way.Last but not least, Mattias is still blending into the background, but I have to admit that I kind of liked that anyway.Improved Photo', '2002-05-27 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(63776, 1780, 798, '<td valign="top">I want to name my next child after you. PJ (Pete/Jerry) or Peanut butter &amp; Jelly. :)</td>', 'I want to name my next child after you. PJ (Pete/Jerry) or Peanut butter & Jelly. :)', '2002-05-20 01:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63777, 1780, 1155, '<td valign="top">surrounded by what???  u should have showed the rest of the game board with the other pieces</td>', 'surrounded by what???  u should have showed the rest of the game board with the other pieces', '2002-05-20 08:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63778, 1780, 587, '<td valign="top">Simplicity at its finest. Love the shadow, coloring and clarity - Great photo.</td>', 'Simplicity at its finest. Love the shadow, coloring and clarity - Great photo.', '2002-05-20 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63779, 1780, 885, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s not really surrounded, because there''s nothing to the far side of the center piece.  I really like the idea of framing the one piece with the others, but there''s almost not enough of the shadowy pieces for me.</td>', 'Well, it''s not really surrounded, because there''s nothing to the far side of the center piece.  I really like the idea of framing the one piece with the others, but there''s almost not enough of the shadowy pieces for me.', '2002-05-20 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63780, 1780, 259, '<td valign="top">great idea, but the shaddows are kinda hard to tell that they are other pieces, and the lens flares detract from the overall shot.</td>', 'great idea, but the shaddows are kinda hard to tell that they are other pieces, and the lens flares detract from the overall shot.', '2002-05-20 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63781, 1780, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice job. I''m nit picking - it''s leaning a bit and if not the lines make it look like it is. I think a different colored piece would of been better and scored better. This is nice work.</td>', 'Nice job. I''m nit picking - it''s leaning a bit and if not the lines make it look like it is. I think a different colored piece would of been better and scored better. This is nice work.', '2002-05-20 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63782, 1780, 1750, '<td valign="top">nice framing. Like the various grades of translucency.</td>', 'nice framing. Like the various grades of translucency.', '2002-05-20 19:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63783, 1780, 772, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo!  The only thing *I* would prefer to see is the center piece more ''centered'' between the two out of focus pieces in the foreground.  In this photo, the out of focus pieces in the foreground are effectively used to frame the subject of this photo... good job!</td>', 'I really like this photo!  The only thing *I* would prefer to see is the center piece more ''centered'' between the two out of focus pieces in the foreground.  In this photo, the out of focus pieces in the foreground are effectively used to frame the subject of this photo... good job!', '2002-05-21 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63784, 1780, 1446, '<td valign="top">I really like the soft shadows and framing around this shot.  The glare on the left side seems a little intense to me. A good shot though.  Gave it a 7.</td>', 'I really like the soft shadows and framing around this shot.  The glare on the left side seems a little intense to me. A good shot though.  Gave it a 7.', '2002-05-21 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63785, 1780, 1175, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I like how you used the sort of silhouette of other pieces as your boarder to give a claustrophobic feeling for the king.</td>', 'Great shot.  I like how you used the sort of silhouette of other pieces as your boarder to give a claustrophobic feeling for the king.', '2002-05-21 19:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63786, 1780, 1031, '<td valign="top">I wish the specular highlights were just a bit smaller -- I bet it was better before feeding it to the JPEG machine...</td>', 'I wish the specular highlights were just a bit smaller -- I bet it was better before feeding it to the JPEG machine...', '2002-05-21 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63787, 1780, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a lot, it''s very beautiful. It''s a shame the piece is leaning to the right a bit though.</td>', 'I like this photo a lot, it''s very beautiful. It''s a shame the piece is leaning to the right a bit though.', '2002-05-21 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63788, 1780, 640, '<td valign="top">Nice shadowing effects</td>', 'Nice shadowing effects', '2002-05-22 07:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63789, 1780, 1597, '<td valign="top">neat view and different lighting</td>', 'neat view and different lighting', '2002-05-22 20:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63790, 1780, 244, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, also like the out of focus pieces in the front framing the in focus on in the middle, it looks a little off level to me</td>', 'I like this shot, also like the out of focus pieces in the front framing the in focus on in the middle, it looks a little off level to me', '2002-05-22 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63791, 1780, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, the surrounded piece is captured (no pun intended) quite well, but the surrounding pieces are only blurred shadows on the edge of the picture.  If I had to do the shot, I would try zooming out just a little more so that they are recognizable but still blurred.  You would''ve also got a nice reflection of the surrounded piece.</td>', 'Nice concept, the surrounded piece is captured (no pun intended) quite well, but the surrounding pieces are only blurred shadows on the edge of the picture.  If I had to do the shot, I would try zooming out just a little more so that they are recognizable but still blurred.  You would''ve also got a nice reflection of the surrounded piece.', '2002-05-23 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63792, 1780, 193, '<td valign="top">We can see what you are trying to do; very creative.  But it doesn''t really work out in this photo.  Perhaps if it was brighter so that you could have more of the "surrounding" men focussed?</td>', 'We can see what you are trying to do; very creative.  But it doesn''t really work out in this photo.  Perhaps if it was brighter so that you could have more of the "surrounding" men focussed?', '2002-05-23 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63793, 1780, 280, '<td valign="top">good use of the DOF. Unfortunately the piece doesnt seem quite straight.</td>', 'good use of the DOF. Unfortunately the piece doesnt seem quite straight.', '2002-05-25 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63794, 1780, 637, '<td valign="top">The shadows and the flare detract from this for me.</td>', 'The shadows and the flare detract from this for me.', '2002-05-26 01:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63795, 1780, 1061, '<td valign="top">Good, but surrounded by what?  The title doesn''t fit, so you must acquit!</td>', 'Good, but surrounded by what?  The title doesn''t fit, so you must acquit!', '2002-05-26 04:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63796, 1780, 1, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I like the idea, but the foreground pieces may be a bit too out of focus.</td>', 'Nicely done.  I like the idea, but the foreground pieces may be a bit too out of focus.', '2002-05-26 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63797, 1781, 327, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I like the tone, would only wish for better focus here.</td>', 'Very nice shot. I like the tone, would only wish for better focus here.', '2002-05-20 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63798, 1781, 1, '<td valign="top">The lighting/saturation on the image seems a bit off.  Mostly on the "games" blocks, it''s very off.  I think a straight down apprach, rather than an angle would''ve worked out nicer too.</td>', 'The lighting/saturation on the image seems a bit off.  Mostly on the "games" blocks, it''s very off.  I think a straight down apprach, rather than an angle would''ve worked out nicer too.', '2002-05-20 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63799, 1781, 259, '<td valign="top">whats the point of the blanks in the photo.</td>', 'whats the point of the blanks in the photo.', '2002-05-20 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63800, 1781, 862, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve included photo and site related words.</td>', 'I like how you''ve included photo and site related words.', '2002-05-20 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
