(63891, 1786, 951, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of using CD''s and the red and black squares.  Only fault is the distracting edges.</td>', 'I like the idea of using CD''s and the red and black squares.  Only fault is the distracting edges.', '2002-05-20 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63892, 1786, 1344, '<td valign="top">Pressed vs. Burned!  Should have been a bit neater with the black edges of the paper -- maybe tape em together?  And definitely should have trimmed the black edge on the right...  All that time to cut out the squares and you didn''t trim the right side to make the entire "board" square?  yuck!  Composition/cropping needs some work too.</td>', 'Pressed vs. Burned!  Should have been a bit neater with the black edges of the paper -- maybe tape em together?  And definitely should have trimmed the black edge on the right...  All that time to cut out the squares and you didn''t trim the right side to make the entire "board" square?  yuck!  Composition/cropping needs some work too.', '2002-05-20 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63893, 1786, 1750, '<td valign="top">Good juxtaposition and color. Persona taste: would have cropped out the rug.</td>', 'Good juxtaposition and color. Persona taste: would have cropped out the rug.', '2002-05-20 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63894, 1786, 327, '<td valign="top">Fun idea, creative! Nice job.</td>', 'Fun idea, creative! Nice job.', '2002-05-20 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63895, 1786, 1563, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool Idea.  must have taken some space though<br/></td>', 'Pretty cool Idea.  must have taken some space though', '2002-05-20 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63896, 1786, 1759, '<td valign="top">Creative!</td>', 'Creative!', '2002-05-20 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63897, 1786, 1446, '<td valign="top">A unique take on checkers.....The cropping being tighter to eliminate the carpet might have improved the quality of this photo IMO</td>', 'A unique take on checkers.....The cropping being tighter to eliminate the carpet might have improved the quality of this photo IMO', '2002-05-21 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63898, 1786, 772, '<td valign="top">I like your concept with this photo... I believe that a little extra symmetry overall in this image would be a nice improvement.  Your ''board'' is is also not oriented properly... red or white square is always in the lower right (this doesn''t affect this particular photo).  However, rotating 90 degrees clockwise would allow you to have the larger black side of this board cropped out, which would add some more symmetry along with proper centring in the frame... good job!</td>', 'I like your concept with this photo... I believe that a little extra symmetry overall in this image would be a nice improvement.  Your ''board'' is is also not oriented properly... red or white square is always in the lower right (this doesn''t affect this particular photo).  However, rotating 90 degrees clockwise would allow you to have the larger black side of this board cropped out, which would add some more symmetry along with proper centring in the frame... good job!', '2002-05-21 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63899, 1786, 1031, '<td valign="top">If only your collection would support 3-D CD checkers! Very funny idea.</td>', 'If only your collection would support 3-D CD checkers! Very funny idea.', '2002-05-21 19:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63900, 1786, 1597, '<td valign="top">Creative, and nice contrast</td>', 'Creative, and nice contrast', '2002-05-21 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63901, 1786, 1799, '<td valign="top">Idea is fine - background does not play well with your game colors.</td>', 'Idea is fine - background does not play well with your game colors.', '2002-05-23 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63902, 1786, 1175, '<td valign="top">There is nothing on the image to really excite me.  The subject is pretty flat with no texture except for the rug, which should have been cropped out, so its hard to make it look good.  What might have worked is standing up the CD''s using some sort of base for each and then getting a lower angle.</td>', 'There is nothing on the image to really excite me.  The subject is pretty flat with no texture except for the rug, which should have been cropped out, so its hard to make it look good.  What might have worked is standing up the CD''s using some sort of base for each and then getting a lower angle.', '2002-05-24 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63903, 1786, 428, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped a little tighter to get just the checkerboard in the frame. The carpet around the edges is distracting. Great use for all those old CDs!</td>', 'I would have cropped a little tighter to get just the checkerboard in the frame. The carpet around the edges is distracting. Great use for all those old CDs!', '2002-05-25 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63904, 1786, 280, '<td valign="top">I think you could have cropped this a little tighter to remove the carpet around the edge.</td>', 'I think you could have cropped this a little tighter to remove the carpet around the edge.', '2002-05-26 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63905, 1786, 1005, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  The "rug" is actually driveway cement, the board was 44"x44" (to accommodate the CDs).  My favorite photo editing software (CPIC, shareware) doesn''t output images sized to agree with this site.  It says it''s 640x480, but the site keeps rejecting my shots.  Future submits will be cropped, or I''ll die trying.<br/>The CD tilted in the center was to "add interest" (my aim).</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  The "rug" is actually driveway cement, the board was 44"x44" (to accommodate the CDs).  My favorite photo editing software (CPIC, shareware) doesn''t output images sized to agree with this site.  It says it''s 640x480, but the site keeps rejecting my shots.  Future submits will be cropped, or I''ll die trying.The CD tilted in the center was to "add interest" (my aim).', '2002-05-28 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(63906, 1787, 1175, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  This has character.  I love the rough edges of the bill.  The old style car was a good addition.</td>', 'Great photo.  This has character.  I love the rough edges of the bill.  The old style car was a good addition.', '2002-05-20 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63907, 1787, 327, '<td valign="top">Well done, good work.</td>', 'Well done, good work.', '2002-05-20 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63908, 1787, 1563, '<td valign="top">Nice setup.  Good colors, shows that the game has been played a lot.</td>', 'Nice setup.  Good colors, shows that the game has been played a lot.', '2002-05-20 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63909, 1787, 1750, '<td valign="top">Brittish Monopoly? Interesting nostalgia subject.</td>', 'Brittish Monopoly? Interesting nostalgia subject.', '2002-05-20 19:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63910, 1787, 301, '<td valign="top">nice tight crop, and good DOF</td>', 'nice tight crop, and good DOF', '2002-05-21 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63911, 1787, 1446, '<td valign="top">I really like that your Monopoly Game looks so well loved.  It adds so much texture to this picture.</td>', 'I really like that your Monopoly Game looks so well loved.  It adds so much texture to this picture.', '2002-05-21 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63912, 1787, 1078, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the Monopoly shots.  Took for granted that we didn''t need to see a major portion of the board or anything like that.  (Plus, it''s the Brit version.  Woo hoooo.)  Nice texture captured on the board and money.  I appreciate the tears in the bills that show this set has been well used.  Nice back lighting on the playing piece.  The one thing that doesn''t work for me is the overall color (two much of that blah green color that the board and 500 bills are).  With the way everything looks aged already, what about a duotoned/sepia toned shot that made it look like an old photo?</td>', 'My favorite of the Monopoly shots.  Took for granted that we didn''t need to see a major portion of the board or anything like that.  (Plus, it''s the Brit version.  Woo hoooo.)  Nice texture captured on the board and money.  I appreciate the tears in the bills that show this set has been well used.  Nice back lighting on the playing piece.  The one thing that doesn''t work for me is the overall color (two much of that blah green color that the board and 500 bills are).  With the way everything looks aged already, what about a duotoned/sepia toned shot that made it look like an old photo?', '2002-05-21 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63913, 1787, 772, '<td valign="top">I love this game... excellent photo!</td>', 'I love this game... excellent photo!', '2002-05-21 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63914, 1787, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the "non-U.S." elements...</td>', 'I like the "non-U.S." elements...', '2002-05-22 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63915, 1787, 741, '<td valign="top">Great texture and excellent differential focusing on this one.</td>', 'Great texture and excellent differential focusing on this one.', '2002-05-22 11:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63916, 1787, 714, '<td valign="top">How old is your game?  I perfer the shoe myself.  Nice picture.</td>', 'How old is your game?  I perfer the shoe myself.  Nice picture.', '2002-05-22 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63917, 1787, 1597, '<td valign="top">unfocused in alot of area</td>', 'unfocused in alot of area', '2002-05-22 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63918, 1787, 1707, '<td valign="top">Are you applying the automotive industry is a mobopoly on transpotation?  Good thought out photo -NBT</td>', 'Are you applying the automotive industry is a mobopoly on transpotation?  Good thought out photo -NBT', '2002-05-23 06:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63919, 1787, 1336, '<td valign="top">nice DOF</td>', 'nice DOF', '2002-05-23 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63920, 1787, 1, '<td valign="top">I would prefer to see the focus higher up in the image or more to the right.  I think the DOF is perfect, but that "MONOPOLY" and the board and the car should be in focus, not the 100.</td>', 'I would prefer to see the focus higher up in the image or more to the right.  I think the DOF is perfect, but that "MONOPOLY" and the board and the car should be in focus, not the 100.', '2002-05-23 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63921, 1787, 1195, '<td valign="top">Its a cool picture but its very "big" i don''t know how to describe it. I think maybe you should try to zoom out a little bit show alittle more of the board. Overall its good. Thats just what i think though im an amature at photography, so i have lots to learn.</td>', 'Its a cool picture but its very "big" i don''t know how to describe it. I think maybe you should try to zoom out a little bit show alittle more of the board. Overall its good. Thats just what i think though im an amature at photography, so i have lots to learn.', '2002-05-23 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63922, 1787, 878, '<td valign="top">Good Macro shot</td>', 'Good Macro shot', '2002-05-23 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63923, 1787, 689, '<td valign="top">Nice shot ...</td>', 'Nice shot ...', '2002-05-24 22:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63924, 1787, 661, '<td valign="top">Nice Macro shot.</td>', 'Nice Macro shot.', '2002-05-24 23:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63925, 1787, 1135, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot, in my top 5.</td>', 'Nice macro shot, in my top 5.', '2002-05-25 01:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63926, 1787, 543, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit and composed.  DOF just a little too narrow, IMO, as the bottom of the 100 and the property card are just a bit too soft.  Personal preference.</td>', 'Nicely lit and composed.  DOF just a little too narrow, IMO, as the bottom of the 100 and the property card are just a bit too soft.  Personal preference.', '2002-05-25 03:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63927, 1787, 1128, '<td valign="top">Thought I''d see a lot of these kinds of shots here.  Yours is very clear...I feel like I could reach into my monitor and grab the money.</td>', 'Thought I''d see a lot of these kinds of shots here.  Yours is very clear...I feel like I could reach into my monitor and grab the money.', '2002-05-25 09:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63928, 1787, 441, '<td valign="top">nice quality and composition</td>', 'nice quality and composition', '2002-05-25 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63929, 1788, 1605, '<td valign="top">Aesthetically pleasing colours</td>', 'Aesthetically pleasing colours', '2002-05-20 02:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63930, 1788, 113, '<td valign="top">Did a good job of setting up, but honestly, its kind of boring.</td>', 'Did a good job of setting up, but honestly, its kind of boring.', '2002-05-20 03:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63931, 1788, 1379, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  The photograher must be very skilled to get such great results!</td>', 'I love this photo.  The photograher must be very skilled to get such great results!', '2002-05-20 09:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63932, 1788, 327, '<td valign="top">Fun idea. Creative, great color.</td>', 'Fun idea. Creative, great color.', '2002-05-20 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63933, 1788, 1549, '<td valign="top">Creative and colorful!</td>', 'Creative and colorful!', '2002-05-20 18:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63934, 1788, 301, '<td valign="top">nice idea.  Not sure whether you ran out of stones ... there are 2 black ones missing from the horizontal line of the tic-tac-toe board, and there seems to be some bare patches around the edges of the photo.  Apart from that, the photo is ok, but it doesn''t really hold me for that long</td>', 'nice idea.  Not sure whether you ran out of stones ... there are 2 black ones missing from the horizontal line of the tic-tac-toe board, and there seems to be some bare patches around the edges of the photo.  Apart from that, the photo is ok, but it doesn''t really hold me for that long', '2002-05-21 08:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63935, 1788, 1446, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea....nice color.....A little too symmetrical for my taste.</td>', 'Interesting idea....nice color.....A little too symmetrical for my taste.', '2002-05-21 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63936, 1788, 772, '<td valign="top">I like this one!  Good job... the colors are great :)</td>', 'I like this one!  Good job... the colors are great :)', '2002-05-22 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63937, 1788, 714, '<td valign="top">very original</td>', 'very original', '2002-05-22 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63938, 1788, 1597, '<td valign="top">creative and nice contrast of colors</td>', 'creative and nice contrast of colors', '2002-05-22 20:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63939, 1788, 674, '<td valign="top">A nice sharp eye catching photo</td>', 'A nice sharp eye catching photo', '2002-05-23 05:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63940, 1788, 1707, '<td valign="top">Oh, how beautiful!  I love how you corresponded the red, white and blue!  -NBT</td>', 'Oh, how beautiful!  I love how you corresponded the red, white and blue!  -NBT', '2002-05-23 06:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63941, 1788, 748, '<td valign="top">Very clever and nicely done.  I would have extended the rocks past the edges of the frame for a more consistent background.</td>', 'Very clever and nicely done.  I would have extended the rocks past the edges of the frame for a more consistent background.', '2002-05-24 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63942, 1788, 1041, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know tictactoe was that relaxing! ;o)  Nice idea, nice execution.  This is nit-picky, but I think the shot would be nicer if the white gravel extended beyond the edges of the photo, and the white background didn''t poke through.</td>', 'I didn''t know tictactoe was that relaxing! ;o)  Nice idea, nice execution.  This is nit-picky, but I think the shot would be nicer if the white gravel extended beyond the edges of the photo, and the white background didn''t poke through.', '2002-05-24 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63943, 1788, 1202, '<td valign="top">Vivid picture.   Nice idea.</td>', 'Vivid picture.   Nice idea.', '2002-05-24 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63944, 1788, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, I especially like the colors and the textures.  Is there a reason why there are more stones above the center square than below it?  It''s nothing major, but considering the symmetry...</td>', 'Nice composition, I especially like the colors and the textures.  Is there a reason why there are more stones above the center square than below it?  It''s nothing major, but considering the symmetry...', '2002-05-26 07:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63945, 1788, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice rich colors, how''d you blur the whole left side?  I think you needed more rocks on the botom right too.</td>', 'Nice rich colors, how''d you blur the whole left side?  I think you needed more rocks on the botom right too.', '2002-05-26 09:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63946, 1788, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice color contrasts.  In the thumbnail, I thought it was on carpet, and couldn''t figure out where you got the zen part.  Duh, I feel stupid now.</td>', 'Nice color contrasts.  In the thumbnail, I thought it was on carpet, and couldn''t figure out where you got the zen part.  Duh, I feel stupid now.', '2002-05-27 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(63947, 1788, 47, '<td valign="top">i tend to appreciate your good shit, but i just realized that a zen rock garden is actually sand with single stones in it, usually. still, i liked the creative twist on the idea. is there some other form of zen rock garden that im unaware of ?</td>', 'i tend to appreciate your good shit, but i just realized that a zen rock garden is actually sand with single stones in it, usually. still, i liked the creative twist on the idea. is there some other form of zen rock garden that im unaware of ?', '2002-05-27 09:04:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(63948, 1788, 472, '<td valign="top">nah. its just a big fiction : )</td>', 'nah. its just a big fiction : )', '2002-05-28 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(63949, 1789, 1647, '<td valign="top">Good focus.  Shame about the reflection on the chess set - looks like a window.</td>', 'Good focus.  Shame about the reflection on the chess set - looks like a window.', '2002-05-20 01:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63950, 1789, 1336, '<td valign="top">too much going on in the background - window, drapes, carpet, chair, leg of the table... also, there''s a glare on the chessboard</td>', 'too much going on in the background - window, drapes, carpet, chair, leg of the table... also, there''s a glare on the chessboard', '2002-05-20 07:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63951, 1789, 327, '<td valign="top">looks like a fun rainy day.</td>', 'looks like a fun rainy day.', '2002-05-20 12:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63952, 1789, 259, '<td valign="top">not one of my favorites</td>', 'not one of my favorites', '2002-05-20 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63953, 1789, 587, '<td valign="top">Too far away, can''t see details of games. good color and lighting</td>', 'Too far away, can''t see details of games. good color and lighting', '2002-05-20 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63954, 1789, 54, '<td valign="top">The background (curtains, chair, etc.) distracts the viewer from the games. Perhaps focusing in closer, or maybe just choosing one of the games as focus.</td>', 'The background (curtains, chair, etc.) distracts the viewer from the games. Perhaps focusing in closer, or maybe just choosing one of the games as focus.', '2002-05-20 15:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63955, 1789, 1712, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how to play Mancala, can you teach me?</td>', 'I don''t know how to play Mancala, can you teach me?', '2002-05-20 18:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63956, 1789, 1563, '<td valign="top">Feel like this picture needs some spunk to it.</td>', 'Feel like this picture needs some spunk to it.', '2002-05-20 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63957, 1789, 1078, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of extra elements outside what you want us to be looking at.  the chair in the upper right corner, another game on the floor over by the Wizard of Oz, the window and curtains.  I''d suggest moving the table over closer to the wall and shooting with a nice plain background.  You''ve got a little bit of a glare on the chess board -- it''s not too bad, but it could probably be fixed so it''s not quite so strong.</td>', 'There are a lot of extra elements outside what you want us to be looking at.  the chair in the upper right corner, another game on the floor over by the Wizard of Oz, the window and curtains.  I''d suggest moving the table over closer to the wall and shooting with a nice plain background.  You''ve got a little bit of a glare on the chess board -- it''s not too bad, but it could probably be fixed so it''s not quite so strong.', '2002-05-21 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63958, 1789, 1446, '<td valign="top">You sure took the challenge litterally.....Games....<br/><br/>The lighting seems pretty harsh on the checker board.</td>', 'You sure took the challenge litterally.....Games....The lighting seems pretty harsh on the checker board.', '2002-05-21 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63959, 1789, 1175, '<td valign="top">I think you would have been better off picking one and taking pictures of it.  Your field of view for this is too broad, what''s with the chair in the background, the wall outlet, the window curtains.  All of these things detract from your subject.  Next time choose one and really get in there and show off what the games are.</td>', 'I think you would have been better off picking one and taking pictures of it.  Your field of view for this is too broad, what''s with the chair in the background, the wall outlet, the window curtains.  All of these things detract from your subject.  Next time choose one and really get in there and show off what the games are.', '2002-05-21 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63960, 1789, 244, '<td valign="top">You got some interesting games there.  I would have like it better if you would have gotten closer and only got the games in the frame the chair, walls, floor, and curtains really pull away from what the main focus should be.</td>', 'You got some interesting games there.  I would have like it better if you would have gotten closer and only got the games in the frame the chair, walls, floor, and curtains really pull away from what the main focus should be.', '2002-05-21 23:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63961, 1789, 640, '<td valign="top">the reflection on the chess game is distracting</td>', 'the reflection on the chess game is distracting', '2002-05-22 07:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63962, 1789, 878, '<td valign="top">Although this shot completely meets the challenge criteria the shot itself is not an impact photo.  I would of loved to seen a closer shot of the Wizard of Oz board.  That would of provided some interesting colors for the photo.</td>', 'Although this shot completely meets the challenge criteria the shot itself is not an impact photo.  I would of loved to seen a closer shot of the Wizard of Oz board.  That would of provided some interesting colors for the photo.', '2002-05-22 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63963, 1789, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice display of games... The flash on this photo really hit the checkerboard pretty hard... This is an instance where some diffusion of the flash will help... you can hold a kleenex or some other thin paper like toilet paper over the flash to help reduce this effect... good job!</td>', 'Nice display of games... The flash on this photo really hit the checkerboard pretty hard... This is an instance where some diffusion of the flash will help... you can hold a kleenex or some other thin paper like toilet paper over the flash to help reduce this effect... good job!', '2002-05-22 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63964, 1789, 1005, '<td valign="top">Glare on the chess board hurt your score.  I''ve never seen the Wizard of Oz game!  Mancala is known by MANY names and is the oldest game I <br/>know of.  (older than rock,paper, scissors by a LONG shot!)  Photo 9 Creativity 7 Games 2.666 each game(8)   total 8</td>', 'Glare on the chess board hurt your score.  I''ve never seen the Wizard of Oz game!  Mancala is known by MANY names and is the oldest game I know of.  (older than rock,paper, scissors by a LONG shot!)  Photo 9 Creativity 7 Games 2.666 each game(8)   total 8', '2002-05-22 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63965, 1789, 1597, '<td valign="top">clean shot</td>', 'clean shot', '2002-05-22 20:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63966, 1789, 1793, '<td valign="top">simpler background and less harsh lighting would have helped out this photo. :)</td>', 'simpler background and less harsh lighting would have helped out this photo. :)', '2002-05-23 22:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63967, 1789, 1814, '<td valign="top">Nice color but too contrived for my taste</td>', 'Nice color but too contrived for my taste', '2002-05-24 07:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63968, 1789, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like Mancala, too!  This is a pretty decent shot, everything is in focus.  Good job!  Something that I would consider doing differently next time is move the games still closer together (you could even have some of them overlap) and then zoom in closer to remove some of the background.  Or, move the table against the white wall that is visible in the back of the picture and then take the shot there so that the chair and the curtains don''t distract you from the games you are supposed to look at.</td>', 'I like Mancala, too!  This is a pretty decent shot, everything is in focus.  Good job!  Something that I would consider doing differently next time is move the games still closer together (you could even have some of them overlap) and then zoom in closer to remove some of the background.  Or, move the table against the white wall that is visible in the back of the picture and then take the shot there so that the chair and the curtains don''t distract you from the games you are supposed to look at.', '2002-05-24 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63969, 1789, 543, '<td valign="top">That''s a bunch of games, alright.  The colors are nice, but I''d have tried for another setting.</td>', 'That''s a bunch of games, alright.  The colors are nice, but I''d have tried for another setting.', '2002-05-26 02:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63970, 1789, 1, '<td valign="top">Seems snapshotted, though I know you took time to set up the games.  Looks almost like an ebay -- not much thought went into it.  I could be very wrong though.  It just lacks a lot.</td>', 'Seems snapshotted, though I know you took time to set up the games.  Looks almost like an ebay -- not much thought went into it.  I could be very wrong though.  It just lacks a lot.', '2002-05-27 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63971, 1790, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice blues and reds -- they really stand out.  I wouldn''t have chosen to crop the right side of the see-saws.</td>', 'Nice blues and reds -- they really stand out.  I wouldn''t have chosen to crop the right side of the see-saws.', '2002-05-20 08:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(63972, 1790, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, mood and color. I think the composition could of been better....my eye goes right to the rail/fence with a large empty space inbetween.</td>', 'Nice idea, mood and color. I think the composition could of been better....my eye goes right to the rail/fence with a large empty space inbetween.', '2002-05-20 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
