(64035, 1793, 1647, '<td valign="top">Very challenging framing and composition you have chosen.  It makes me want to tilt my head to make the court level again.  The focus is great and the perspective of the net is great.  You have made a very interesting photo out of a pretty boring subject matter - well done.</td>', 'Very challenging framing and composition you have chosen.  It makes me want to tilt my head to make the court level again.  The focus is great and the perspective of the net is great.  You have made a very interesting photo out of a pretty boring subject matter - well done.', '2002-05-23 20:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
