(64108, 1798, 1569, '<td valign="top">Focus.</td>', 'Focus.', '2002-05-20 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64109, 1798, 301, '<td valign="top">the drop cloth behind is quite obvious.  I feel that the main problem with this photo tho is the fact that there is a large space between the two points of interest.  This is emphasized by the line of the checkerboard.  I think if you''d moved the front bear closer to the other two, you would have a more striking image, and perhaps have gotten a bit more detail from the bear at the back (it seems almost like a silhouette at the moment).  Minor point, assuming that this is supposed to be a version of draughts/checkers, shouldn''t the ''pieces'' be on the same coloured squares?</td>', 'the drop cloth behind is quite obvious.  I feel that the main problem with this photo tho is the fact that there is a large space between the two points of interest.  This is emphasized by the line of the checkerboard.  I think if you''d moved the front bear closer to the other two, you would have a more striking image, and perhaps have gotten a bit more detail from the bear at the back (it seems almost like a silhouette at the moment).  Minor point, assuming that this is supposed to be a version of draughts/checkers, shouldn''t the ''pieces'' be on the same coloured squares?', '2002-05-21 05:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
