(64133, 1799, 1446, '<td valign="top">Good focus, Lighting is interesting, even though the subject isn''t to me anyway.</td>', 'Good focus, Lighting is interesting, even though the subject isn''t to me anyway.', '2002-05-21 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64134, 1799, 1175, '<td valign="top">Too much flash.</td>', 'Too much flash.', '2002-05-21 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64135, 1799, 1078, '<td valign="top">This seems somewhat silly to me because at least one of the participants is a married man.  But who am I to judge what games people can and can''t play at what age.  :-)  I think it would have been a little more fun if kids were playing.  It''s an interesting set up though.  I wish you could see a different angle of the "ball" but then you wouldn''t have been able to get the great first person point of view.  foreground hands were a little too cose to the flash and so washed out and all three shadows take away, in my opinion, from the finished image.  Hard shot to get without a flash though, so other than a different flash location I don''t know what to suggest.</td>', 'This seems somewhat silly to me because at least one of the participants is a married man.  But who am I to judge what games people can and can''t play at what age.  :-)  I think it would have been a little more fun if kids were playing.  It''s an interesting set up though.  I wish you could see a different angle of the "ball" but then you wouldn''t have been able to get the great first person point of view.  foreground hands were a little too cose to the flash and so washed out and all three shadows take away, in my opinion, from the finished image.  Hard shot to get without a flash though, so other than a different flash location I don''t know what to suggest.', '2002-05-21 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64136, 1799, 1009, '<td valign="top">Good idea... nice (score)</td>', 'Good idea... nice (score)', '2002-05-21 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64137, 1799, 244, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea behind this shot, reminds me of grade school and junior high. Would have liked the picture better without the shadows from the "goal" in the foreground which could have been prevented or at least minimized with more light, and also if the people playing were more of age to be playing looking at the kickers hands he is probley a little old to be playing this on a regular basis.  One question why do this shot in B+W?</td>', 'I really like the idea behind this shot, reminds me of grade school and junior high. Would have liked the picture better without the shadows from the "goal" in the foreground which could have been prevented or at least minimized with more light, and also if the people playing were more of age to be playing looking at the kickers hands he is probley a little old to be playing this on a regular basis.  One question why do this shot in B+W?', '2002-05-21 23:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64138, 1799, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot, hands being one of my favourite things. With better lighting it could have been a lot better, rather than just using the flash.</td>', 'Very interesting shot, hands being one of my favourite things. With better lighting it could have been a lot better, rather than just using the flash.', '2002-05-22 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64139, 1799, 1528, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.<br/>Nice lighting.</td>', 'Cool idea.Nice lighting.', '2002-05-22 04:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64140, 1799, 301, '<td valign="top">great composition and framing, and good effort stopping the pen mid flight. The harsh flash really hurts this entry</td>', 'great composition and framing, and good effort stopping the pen mid flight. The harsh flash really hurts this entry', '2002-05-22 07:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64141, 1799, 1054, '<td valign="top">This takes me right back to junior high school.  Brilliant!</td>', 'This takes me right back to junior high school.  Brilliant!', '2002-05-22 10:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64142, 1799, 1, '<td valign="top">Looks like a flash was used.  For action shots with depth, you need more lighting than a flash.  In your shot, the kicker''s hands are darker than the goal posts, since the flash was not able to fill the frame in time.</td>', 'Looks like a flash was used.  For action shots with depth, you need more lighting than a flash.  In your shot, the kicker''s hands are darker than the goal posts, since the flash was not able to fill the frame in time.', '2002-05-22 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64143, 1799, 772, '<td valign="top">I think i have played this game before... :)  the lighting on the fingers is accentint the fact that they are out of focus...</td>', 'I think i have played this game before... :)  the lighting on the fingers is accentint the fact that they are out of focus...', '2002-05-22 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64144, 1799, 878, '<td valign="top">Owch right in the eye.  Cool shot angle to the shot.  Its a bit dark in the background vs the birght foreground.</td>', 'Owch right in the eye.  Cool shot angle to the shot.  Its a bit dark in the background vs the birght foreground.', '2002-05-22 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64145, 1799, 1005, '<td valign="top">Funny!  Who won?  Flash kinda washed out the goal posts, plus focus is on the kicker''s hands.  (I know this was a hard shot to get, so better score)<br/>Photo 8 Creativity 8 Games 8 total 8</td>', 'Funny!  Who won?  Flash kinda washed out the goal posts, plus focus is on the kicker''s hands.  (I know this was a hard shot to get, so better score)Photo 8 Creativity 8 Games 8 total 8', '2002-05-22 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64146, 1799, 1042, '<td valign="top">good representation of the challenge. I would have rather seen the fingers in front focused and the hands in the background not as focused. Also it''s a little too bright in the forground. But the stop action is great and I like the idea.</td>', 'good representation of the challenge. I would have rather seen the fingers in front focused and the hands in the background not as focused. Also it''s a little too bright in the forground. But the stop action is great and I like the idea.', '2002-05-23 21:09:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(64147, 1799, 1597, '<td valign="top">classic game great creativity but it dosen''t really grab my attention</td>', 'classic game great creativity but it dosen''t really grab my attention', '2002-05-23 22:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64148, 1799, 661, '<td valign="top">A game and appealing.  I use to get myself in trouble with this game.</td>', 'A game and appealing.  I use to get myself in trouble with this game.', '2002-05-24 23:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64149, 1799, 543, '<td valign="top">It''s good!  Oof foreground kind of works here.  On-camera flash is double plus ungood, but you work with what you''ve got.  Cam taped to forehead?</td>', 'It''s good!  Oof foreground kind of works here.  On-camera flash is double plus ungood, but you work with what you''ve got.  Cam taped to forehead?', '2002-05-25 04:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64150, 1799, 527, '<td valign="top">The lighting needs to be controlled better. The foreground hands are too bright.</td>', 'The lighting needs to be controlled better. The foreground hands are too bright.', '2002-05-26 03:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64151, 1800, 113, '<td valign="top">It looks like they are suspended in air, nice job.</td>', 'It looks like they are suspended in air, nice job.', '2002-05-20 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64152, 1800, 92, '<td valign="top">Beautiful ! A 10 !!!</td>', 'Beautiful ! A 10 !!!', '2002-05-20 07:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64153, 1800, 1379, '<td valign="top">These jacks look deluxe!!  The shine on them is just brilliant!</td>', 'These jacks look deluxe!!  The shine on them is just brilliant!', '2002-05-20 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64154, 1800, 327, '<td valign="top">Lighting could of been improved a wee bit. This is creative, fun and done well.</td>', 'Lighting could of been improved a wee bit. This is creative, fun and done well.', '2002-05-20 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64155, 1800, 885, '<td valign="top">I think it may have been helpful if one or more of the jacks were pushed off the frame, to give it less of a staged look.</td>', 'I think it may have been helpful if one or more of the jacks were pushed off the frame, to give it less of a staged look.', '2002-05-20 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64156, 1800, 259, '<td valign="top">nice job, chrome is hard to shoot well with a digital.</td>', 'nice job, chrome is hard to shoot well with a digital.', '2002-05-20 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64157, 1800, 1750, '<td valign="top">Love this one. Color, composition, separation from background, shadowing  all excellent. Personal taste:Commercial quality picture.</td>', 'Love this one. Color, composition, separation from background, shadowing  all excellent. Personal taste:Commercial quality picture.', '2002-05-20 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64158, 1800, 1446, '<td valign="top">I tried this shot.....mine was horrible, glad I didn''t submit it.  Very well done, the mirror was a stroke of genius.</td>', 'I tried this shot.....mine was horrible, glad I didn''t submit it.  Very well done, the mirror was a stroke of genius.', '2002-05-20 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64159, 1800, 1712, '<td valign="top">I can see you tacking the picture. It looks like you just bought them.</td>', 'I can see you tacking the picture. It looks like you just bought them.', '2002-05-20 19:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64160, 1800, 1143, '<td valign="top">I wanted to try this shot - only catch them falling and show the movement.</td>', 'I wanted to try this shot - only catch them falling and show the movement.', '2002-05-21 00:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64161, 1800, 326, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a mirror...Good job.</td>', 'Nice use of a mirror...Good job.', '2002-05-21 10:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64162, 1800, 1078, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea here.  I''d guess you did, but I would play around with the composition a bit more -- something doesn''t feel quite right to me.  Aside from the issue of composition, which is a very subjective issue, the colors here don''t seem quite right.  Maybe a little too blue?  And a little too dark on the ball?  The brightness issue is a difficult one though cause that might blow out the jacks.</td>', 'I really like the idea here.  I''d guess you did, but I would play around with the composition a bit more -- something doesn''t feel quite right to me.  Aside from the issue of composition, which is a very subjective issue, the colors here don''t seem quite right.  Maybe a little too blue?  And a little too dark on the ball?  The brightness issue is a difficult one though cause that might blow out the jacks.', '2002-05-21 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64163, 1800, 772, '<td valign="top">i like this photo.. i like it alot :)</td>', 'i like this photo.. i like it alot :)', '2002-05-21 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64164, 1800, 1024, '<td valign="top">Sharp focus, bright colors.  Very nice.</td>', 'Sharp focus, bright colors.  Very nice.', '2002-05-21 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64165, 1800, 1037, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of the reflective surface. It makes these objects into something very interesting and abstract.</td>', 'Excellent use of the reflective surface. It makes these objects into something very interesting and abstract.', '2002-05-21 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64166, 1800, 1054, '<td valign="top">A beautiful shot.  The mirror adds a nice touch.</td>', 'A beautiful shot.  The mirror adds a nice touch.', '2002-05-22 08:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64167, 1800, 714, '<td valign="top">this is a cool photo. i love the colors</td>', 'this is a cool photo. i love the colors', '2002-05-22 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64168, 1800, 878, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, like the color of the ball and the black reflective surface.</td>', 'Nice shot, like the color of the ball and the black reflective surface.', '2002-05-22 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64169, 1800, 842, '<td valign="top">I tried doing something similar to this, but I couldn''t get a good image. I wish I would have thought of the mirror. I really like this.. I think it is the purple and silver combination that does it.</td>', 'I tried doing something similar to this, but I couldn''t get a good image. I wish I would have thought of the mirror. I really like this.. I think it is the purple and silver combination that does it.', '2002-05-22 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64170, 1800, 1707, '<td valign="top">Nicely centered and isolating the objects.  -NBT</td>', 'Nicely centered and isolating the objects.  -NBT', '2002-05-23 06:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64171, 1800, 1041, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  This a reflection?  Must be.  Had to look at it for a while to figure it out - well done.  The only nitpicky comments I have is some "reflection blur", but since I haven''t done one of those shots myself yet I don''t know if (a) it is avoidable and (b) what you would differently.  Other than that, the picture is just a tad too busy for me, but I like that this is one of the pictures where I''m not commenting on the background distractions!</td>', 'Interesting composition.  This a reflection?  Must be.  Had to look at it for a while to figure it out - well done.  The only nitpicky comments I have is some "reflection blur", but since I haven''t done one of those shots myself yet I don''t know if (a) it is avoidable and (b) what you would differently.  Other than that, the picture is just a tad too busy for me, but I like that this is one of the pictures where I''m not commenting on the background distractions!', '2002-05-23 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64172, 1800, 1799, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  No flash reflection - cool.</td>', 'Beautiful!  No flash reflection - cool.', '2002-05-23 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64173, 1800, 1597, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast</td>', 'Nice contrast', '2002-05-23 22:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64174, 1800, 1814, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2002-05-24 07:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64175, 1800, 1202, '<td valign="top">Thiis shot has a lot of snap and originality.</td>', 'Thiis shot has a lot of snap and originality.', '2002-05-24 19:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64176, 1800, 661, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity on the jacks.</td>', 'Nice clarity on the jacks.', '2002-05-24 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64177, 1800, 1066, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the metal jacks and the mirror effect.<br/><br/>Good clean shot give this simple compostion an art feel.</td>', 'Nice use of the metal jacks and the mirror effect.Good clean shot give this simple compostion an art feel.', '2002-05-25 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64178, 1800, 1031, '<td valign="top">Whew -- there''s probably 40 teeny self-portraits hidden in those reflections.</td>', 'Whew -- there''s probably 40 teeny self-portraits hidden in those reflections.', '2002-05-26 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64179, 1800, 527, '<td valign="top">This is really good. I''m just wondering what it would look like if, instead of using a mirror, you used other surface that wasn''t as reflective and maybe colored. It''s just a thought, I''m not sure of it.</td>', 'This is really good. I''m just wondering what it would look like if, instead of using a mirror, you used other surface that wasn''t as reflective and maybe colored. It''s just a thought, I''m not sure of it.', '2002-05-26 01:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64180, 1800, 543, '<td valign="top">Chrome is tough going, eh?  Better control of the reflections would be, well, better.  Shooting on a mirror gives a nice anti-gravity feel.  A bit static.  Maybe a bouncing ball would have given it more interest.</td>', 'Chrome is tough going, eh?  Better control of the reflections would be, well, better.  Shooting on a mirror gives a nice anti-gravity feel.  A bit static.  Maybe a bouncing ball would have given it more interest.', '2002-05-26 03:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64181, 1800, 1, '<td valign="top">The mirror gives a cluttered effect that I''m not so sure works.  A different angle could''ve cleaned it up, or removing the mirror.</td>', 'The mirror gives a cluttered effect that I''m not so sure works.  A different angle could''ve cleaned it up, or removing the mirror.', '2002-05-26 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64182, 1800, 472, '<td valign="top">this is cool. you done good : )</td>', 'this is cool. you done good : )', '2002-05-27 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64183, 1800, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like the way you have used the reflections.</td>', 'Nice.  I like the way you have used the reflections.', '2002-05-27 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64184, 1800, 773, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the votes and comments.  I am a beginning photographer, and this is very encouraging to me.  I will keep the suggestions in mind and try to reshoot this one at a later time.<br/><br/>Kim</td>', 'Thank you for all the votes and comments.  I am a beginning photographer, and this is very encouraging to me.  I will keep the suggestions in mind and try to reshoot this one at a later time.Kim', '2002-05-27 01:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(64185, 1801, 714, '<td valign="top">The colors are cool, but the lighting is a little off. Reminds me of chocolate.</td>', 'The colors are cool, but the lighting is a little off. Reminds me of chocolate.', '2002-05-20 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64186, 1801, 327, '<td valign="top">Great idea, all my favorites. Your light let you down here.</td>', 'Great idea, all my favorites. Your light let you down here.', '2002-05-20 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64187, 1801, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting concpet for a photograph in the games challenge, but I don''t like the way the background removes the contrast from this image.  Everything in the photo has a rather brown tint to it.  I''m not sure if this photo was converted to be this way, but I think some contrast would greatly improve this....</td>', 'This is an interesting concpet for a photograph in the games challenge, but I don''t like the way the background removes the contrast from this image.  Everything in the photo has a rather brown tint to it.  I''m not sure if this photo was converted to be this way, but I think some contrast would greatly improve this....', '2002-05-20 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64188, 1801, 1446, '<td valign="top">The choice of background color seems to blur with the balls on my monitor.</td>', 'The choice of background color seems to blur with the balls on my monitor.', '2002-05-20 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64189, 1801, 933, '<td valign="top">A little too dark.</td>', 'A little too dark.', '2002-05-20 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64190, 1801, 1569, '<td valign="top">That color is too wierd.</td>', 'That color is too wierd.', '2002-05-20 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64191, 1801, 1143, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the color of the picture. Perhaps a different background?</td>', 'I don''t like the color of the picture. Perhaps a different background?', '2002-05-21 00:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64192, 1801, 301, '<td valign="top">don''t know where you found these, but they rule :)  I would have selected a different background.  The basketball and football are too similar in colour</td>', 'don''t know where you found these, but they rule :)  I would have selected a different background.  The basketball and football are too similar in colour', '2002-05-21 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64193, 1801, 1175, '<td valign="top">This picture would have been better with more focus and perhaps a different background.  The color of hte background seems to blend in with the football.</td>', 'This picture would have been better with more focus and perhaps a different background.  The color of hte background seems to blend in with the football.', '2002-05-21 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64194, 1801, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice subject for the challenge.  One thing that IMO would''ve worked a little better is a different color background that gives you more contrast compared to the bottom two golf balls.  How would placing these on the lawn have worked?  That would''ve also given you natural light, and maybe reduced the light reflections a little.  Just a thought.</td>', 'Nice subject for the challenge.  One thing that IMO would''ve worked a little better is a different color background that gives you more contrast compared to the bottom two golf balls.  How would placing these on the lawn have worked?  That would''ve also given you natural light, and maybe reduced the light reflections a little.  Just a thought.', '2002-05-21 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64195, 1801, 1054, '<td valign="top">Cute idea!  I think a more contrasting background would have helped this image some.</td>', 'Cute idea!  I think a more contrasting background would have helped this image some.', '2002-05-22 08:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64196, 1801, 741, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit underexposed.</td>', 'Looks a bit underexposed.', '2002-05-22 11:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64197, 1801, 1005, '<td valign="top">feels like chocolate</td>', 'feels like chocolate', '2002-05-23 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64198, 1801, 878, '<td valign="top">What happened to the colors with this?  I like the concept of the shot, the photo itself is a bit off. <br/></td>', 'What happened to the colors with this?  I like the concept of the shot, the photo itself is a bit off. ', '2002-05-23 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64199, 1801, 1042, '<td valign="top">Cute golf balls, I like this set up. good job</td>', 'Cute golf balls, I like this set up. good job', '2002-05-23 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64200, 1801, 1597, '<td valign="top">cute idea but to much dark spots for me but great effort.</td>', 'cute idea but to much dark spots for me but great effort.', '2002-05-23 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64201, 1801, 661, '<td valign="top">Interesting coloring.  I think I would have liked it better with regular color (or maybe it''s my monitor?)</td>', 'Interesting coloring.  I think I would have liked it better with regular color (or maybe it''s my monitor?)', '2002-05-24 23:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64202, 1801, 1135, '<td valign="top">Why no color?</td>', 'Why no color?', '2002-05-25 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64203, 1801, 428, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see this in the regular colors. I think I would have turned the "foootball" just a bit to see more of the laces.</td>', 'I would have liked to see this in the regular colors. I think I would have turned the "foootball" just a bit to see more of the laces.', '2002-05-25 20:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64204, 1801, 509, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure sepia works that well for this shot.  There isn''t enough contrast in my opinion.  Good concept though</td>', 'I''m not sure sepia works that well for this shot.  There isn''t enough contrast in my opinion.  Good concept though', '2002-05-25 22:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64205, 1801, 543, '<td valign="top">With so much brown in the image, I''d have chosen a lighter colored bg for contrast.  Very soft.</td>', 'With so much brown in the image, I''d have chosen a lighter colored bg for contrast.  Very soft.', '2002-05-26 02:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64206, 1801, 1, '<td valign="top">Brown cast isn''t very appealing.  I think a different setting for the golf balls, might''ve worked out better.</td>', 'Brown cast isn''t very appealing.  I think a different setting for the golf balls, might''ve worked out better.', '2002-05-26 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64207, 1803, 1379, '<td valign="top">Creative anachronisms!</td>', 'Creative anachronisms!', '2002-05-20 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64208, 1803, 327, '<td valign="top">Wow, great to be there during this. Fun action shot.</td>', 'Wow, great to be there during this. Fun action shot.', '2002-05-20 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64209, 1803, 1446, '<td valign="top">This would have been a winner if there was not so much grey sky in the background.  What a great concept!  Excellent focus...</td>', 'This would have been a winner if there was not so much grey sky in the background.  What a great concept!  Excellent focus...', '2002-05-20 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64210, 1803, 203, '<td valign="top">SCA?</td>', 'SCA?', '2002-05-20 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64211, 1803, 737, '<td valign="top">Looks like an exhibition, not a game.</td>', 'Looks like an exhibition, not a game.', '2002-05-20 19:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64212, 1803, 301, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if I would have cropped the bum of the first knight and elbow of the second.  Understand that the swords were moving, but it would have been nices if they were sharp.  Less DOF would have helped in trying to reduce the distracting background.</td>', 'Don''t know if I would have cropped the bum of the first knight and elbow of the second.  Understand that the swords were moving, but it would have been nices if they were sharp.  Less DOF would have helped in trying to reduce the distracting background.', '2002-05-21 07:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64213, 1803, 1647, '<td valign="top">Good framing but a little dark...  Perhaps you could have moved so that the sun was more behind you.</td>', 'Good framing but a little dark...  Perhaps you could have moved so that the sun was more behind you.', '2002-05-21 20:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64214, 1803, 1031, '<td valign="top">Is this an SCA event or a different group?<br/>BTW: Do you know why they''re not using shields in this combat?</td>', 'Is this an SCA event or a different group?BTW: Do you know why they''re not using shields in this combat?', '2002-05-22 01:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64215, 1803, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a nice concept.  I think I would have tried a lower angle to obscure some of the busy background.  Its rather distracting from your subject.</td>', 'This is a nice concept.  I think I would have tried a lower angle to obscure some of the busy background.  Its rather distracting from your subject.', '2002-05-22 03:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64216, 1803, 640, '<td valign="top">those were the days</td>', 'those were the days', '2002-05-22 07:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64217, 1803, 671, '<td valign="top">Cool picture!  I like the way you cropped it in close to minimize the distraction of the background.  Was this the SCA fight for regional championship?</td>', 'Cool picture!  I like the way you cropped it in close to minimize the distraction of the background.  Was this the SCA fight for regional championship?', '2002-05-22 09:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64218, 1803, 878, '<td valign="top">Looks like it woud be more fun than my 9-5.</td>', 'Looks like it woud be more fun than my 9-5.', '2002-05-22 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64219, 1803, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting ''game'' but I believe the background is creating a little distraction for me... I''m not sure what camera you are using but a more shallow depth of field would possibly blur this out some and allow more attention for the main subjects of this shot... good work!</td>', 'This is an interesting ''game'' but I believe the background is creating a little distraction for me... I''m not sure what camera you are using but a more shallow depth of field would possibly blur this out some and allow more attention for the main subjects of this shot... good work!', '2002-05-22 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
