(64274, 1806, 244, '<td valign="top">I like the movement of the hand in this shot, makes it look like the game is in progress, but there is too much out of focus in this shot, the out of focus piece in front keeps getting my attention distracting me from the rest of the picture.</td>', 'I like the movement of the hand in this shot, makes it look like the game is in progress, but there is too much out of focus in this shot, the out of focus piece in front keeps getting my attention distracting me from the rest of the picture.', '2002-05-21 23:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
