(64277, 1806, 1078, '<td valign="top">I like the oranges and blues in this.  I''m not sure why you went with the motion blur on this one -- not that I have a problem with it, but because I can''t tell what you''re doing, what''s being moved.  Dice?  A playing piece?  Also, the anchor point of the image seems to be the medusa-like figure in the center of the foreground, but it''s in front of the focal plane and slightly out of focus.  Either a smaller aperture, or different focal point is needed, in my opinion.</td>', 'I like the oranges and blues in this.  I''m not sure why you went with the motion blur on this one -- not that I have a problem with it, but because I can''t tell what you''re doing, what''s being moved.  Dice?  A playing piece?  Also, the anchor point of the image seems to be the medusa-like figure in the center of the foreground, but it''s in front of the focal plane and slightly out of focus.  Either a smaller aperture, or different focal point is needed, in my opinion.', '2002-05-23 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64278, 1806, 1128, '<td valign="top">Good perpective.  I''m wondering about the hand--I can''t decide if the bluriness (movement) is distracting or not, but overall I like the colors and composition.</td>', 'Good perpective.  I''m wondering about the hand--I can''t decide if the bluriness (movement) is distracting or not, but overall I like the colors and composition.', '2002-05-25 09:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64279, 1806, 527, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the hand movement. It looks too fast for a game that I consider very slow. I love the color and detail.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the hand movement. It looks too fast for a game that I consider very slow. I love the color and detail.', '2002-05-26 02:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64280, 1806, 543, '<td valign="top">Good game, if you''ve got nothing to do for the next day and a half.  The spearchucker is just ahead of the field of focus - bummer.  Motion blur on the fingers detracts, too.</td>', 'Good game, if you''ve got nothing to do for the next day and a half.  The spearchucker is just ahead of the field of focus - bummer.  Motion blur on the fingers detracts, too.', '2002-05-26 03:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
