(64337, 1811, 885, '<td valign="top">Cute expression and great colors.  It looks like the focus is more on his hands and the table than his face though.  The monitor in the background and the thing sticking in from the left are unfortunate distractions.  Maybe you could have tried cropping vertically?</td>', 'Cute expression and great colors.  It looks like the focus is more on his hands and the table than his face though.  The monitor in the background and the thing sticking in from the left are unfortunate distractions.  Maybe you could have tried cropping vertically?', '2002-05-20 09:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64338, 1811, 47, '<td valign="top">your kid looks like an ewok</td>', 'your kid looks like an ewok', '2002-05-20 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64339, 1811, 1379, '<td valign="top">Love this expression!!</td>', 'Love this expression!!', '2002-05-20 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64340, 1811, 327, '<td valign="top">Priceless expression! Handsome youngman.<br/>The background is far too busy, maybe a higher F stop would of helped here.</td>', 'Priceless expression! Handsome youngman.The background is far too busy, maybe a higher F stop would of helped here.', '2002-05-20 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64341, 1811, 587, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t sound be a great option here. :) I wish his face wasn''t quite so fuzzy, though it appears he''s moving, so no easy task I''m sure. and if he was turned, so that a blank wall was the backdrop....hindsite, isn''t it great? cute photo.</td>', 'Wouldn''t sound be a great option here. :) I wish his face wasn''t quite so fuzzy, though it appears he''s moving, so no easy task I''m sure. and if he was turned, so that a blank wall was the backdrop....hindsite, isn''t it great? cute photo.', '2002-05-20 12:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64342, 1811, 772, '<td valign="top">If those are pinewood derby cars on top of your computer monitor, I would have loved to seen something done with those!  I was a pinewood derby regional champ when I was in cub scouts!  The subject of this photo is cute indeed, but the overall appeal of a ''gaming'' concept here is a little weak for me.  There''s not enough of the game in view to really grab my interest...</td>', 'If those are pinewood derby cars on top of your computer monitor, I would have loved to seen something done with those!  I was a pinewood derby regional champ when I was in cub scouts!  The subject of this photo is cute indeed, but the overall appeal of a ''gaming'' concept here is a little weak for me.  There''s not enough of the game in view to really grab my interest...', '2002-05-20 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64343, 1811, 616, '<td valign="top">i see your using the cute factor in this shot</td>', 'i see your using the cute factor in this shot', '2002-05-20 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64344, 1811, 1446, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful face!</td>', 'What a wonderful face!', '2002-05-20 19:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64345, 1811, 724, '<td valign="top">Great expression, to bad you wern''t able to get better focus on the face.</td>', 'Great expression, to bad you wern''t able to get better focus on the face.', '2002-05-20 19:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64346, 1811, 509, '<td valign="top">Interesting expression.  I''m not fond of the background though, it is too distracting (this may be out of your control) I would have at least turned the computer monitor off and gotten the paper out of the printer.</td>', 'Interesting expression.  I''m not fond of the background though, it is too distracting (this may be out of your control) I would have at least turned the computer monitor off and gotten the paper out of the printer.', '2002-05-20 22:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64347, 1811, 1041, '<td valign="top">His expression is priceless!  Unfortunately, it''s not in focus, the front of the picture is.  The background is also a little too cluttered (albeit out of focus and therefore not sooo terrible), and I understand that these kind of candids will always have that.</td>', 'His expression is priceless!  Unfortunately, it''s not in focus, the front of the picture is.  The background is also a little too cluttered (albeit out of focus and therefore not sooo terrible), and I understand that these kind of candids will always have that.', '2002-05-21 08:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64348, 1811, 1078, '<td valign="top">If only you''d got the focus on the face instead of the hands.  Such a great expression.  I think a vertical format would have helped this picture as well.  Especially one where you shot it that way originally and could have gotten more of the foosball table in the lower end of the picture.  As it stands, however, even cropping it vertically would help minimize some of the distracting elelments around him and help focus attention on the subject.</td>', 'If only you''d got the focus on the face instead of the hands.  Such a great expression.  I think a vertical format would have helped this picture as well.  Especially one where you shot it that way originally and could have gotten more of the foosball table in the lower end of the picture.  As it stands, however, even cropping it vertically would help minimize some of the distracting elelments around him and help focus attention on the subject.', '2002-05-21 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64349, 1811, 1175, '<td valign="top">Your focus tells me that the game is the subject but its all the way at the bottom of the frame and you have so much more going on here.  I think a better shot would have had the kids focus as well so that we could clearly see his expression, which by the way is great.  The rest of the background is very distracting.</td>', 'Your focus tells me that the game is the subject but its all the way at the bottom of the frame and you have so much more going on here.  I think a better shot would have had the kids focus as well so that we could clearly see his expression, which by the way is great.  The rest of the background is very distracting.', '2002-05-21 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64350, 1811, 1031, '<td valign="top">"Blast it! I MEANT kickoff!"</td>', '"Blast it! I MEANT kickoff!"', '2002-05-21 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64351, 1811, 1712, '<td valign="top">Thats a funny picture.  Nice face expresion!!l LOL!!!!</td>', 'Thats a funny picture.  Nice face expresion!!l LOL!!!!', '2002-05-21 21:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64352, 1811, 1054, '<td valign="top">That is soooo cute!</td>', 'That is soooo cute!', '2002-05-22 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64353, 1811, 842, '<td valign="top">wow- he''s either excited or constipated.=)</td>', 'wow- he''s either excited or constipated.=)', '2002-05-22 20:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64354, 1811, 1336, '<td valign="top">slightly out of focus... too much clutter in the background</td>', 'slightly out of focus... too much clutter in the background', '2002-05-23 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64355, 1811, 573, '<td valign="top">"The intensity is critical, Captain.  Stand back he''s going to explode!"  I Love it, too bad the background is so distracting.  The Pinewood Derby Cars on the computer monitor are a nice touch.</td>', '"The intensity is critical, Captain.  Stand back he''s going to explode!"  I Love it, too bad the background is so distracting.  The Pinewood Derby Cars on the computer monitor are a nice touch.', '2002-05-23 11:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64356, 1811, 1195, '<td valign="top">CUTE KID!!! A different backround would make the picture alot better though. Keep the kid in it to he''s cute!!!</td>', 'CUTE KID!!! A different backround would make the picture alot better though. Keep the kid in it to he''s cute!!!', '2002-05-23 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64357, 1811, 1202, '<td valign="top">Intense play and concentration is what this picture depicts to me.   I wish you could have included the childs face in your DOF with the game.   With a cleaner background and focus this would be a killer photo.</td>', 'Intense play and concentration is what this picture depicts to me.   I wish you could have included the childs face in your DOF with the game.   With a cleaner background and focus this would be a killer photo.', '2002-05-24 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64358, 1811, 689, '<td valign="top">The background seems a little cluttered and the boy is out of focus slightly.</td>', 'The background seems a little cluttered and the boy is out of focus slightly.', '2002-05-24 23:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64359, 1811, 1066, '<td valign="top">He''s jsut so gosh darn cute but...less elements in background would be nicer.<br/><br/>Pluse..he seems a bit out of foucs.  Maybe a tad faster shutter, big aperature but the light looks powerful enough.<br/><br/>His sweater colors match the foosball talbe well.  Maybe him actually at the table handes with angles to cut a lot of background out to help focus attention on the child and the talbe more.<br/><br/>I like the elements and the huge potential this shot has.</td>', 'He''s jsut so gosh darn cute but...less elements in background would be nicer.Pluse..he seems a bit out of foucs.  Maybe a tad faster shutter, big aperature but the light looks powerful enough.His sweater colors match the foosball talbe well.  Maybe him actually at the table handes with angles to cut a lot of background out to help focus attention on the child and the talbe more.I like the elements and the huge potential this shot has.', '2002-05-25 11:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64360, 1811, 811, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this little guys expression.  Absolutely precious.  Would black and white have toned down the background any?  Of course then, you would''ve lost the nice red/blue contrast in the front.</td>', 'I LOVE this little guys expression.  Absolutely precious.  Would black and white have toned down the background any?  Of course then, you would''ve lost the nice red/blue contrast in the front.', '2002-05-27 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64361, 1811, 1, '<td valign="top">There''s a little blur on the child''s face, probably from his spasming.  A faster shutter could''ve fixed that right up.</td>', 'There''s a little blur on the child''s face, probably from his spasming.  A faster shutter could''ve fixed that right up.', '2002-05-27 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64362, 1812, 1647, '<td valign="top">This photo is one of few which makes me want to play the sport...  The harsh lighting at an aggressive angle adds interest and the black and white effect adds to the dramatic effect.  Well done.</td>', 'This photo is one of few which makes me want to play the sport...  The harsh lighting at an aggressive angle adds interest and the black and white effect adds to the dramatic effect.  Well done.', '2002-05-20 01:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64363, 1812, 1336, '<td valign="top">nice photo.  good lighting</td>', 'nice photo.  good lighting', '2002-05-20 07:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64364, 1812, 885, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting and choice of black and white.</td>', 'Interesting lighting and choice of black and white.', '2002-05-20 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64365, 1812, 327, '<td valign="top">Gosh I almost like this a lot. I mean I do like it, just wish the crop was more on the bottom. This is an interesting photo, good work. Love the b&amp;w.</td>', 'Gosh I almost like this a lot. I mean I do like it, just wish the crop was more on the bottom. This is an interesting photo, good work. Love the b&w.', '2002-05-20 14:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64366, 1812, 1748, '<td valign="top">great lighting but losing the dart ending let it down some</td>', 'great lighting but losing the dart ending let it down some', '2002-05-20 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64367, 1812, 1569, '<td valign="top">This needs more than one light source.</td>', 'This needs more than one light source.', '2002-05-20 17:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64368, 1812, 1549, '<td valign="top">I like the lines and curves contrast here.  Good angle too!</td>', 'I like the lines and curves contrast here.  Good angle too!', '2002-05-20 18:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64369, 1812, 449, '<td valign="top">My old boyfriend was a dart champion (like 8th in the world or something) and  he would go ape shit over this photo. Awesome!!! perfect 10.</td>', 'My old boyfriend was a dart champion (like 8th in the world or something) and  he would go ape shit over this photo. Awesome!!! perfect 10.', '2002-05-20 23:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64370, 1812, 301, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W doesn''t work for me here.  The dart is hard to distinguish</td>', 'B&W doesn''t work for me here.  The dart is hard to distinguish', '2002-05-21 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64371, 1812, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting lighting for a dart board.  I believe that there could be a little more contrast between the dart and the board to make it stand out a little more.  The dart on the bullseye is being swallowed by the surrounding colors...</td>', 'This is an interesting lighting for a dart board.  I believe that there could be a little more contrast between the dart and the board to make it stand out a little more.  The dart on the bullseye is being swallowed by the surrounding colors...', '2002-05-21 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64372, 1812, 1446, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea. Can''t quite put my finger on why the lighting is bothering me to some degree.  I think its because it is so harsh at the lower left and so dark in other places.  Sorry, not a great comment, but I am kind of learning how to do this constructivly.</td>', 'I really like this idea. Can''t quite put my finger on why the lighting is bothering me to some degree.  I think its because it is so harsh at the lower left and so dark in other places.  Sorry, not a great comment, but I am kind of learning how to do this constructivly.', '2002-05-21 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64373, 1812, 1009, '<td valign="top">Very nice, the lighting is harsh and I like it, works very well with the black and white... good job</td>', 'Very nice, the lighting is harsh and I like it, works very well with the black and white... good job', '2002-05-21 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64374, 1812, 1054, '<td valign="top">I think the shadows are just a bit too stark in this otherwise great shot.</td>', 'I think the shadows are just a bit too stark in this otherwise great shot.', '2002-05-22 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64375, 1812, 1005, '<td valign="top">Toss up, appears too dark, but with killer glare.  I like the shadows, but try different lighting, maybe less harse lights.<br/>Photo 6 Creativity 6 Games 6 total 6</td>', 'Toss up, appears too dark, but with killer glare.  I like the shadows, but try different lighting, maybe less harse lights.Photo 6 Creativity 6 Games 6 total 6', '2002-05-22 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64376, 1812, 1597, '<td valign="top">to much light and shadow</td>', 'to much light and shadow', '2002-05-22 20:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64377, 1812, 1041, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of the shots where color would worked better than b&amp;w, at least IMO.  The lighting is a little bit too harsh, too light in the middle, too dark on the edges.  I do like the angle and composition of the shot.</td>', 'I think this is one of the shots where color would worked better than b&w, at least IMO.  The lighting is a little bit too harsh, too light in the middle, too dark on the edges.  I do like the angle and composition of the shot.', '2002-05-23 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64378, 1812, 332, '<td valign="top">Good job on the black and white.</td>', 'Good job on the black and white.', '2002-05-23 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64379, 1812, 1793, '<td valign="top">i absolutely love the high contrast. while i''m usually not a fan of centre-based composition, works well for the s.m. here. :)</td>', 'i absolutely love the high contrast. while i''m usually not a fan of centre-based composition, works well for the s.m. here. :)', '2002-05-23 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(64380, 1812, 689, '<td valign="top">Might have done a little direct lighting on the dart ... the other lighting is interesting ... kinda harsh, but different</td>', 'Might have done a little direct lighting on the dart ... the other lighting is interesting ... kinda harsh, but different', '2002-05-24 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64381, 1812, 543, '<td valign="top">Nice high contrast B/W.  Could stand a L and bottom crop to get the bullseye better placed?</td>', 'Nice high contrast B/W.  Could stand a L and bottom crop to get the bullseye better placed?', '2002-05-25 04:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64382, 1812, 1822, '<td valign="top">great idea, but i think your lighting could have been much better</td>', 'great idea, but i think your lighting could have been much better', '2002-05-25 09:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64383, 1812, 1066, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and nice use of Black and White to accent the shot.  A little dark on my monitor around the dart and I think that may be a problem as I have my monitor set brighter than most.  But overall a quality shot.</td>', 'Good lighting and nice use of Black and White to accent the shot.  A little dark on my monitor around the dart and I think that may be a problem as I have my monitor set brighter than most.  But overall a quality shot.', '2002-05-25 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64384, 1812, 637, '<td valign="top">Great use of b&amp;w... Blows away the other dart images for me.</td>', 'Great use of b&w... Blows away the other dart images for me.', '2002-05-26 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64385, 1812, 1, '<td valign="top">So close to being awesome lighting, I just don''t like the shadow on the top left/bottom right.  The saturated black/white look is great.</td>', 'So close to being awesome lighting, I just don''t like the shadow on the top left/bottom right.  The saturated black/white look is great.', '2002-05-27 00:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64386, 1813, 327, '<td valign="top">Good good composition, color and focus is a bit off. Nice job.</td>', 'Good good composition, color and focus is a bit off. Nice job.', '2002-05-20 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64387, 1813, 92, '<td valign="top">This scored high with me . The only change I would make is to crop off that right side of the trees and stop sign.</td>', 'This scored high with me . The only change I would make is to crop off that right side of the trees and stop sign.', '2002-05-20 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64388, 1813, 301, '<td valign="top">great position for this shot.  Slightly tilted.  I did a quick rotate and crop, leaving the top of the bat in the left corner, and took out the 400 sign (yeah that cuts off the catcher a bit, but he''s not really that important to the photo).  IMO it seemed to make a better composition.</td>', 'great position for this shot.  Slightly tilted.  I did a quick rotate and crop, leaving the top of the bat in the left corner, and took out the 400 sign (yeah that cuts off the catcher a bit, but he''s not really that important to the photo).  IMO it seemed to make a better composition.', '2002-05-21 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64389, 1813, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice action capture!  I know this was impossible from your perspective, but the shot would be really great if the pitcher was more in view between the umpire and the batter... = 8</td>', 'Nice action capture!  I know this was impossible from your perspective, but the shot would be really great if the pitcher was more in view between the umpire and the batter... = 8', '2002-05-21 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64390, 1813, 1175, '<td valign="top">My first guess is going to be that you are on a mac because this picture looks a bit dark on my pc.  Once its brightened and you add a little contrast it looks great.  You have great DOF, but I''m not sure if I like the angle.  its definitely different.</td>', 'My first guess is going to be that you are on a mac because this picture looks a bit dark on my pc.  Once its brightened and you add a little contrast it looks great.  You have great DOF, but I''m not sure if I like the angle.  its definitely different.', '2002-05-21 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64391, 1813, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice.  There weren''t too many sport shots (and I''m guilty of not submitting one, too), so this makes a nice change.  I like the framing, too.  A couple of things to consider next time are that the photo doesn''t seem to be quite level, and (if that was possible) to move a little further to the right so that the whole background is the screen, and not the stopsign and trees poking through on the right.  That would''ve also given you a slightly more sideways view of the player in the front of the photo.</td>', 'Nice.  There weren''t too many sport shots (and I''m guilty of not submitting one, too), so this makes a nice change.  I like the framing, too.  A couple of things to consider next time are that the photo doesn''t seem to be quite level, and (if that was possible) to move a little further to the right so that the whole background is the screen, and not the stopsign and trees poking through on the right.  That would''ve also given you a slightly more sideways view of the player in the front of the photo.', '2002-05-21 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64392, 1813, 1446, '<td valign="top">You get 1 extra point for being brave enough to stand where you did to take this picture.  Its too bad the real world creeped in on the upper right.  This shot would have been a lot better without that.</td>', 'You get 1 extra point for being brave enough to stand where you did to take this picture.  Its too bad the real world creeped in on the upper right.  This shot would have been a lot better without that.', '2002-05-21 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64393, 1813, 1078, '<td valign="top">This is a well timed shot, but the colors seem very strange.  I thnk it needs some levels work in an editing program.  The horison line is also a little crooked -- I''d suggest rotating it slightly clockwise.</td>', 'This is a well timed shot, but the colors seem very strange.  I thnk it needs some levels work in an editing program.  The horison line is also a little crooked -- I''d suggest rotating it slightly clockwise.', '2002-05-21 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64394, 1813, 1597, '<td valign="top">Wish I was at the ball game, nice view</td>', 'Wish I was at the ball game, nice view', '2002-05-21 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64395, 1813, 244, '<td valign="top">I like this shot overall, but there are 2 distractions in it for me, first of all the color is not that good, I tried to fix it in photoshop but it was still too contrasty, second and this will sound strange but it would keep this picture from being published in a newspaper or magazine without airbrushing it out, that buldge in the front of the batters pants has to go.</td>', 'I like this shot overall, but there are 2 distractions in it for me, first of all the color is not that good, I tried to fix it in photoshop but it was still too contrasty, second and this will sound strange but it would keep this picture from being published in a newspaper or magazine without airbrushing it out, that buldge in the front of the batters pants has to go.', '2002-05-21 23:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64396, 1813, 1054, '<td valign="top">I love baseball, and this is a great angle, however the image seems a bit flat.</td>', 'I love baseball, and this is a great angle, however the image seems a bit flat.', '2002-05-22 08:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64397, 1813, 741, '<td valign="top">Great action shot - shame about the trees on the right which are distracting</td>', 'Great action shot - shame about the trees on the right which are distracting', '2002-05-22 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64398, 1813, 878, '<td valign="top">Nice angle for this shot.  The whites are a bit off, almost looked solarized.</td>', 'Nice angle for this shot.  The whites are a bit off, almost looked solarized.', '2002-05-22 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64399, 1813, 1336, '<td valign="top">the contrast seems a bit off in this photo.  also, this probably should have been rotated clockwise and cropped before submission.  it''s a good idea and i think if you had taken a lot of photos, you might have found one that worked a little better.</td>', 'the contrast seems a bit off in this photo.  also, this probably should have been rotated clockwise and cropped before submission.  it''s a good idea and i think if you had taken a lot of photos, you might have found one that worked a little better.', '2002-05-23 09:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64400, 1813, 527, '<td valign="top">this could have been cropped tighter so the far background beyond the wall didn''t show and tilted so the wall line is level. Still a very good picture.</td>', 'this could have been cropped tighter so the far background beyond the wall didn''t show and tilted so the wall line is level. Still a very good picture.', '2002-05-26 03:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64401, 1813, 1, '<td valign="top">Seems too dark / over-exposed at the same time.  A lot of work on your lighting needs to be done.  It looks like you over-exposed it in the camera and tried to darken it afterwards.  You should''ve tried to retake the shot.</td>', 'Seems too dark / over-exposed at the same time.  A lot of work on your lighting needs to be done.  It looks like you over-exposed it in the camera and tried to darken it afterwards.  You should''ve tried to retake the shot.', '2002-05-26 09:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64402, 1814, 113, '<td valign="top">I like the angle you put on this, its the glare from the lights you used.  Different lighting would have made a big difference.</td>', 'I like the angle you put on this, its the glare from the lights you used.  Different lighting would have made a big difference.', '2002-05-20 03:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64403, 1814, 1379, '<td valign="top">So clever!</td>', 'So clever!', '2002-05-20 07:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64404, 1814, 47, '<td valign="top">ha.</td>', 'ha.', '2002-05-20 07:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64405, 1814, 1336, '<td valign="top">maybe it''s just me, but i dont like seeing "DP Challenge" in the photos.  It almost seems like you''re trying to get brownie points.  personally i think it detracts from the photo and it feels like pandering.</td>', 'maybe it''s just me, but i dont like seeing "DP Challenge" in the photos.  It almost seems like you''re trying to get brownie points.  personally i think it detracts from the photo and it feels like pandering.', '2002-05-20 07:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64406, 1814, 885, '<td valign="top">I think if you''d used matte paper, the reflections of the dice and the metal piece wouldn''t show so much.  It''s kind of strange hoe the image drops off toward the back, it looks like the game doesn''t continue...</td>', 'I think if you''d used matte paper, the reflections of the dice and the metal piece wouldn''t show so much.  It''s kind of strange hoe the image drops off toward the back, it looks like the game doesn''t continue...', '2002-05-20 09:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64407, 1814, 259, '<td valign="top">very creative making it more than just monopoly</td>', 'very creative making it more than just monopoly', '2002-05-20 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64408, 1814, 1446, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a little harsh on the board to me, but its perfect on the dice.</td>', 'The lighting seems a little harsh on the board to me, but its perfect on the dice.', '2002-05-20 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64409, 1814, 587, '<td valign="top">clever, suck up. ;) Great imagination - like this one.</td>', 'clever, suck up. ;) Great imagination - like this one.', '2002-05-20 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
