(64413, 1814, 301, '<td valign="top">he he ... DP Challenge - the most expensive on the board - are we playing the rules that if your roll a double you don''t have to pay? :)  The B&amp;W doesn''t really do it for me on this photo.  Also would have liked to have seen the properties past  ''Luxury Tax''.  The blankness  is very apparent to me.  Dice and money on the side are good, but I don''t think the bits at the top were required</td>', 'he he ... DP Challenge - the most expensive on the board - are we playing the rules that if your roll a double you don''t have to pay? :)  The B&W doesn''t really do it for me on this photo.  Also would have liked to have seen the properties past  ''Luxury Tax''.  The blankness  is very apparent to me.  Dice and money on the side are good, but I don''t think the bits at the top were required', '2002-05-21 07:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
